<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZK" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Ezekiyɛle</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezekiyɛle Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezekiyɛle</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ezk</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ezekiyɛle</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Ezekiyɛle Ná-Sɛʋɛi ɠa ga GALA goo zɛʋɛi é lo Izilayɛle loo vai ʋa bu, ta buzeɠe vai ʋolu. Nii kpein nu a kwɛɛ Ezekiyɛle ɓɔɠɔi ná-faa zu, naa pɛ ka zɔlɔɔsu sɛʋɛi nii ɓɔɠɔi nɔ zu. É kɛɛni GALA goo wo botii zu ga kona ʋuufelegɔ maazu felegɔ (22), kona dɔfela aisa Zeluzalɛme ʋa ɠoloɠolo, kona undɔɔlugɔ puulɔsaʋa maazu lɔzitai (586) ma aisa Yesu Kilista ʋa zɔlɔɔ, ta é kona puugɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (15) ɠiligaa ɠɛɛni Zeluzalɛme koloɠologai ʋoluma. GALA ge ɠɛni Ezekiyɛle ma kɛni poogiti pɔ, é faa mɔinmɔin gaalɛɛ ga pagɔ, fai niiti ti ʋaazu zeelizu Izilayɛle ma. Naama ʋoogi gila ka gaaɠwɛsu lɔɔlugɔi zu, ʋɛ GALA ge ɠɛɛzu ná, é kpɛlɛi wo, é ma leɠai ɠaaɠwɛ su ga saʋagɔ, é dɛɛ naa ʋɔ ga fai nii é ʋaazu zeelizu Zeluzalɛme ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 5:1-17">5:1-17</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ezekiyɛle Ná-Sɛʋɛi ɠaaɠwɛɛʋɛ su ga saʋagɔ: Izilayɛle lukpɔɠaaleʋe vai, Izilayɛle maaɠoolizu zii ɠiligiti tukpɔɠaaleʋe vai, ta Izilayɛle zei vai ʋolu ga niinɛ. Naama vaiti pɛ su, woo ɓii gola ɠila ka ná, naa ɠa ga naama vaiti ta ɓɔ ade ʋa ɠale, ade GALA kwɛɛ. Ezekiyɛle Ná-Sɛʋɛi zu, mɔinʋɛ puulɔzita (60) ma, é ɗa niima woo ɠilagi zɛʋɛ: «Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.» É ɠɛni ga GALA ge ná-nuɓusɛiti lukpɔɠaaleʋe, ɓaa é ti zei ʋele ɓɛtɛ ʋolu, ada zoo kalagi zɔlɔɔsu, é lo tɔun ba, ta nii wɔin ma ada-vaa zu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. GALA ka Izilayɛle lukpɔɠaaleʋe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 1:1-24:27">1:1—24:27</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. GALA ka zii ɠiligiti tukpɔɠaaleʋe, niiti ti Izilayɛle maaɠoolizu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 25:1-32:32">25:1—32:32</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ezekiyɛle GALA gooi woni é lo Izilayɛle zei vai ʋa ʋolu ga niinɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 33:1-48:35">33:1—48:35</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZK 1"/>
  <para style="ms1">Izilayɛle Lukpɔɠaaleʋe Vai</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="EZK 1:1-24:27">1:1—24:27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠula vai kɛlɛma <optbreak/> Ezekiyɛle ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 1:1"/>Kona ʋuuzaʋasiɛi (30) ma alu naanigɔi ma volo lɔɔlugɔi ma, gè ɠɛni Zuifuiti saama niiti ti ti ɠulani zooi ʋa, gi ziɛ wolai Keɓaal ɠobaʋɛ. Geeɠɔlɔgi laalaoni, GALA ge kulakɛlɛmaiti teʋeni mà. <verse eid="EZK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 1:2"/>Masagi Yeɠoyakin ná-kona dɔɔlusiɛi ma kasoi ɠa, <verse eid="EZK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 1:3"/>miná, Ɓaɓilɔne nuiti ta-yooi zu, ziɛ wolai Keɓaal ɠobaʋɛ ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀ ná, ná-zɛbɛi yei mà, nà Ezekiyɛle, zalaɠa ɠula nui Ɓuzi ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="EZK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 1:4"/>Gè wɛlɛni, gaamanɔ gè tɔngɔlɔ fiilɛi ɠa, é ɗa zeɠe ga lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, é ɗa zɔɔ tonaɓiin golai ʋa, mainmain ɗa saɠa su. Tonaɓiingi naa maalatini ga wozakalagi, é ɗa nu ɠaazuɓɔi. Saamaʋɛ zu ɠɛni volozu eɠɛ kɔlu ɓɔigi é abui ɠa. <verse eid="EZK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 1:5"/>Zaamazuʋɛ tɔna nɔ, zɛnvu ani naanigɔ ɠɛni ná, ti vulua, ti ɠulaai ga nuɓusɛi. <verse eid="EZK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 1:6"/>Gaazuʋɛ ɠɛni ti ɠilagilagi ʋa ga naanigɔ, koʋegi ɠɛ ti ɠilagilagi ʋa ga naanigɔ. <verse eid="EZK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 1:7"/>Ti-ɠɔɠɔiti ti zɔleni, ti-ɠɔɠɔzapalagiti ti ɠɛni ga nikɛ yiʋo zinɛi ʋolokagi ɠɛʋele, ti ɗa volo eɠɛ kɔlu ɓɔigi kpɛlɛai. <verse eid="EZK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 1:8"/>Nuɓusɛi yeei ɠɛni ti naanigɔ pɛ ti ɠoʋegiti bu, ʋepema naanigɔi pɛ ma. Ti naanigɔiti pɛ ɛsɛ gaazu ɠɛni ba ta koʋegiti. <verse eid="EZK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 1:9"/>Ti-ɠoʋegiti ti ɠɛni loni ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, ti ɠɛni zɔlesu, ti ɗa li ga ɠakala ʋelei, ti la ɠɛni ti-ɓusɛi latisu. <verse eid="EZK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 1:10"/>Ti-ɠaazuʋɛ ɠulani ga zunu ɠaazuʋɛ, zala ɠaazui ɠɛni ti naanigɔ pɛ ba ti yeezazuʋɛ, nikɛ zinɛ ɠaazui ɠɛ ti ʋa ti ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, koɠɛ ɠaazui ɠɛ ti ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 1:11"/>Ti-ɠoʋegiti felegɔi ti lɛɛni geezu ʋelei, naati ti ʋilini ɓɔɠɔ zu, ti ɗa ti-ɓusɛiti maalɔɔɠu ga felegɔiti. <verse eid="EZK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 1:12"/>Ti ɠilagilagiti pɛ ti ɠɛni zɔlesu, ti ɗa li ga ɠakala ʋelei, ti ɗa li ʋɛ ʋele zɛnvui ɠɛni liizu ga tiye ná, ti ɓɛdɛ la ba ga ti lati. <verse eid="EZK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 1:13"/>Nu ɠɛni abulekaiti kaazu zɛnvu aniiti saama, ti ɗa ɲiikpi eɠɛ sɔmɔgi ma ziiti. Abui ɠɛni nu ɠaazuɓɔizu, ta mainmain ɠɛni ɠulazu su, é ɗa vaza. <verse eid="EZK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 1:14"/>Zɛnvu anii naati ti ɠɛni ɓizɛzu, ti ɗa li, ti ɗa ʋa ga suvilɛi, eɠɛ geeɓadɛi.<verse eid="EZK 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 1:15"/>Gè wɛlɛni zɛnvu anii naati ba, gè ani ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligi ɠaa ti ɠilagilagi ɠobaʋɛ, é zei zooi ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 1:16"/>Ma ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠili naanigɔi pɛ ge ɠɛni ga ɠɛʋele, ti ɗa volo ga kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagi ɠɛʋele. Ti ɠulani ga ʋe, ti ɓɛtɛni, ti lɔ ɓɔɠɔ zu ti pɛ. <verse eid="EZK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 1:17"/>Ta la ɠɛna ziaa, ta la zoo liizu ʋepema naanigɔiti pɛ. Ʋɛ ná nɛai ti ʋɛ, miná ʋele ɠa ti ɠɛni liizu la, ti ɓɛdɛ la ba ga ti ʋa lati. <verse eid="EZK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 1:18"/>Ma ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti niiti ti ɠɛni zeizu ti ɠa, naati gaaɠoozani nu ɗa lua ba, ti-ɠaazuɠɛzɛiti ti ti maaʋɛ pɛ. <verse eid="EZK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 1:19"/>Siɛgi zu zɛnvu aniiti ta la ɠɛna ziaa la, ti-ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti ti ɠɛni latisu ti ɠoba. Ta la wuzeɠena zooi ma, ti-ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti ti wuzeɠe ɓalaa. <verse eid="EZK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 1:20"/>Ʋɛ zɛnvui a la ɠɛ ti li ná, miná ɠa ti ɠɛni liizu ná. Ti ɠɛni ɓaɠasu ʋɔɔma nɔ ta ti-ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti, mazɔlɔɔ zɛnvui é ɠɛni zɛnvu aniiti su, naa nɔ ɠa é ɠɛni ma ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti su. <verse eid="EZK 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 1:21"/>Siɛgi zu zɛnvu aniiti ta la ɠɛna lia la, ɓaa ti lo, ɓaa ti wuzeɠe, ti zɛlɛ zooi maazu, ma ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti ti ɓena kɛ ga ti ɠɛʋele, ti li, ɓaa ti lo, ɓaa ti wuzeɠe, ti zɛlɛ zooi maazu, mazɔlɔɔ zɛnvui é ɠɛni zɛnvu aniiti devezu, tɔnɔ ɠa é ɠɛni ma ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti devezu ɓalaa.<verse eid="EZK 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 1:22"/>Anii ta ɠɛni zɛlɛni zɛnvu aniiti tɔungi maazu, eɠɛ geei ɠaaʋɛ, é ɗa volo gola eɠɛ sanu ʋɛɛlɛi. <verse eid="EZK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 1:23"/>Geei ɠaaʋɛ tɔna bu, zɛnvu ani ɠilagilagi pɛ ge ɠoʋe felegɔiti sumaaleni, ti ti zei da ta zɔiti, tama felegɔi zɔiti, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ maalɔɔɠu ga naati. <verse eid="EZK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 1:24"/>Gè ti-ɠoʋegi lugi mɛnini, siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni ɠoʋesu da. Maalugi ɠɛni eɠɛ kpoloɗɛi lugi, eɠɛ GALA Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi, ɓaa mu eɠɛ kɔɔɠɔ nuiti ti mɔinɗa gola, ti zɔngɔ wooi. Ta la lona, ti-ɠoʋegiti pɛɛ su. <verse eid="EZK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 1:25"/>Geei ɠaaʋɛ é ɠɛni zɛlɛni ti maazuʋɛ, naa maazuʋɛ, zɔngɔ wooi ɠɛni miná ɓalaa.<verse eid="EZK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 1:26"/>Geei ɠaaʋɛ tɔna maazuʋɛ, anii ta ɠɛni ná eɠɛ kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagi é ga ma ɓiinii, kɛai eɠɛ masa kpɔkpɔgi. Naa maazuʋɛ ná ɠaaɠoozaai, anii ɠazaʋigi ta ɠɛni ná, eɠɛ nu vulu. <verse eid="EZK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 1:27"/>Gè anii ɠazaʋigi naa ɠaani é ɗa volo eɠɛ kɔlu ɓɔi maaloungai, maaɠooliai ga abui. Ɗa sɔligi ʋɛtɛna, maazu ʋelei ta buu ʋelei, gè kaani eɠɛ abui ma voloi ɠa kakugai ma. <verse eid="EZK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 1:28"/>Wozakalagi é ɠakuni ma, é ɠulani ga kpazamanamanagi é volozu tonaɓiingi zu, foloi tonai puuzu la. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai é volozu, naa ʋaaɠulabai ɠana. Gè naa ɠaai ma, gè looni zooi ma, gè laaʋɛɛ. Názu ɠa gè nui ta woomɛnini da, é ɗa ɓɔɛ pɔ̀.<verse eid="EZK 1:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ezekiyɛle leʋe fai Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 2:1"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, wuzeɠe, è lo, nà ɓɔɛzu è ʋɔ.» <verse eid="EZK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 2:2"/>Siɛgi zu é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu la pɔ̀ ɠana, GALA Zɛnvui lɔɔni zìimaʋɛ, é bùzeɠe. Zɔi é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀, gè gooi mɛnini.<verse eid="EZK 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 2:3"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, nà ɠa gè è leʋesu Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ bɛ, kololala nuiti, ti wuzeɠeni dàalɔɠɔma. Eɠɛʋelei nɔ ti-mɛmɛwolani ti ɠɛni la, ti la ɠɛni ɓeni kololalai ʋa ga ze. <verse eid="EZK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 2:4"/>Nui niiti ti unsuvɔai, ti ɠigi ɓaa, naati ka gè è leʋesu ti ma, ɗa ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa.› <verse eid="EZK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 2:5"/>Ti woiloni è-woo ma, ɓaa ti ɠɛlɛni, tɔɔzei kololala nuɓusɛiti be, ta kwɛɛ ga GALA goo wo nu ɠa ti zaama.<verse eid="EZK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 2:6"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, mina lua ti ʋa pa, mina lua ta-ɓɔɛzuɠulaiti ba. Ta è zakpe, toɠa ɠɛ eɠɛ ɗa zei ɠaingiti saama, ta akuɠɔtɔkaaliiti. Anɛɛ naa ʋe, ti-laawooi ɓaa ti-ɠaazuʋɛ mina è zasuɓali, tɔɔzei kololala nuɓusɛiti be. <verse eid="EZK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 2:7"/>Ɗa dàawooiti bo ti ma, ti woiloni è-woo ma, ɓaa ti ɠɛlɛni, tɔɔzei kololala nuɓusɛiti be.<verse eid="EZK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 2:8"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, woilo naa ma, gè ʋaazu bosu è ma. Mina ɠɛ ga kololala nu, eɠɛʋelei kololala nuɓusɛi niiti ti la. Laalao, è naa mi, nii gè feezu è ya.»<verse eid="EZK 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sɛʋɛ ɓiligi ma ɠulakɛlɛmai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 2:9"/>Gè wɛlɛni, gè nui yeei maalegai ɠa mà, sɛʋɛ ɓiligi zoni zea. <verse eid="EZK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 2:10"/>É suvieni gàazu, sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛni koozuʋɛ ta poluʋɛ ná felegɔ pɛ. Niiti ti zɛʋɛni su, naati ti ɠɛni ga kpeeiti, ta maawɔin wuyeiti, naa ʋɛɛ kpalagiti ba.<verse eid="EZK 2:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI <optbreak/> nà-GALA goo wo nui iɲɔdɔɔ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 3:1"/>Zɔi é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀, é ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, nii feai è ya, mi, sɛʋɛ ɓiligi tɛi kpɔle, naa ʋolu è li, è ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ.» <verse eid="EZK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 3:2"/>Gè laalaoni, é sɛʋɛ ɓiligi lɔ dà, gè mi. <verse eid="EZK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 3:3"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, è-ɠogi ɠɔnɔkula, è yiɠo ga sɛʋɛ ɓiligi tɛi gè feezu è ya.» Gè miini, é nɛɛni dàaʋɛ eɠɛ kɔin gulɔ.<verse eid="EZK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 3:4"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, li Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ bɛ, è dàawooi wo ti ma. <verse eid="EZK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 3:5"/>Gè la è leʋesu nuɓusaa ma ti zii woo ɠili bosu, ta ti-laawooi ɠaaɠaazu ɓaai, kɛlɛ Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti be. <verse eid="EZK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 3:6"/>Gè la è leʋeni nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔingaa ʋɔ bɛ, ti zii woo ɠili bosu, ta ti-laawooi ɠaaɠaazu ɓaai, nii ɗɔun è la kwɛni. Tama nà la è leʋena naati ma, ta la woilo è-wooi ma. <verse eid="EZK 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 3:7"/>Kɛlɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ti la kɛa ti ʋa woilo è-woo ma, tɔɔzei ti la pɔ ti ʋa woilo gòo ma. Ti unsuvɔɔʋɛ, ti ɠikpa. <verse eid="EZK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 3:8"/>Nà è ɠaazuɓaazu ga ti ɠɛʋele, gè è unsuvɔ ga ti ɠɛʋele. <verse eid="EZK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 3:9"/>Nà è ɠaazuɓaazu ga diamai ɠɛʋele, é ɓaa é leʋe fasai ʋa. Mina lua ti ʋa pa, è zasu mina ɓali ti ɠaazu, anɛɛ ni ta ga kololala nuɓusɛiti.»<verse eid="EZK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 3:10"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, kpɔɛiti kpein gè bosu è ma, woilo ti ma ga è-woiyeɠei, è ti makɛ è-yiimaʋɛ ga pagɔ. <verse eid="EZK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 3:11"/>Li è ma ziiti pɔ bɛ, ti ʋɛ ga kula zou ʋa nuiti. Ti woiloni è-woo ma, ɓaa ti ɠɛlɛni, ɗa ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa.› »<verse eid="EZK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 3:12"/>Zɛnvui bùzeɠeni zooi ma, gè zɔngɔ woo wolai mɛnini pòluʋelei ga: «Tuya ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai ʋɛ, ʋɛ é zeini ná!» <verse eid="EZK 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 3:13"/>Gè zɛnvu aniiti koʋegiti tugi mɛnini, ti ɗa loɠa ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, ta naama ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti ti ti ɠoba, naati tugiti, ta zɔngɔ woo wolai. <verse eid="EZK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 3:14"/>Zɛnvui é bùzeɠeni zooi ma, naa liini ga ze. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-zɛbɛi sòni, gè la zooga gè ʋa ɠula zea. Gè liini, kòozu la nɛɛni, zìiɓɔlɔni. <verse eid="EZK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 3:15"/>Pele ɠana gè zeelini la kula zou ʋa nuiti pɔ bɛ Tɛle-Avive, ti zeini ziɛ wolai Keɓaal ɠobaʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ miná ɠa ti zeini ná. Gè kɛɛni ti ʋɔ bɛ ga folo lɔfela, kìdaaʋilini nɔ ti zaama.<verse eid="EZK 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA goo wo nui é ga gwɛlɛma nui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 3:16"/>Foloi lɔfelasiɛi ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 3:17"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, gè è ɠɛa ga Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti maaɓɛɛ nui. Siɛgi zu wooi ta a ɠula la dà, è mɛni, ɗa Izilayɛle nuiti tɛnɛ da bɛ̀. <verse eid="EZK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 3:18"/>Siɛgi zu gè ɠɛɛzu la faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ma: ‹Ɗa ʋaazu zaazu,› ni è la tɛnɛni, ni è la ɓɔɛni è ʋa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui naa lɛnɛ, è ʋa bo ma ga é ɓe ná-tuʋa ʋele ɲɔi ʋa, é ʋa zɛnvui wo, naazu faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui naa ɠa za ná-faaɠaaza golai vaa zu, kɛlɛ nà ná-saa vai ma ungi maaɠaazaɠabo è ma. <verse eid="EZK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 3:19"/>Kɛlɛ ni ɗa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui lɛnɛna, é la ɓeteʋeni ná-faa ɲɔi ʋa ta ná-tuʋa ʋele ɲɔi, toɠa za ná-faaɠaaza golaiti faa zu, kɛlɛ ɗɔun ɗa, ná-kasɔ la laa è unma, è-yɛnvui maazu ɠa ɓaa.<verse eid="EZK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 3:20"/>«Zenɔ ɠana, ni telebo nui a zeɠena tuʋa ʋele ʋagɔi ʋolu, é ɗa faa ɲɔi ɠɛ, naazu nà kɔɠɔziɠa vai tanigaa la tuɠɔ, ni a zaana tɔɔzei è la tɛnɛni, gaamazu ná-faa ɲɔi vaa ɠa é zaazu su, siɛ ʋele ʋagɔi é boni kaite, nu la mɔ naa ʋɛtɛga, kɛlɛ nà ná-saa vai ma ungi maaɠaazaɠabo è ma. <verse eid="EZK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 3:21"/>Kɛlɛ ni ɗa telebo nui tɔna tɛnɛna ga é mina faa ɲɔu ɠɛ, tama gaamazu, é la faa ɲɔu nɔpɛ kɛɛni, naazu toɠa zɛnvui wo, ɗa-lɛnɛ gooi maaʋele ma é sogai, naazu ɗa ɓalaa, ɗa è-yɛnvui unmɔɔ.»<verse eid="EZK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maaɠɛkpɔ siɛgi zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 3:22"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yeei ɠɛni bà mɔnɔ naama adaʋɛ, é ɠɛ mà: «Wuzeɠe, ɠula, è li pɛtugi zu, miná ɠa gè ɓɔɛzu ná è ʋɔ.» <verse eid="EZK 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 3:23"/>Gè wuzeɠeni deɠɛmu, gè ɠula, gè li pɛtugi ʋɔ pelei. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai ɠulani ná kɛlɛma, eɠɛ nɔ ʋelei gè kaani la ziɛ wolai Keɓaal laaʋɛ. Gè looni zooi ma, gè laaʋɛɛ. <verse eid="EZK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 3:24"/>Zɛnvui ʋaani pɔ̀, é gàalɔ kɔ̀ɠɔiti ga, é ɠɛni mà: «Li, è ɗa-ʋɛlɛi laaɠulu ɓɔɠɔ ma. <verse eid="EZK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 3:25"/>Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ta galui losu è ʋa miná, ti è ɠili, è la zooga ɗa ʋa ɠula kɛlɛzu ɗa-nuɓusɛiti saama. <verse eid="EZK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 3:26"/>Nà è-nɛgi ɠatasu è-laaɠoozuʋɛ ʋa, è ɠɛ ga ɓoɓoi, è la zooga è ʋa zelilo niima nuɓusɛiti ma, mazɔlɔɔ ta ga kololala nuɓusɛiti. <verse eid="EZK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 3:27"/>Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu fai ta a ɠɛ dà la ga gè bo è ma, è bo ti ma, nà kpɔɛ wo zobogi ve è ʋɛ, è ɓɔɛ. Názu ɗa ɓɔɛ ti ʋɔ, è ɠɛ ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa.› Zɔi é wɔinni é woilo ma, é woilo, zɔi é la wɔinni é ʋa woilo ma, é mina woilo ma. Mazɔlɔɔ ta ga kololala nuɓusɛiti.»<verse eid="EZK 3:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ezekiyɛle ta Zeluzalɛme zei vai kɛlɛ su</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 4:1"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɓiliki ɠila seɠe. Da è ɠakalaʋɛ, è taai ma ɠazaʋigi zeɠe ma ga Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="EZK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 4:2"/>Naa ʋolu dɛɛ ga seiʋɛ na kɛlɛ su. Nuiti puuzuʋɛti zeɠei zu, naati kpɛtɛ daalɔɠɔma, pɔlɔ ziɠigiti to daalɔɠɔma, kɔɔlaaɠai ʋuuzuʋɛti ta kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti ti latigai ma. <verse eid="EZK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 4:3"/>Ɗa kɔlu ɠokolo golai zeɠe niina, è to ga siɠigi wo yɔɠɔzu wa taai. Ɠaazulo taai ʋa, seiʋɛ na kɛlɛ su, ɗa ɠa è seizu kɛlɛ su. Naa ɠa é ga poogi Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti bɛ.<verse eid="EZK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 4:4"/>«La naa ʋolu è-ɠɔʋɛi ma, ta è Izilayɛle masadai ná-kotoi ma ɠasɔi la náʋɛ ma. Ta-vaaɠaazagi ma ɠasɔi ɠana è seɠezu foloi liegɔi pɛ daawu è kɛɛzu laani è-yee ɠilagi ma. <verse eid="EZK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 4:5"/>Nà naama voloi liegɔi laazu è ma, naa ɠa é ga Izilayɛle ná-masadai ná-faaɠaaza golai ma ɠonagi liegɔi. Toɠa ga folo unsaʋagɔ puutaaʋuugɔ (390), naa ɠa è kɛɛzu è ɗa ná-faaɠaaza golaiti ma ɠasɔi zeɠe. <verse eid="EZK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 4:6"/>Siɛgi zu è naama voloiti kpesu da, ɗa la è-yeezai ma, ɗa Zuda masadai ná-faaɠaaza golai ma ɠasɔi zeɠe folo ʋuunaanigɔ (40) laawu. Folo ɠilagi ɠa é ga kona gilagi ma ɠasɔi gè daazu è unma. <verse eid="EZK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 4:7"/>Naa ʋolu wɛlɛ Zeluzalɛme ʋa, seiɗai kɛlɛ su, è-yeei maaɲakai letema, è GALA gooi wo daalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="EZK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 4:8"/>Nà ʋaazu è ɠilizu ga galuiti, ga è mina zoo è ʋa lati, è ʋa zeɠe zɔɔma yeei ma, è ʋa la zɔi ma, eyɛsu è ɗa-zeikɛlɛsu voloiti kpe.<verse eid="EZK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 4:9"/>«Moloi zeɠe, ta wɔɔlezegi, ta tɔɠɔ ɓaazagi, ta tɔɠɔ ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛgi, ta suzui, naa ʋɛɛ dɔɔlɔi ʋa, ti pɛ kpɔsu, è pu aniɲakai zu, è kpɛtɛ ga ɓului. Tɔ ɠa é ɠɛɛzu ga è-ɠɔnɔgi folo unsaʋagɔ puutaaʋuugɔ (390) kpein daawu, è kɛɛzu laani yee ma. <verse eid="EZK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 4:10"/>Nii ɗa ɠɛ miizu folo-o-folo, toɠa ɠɛ ga galamu unfelegɔ puufele (220), naa ɠa maanɛai é kula ɠɛ ga ɗe eyɛsu polumai. <verse eid="EZK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 4:11"/>Ɗa-ɓɔɔle ɗɛi liegɔi ɠa ɠɔɠɔsu, toɠa ɠɛ ga litɛlɛ ɠila ɗɛi folo-o-folo. <verse eid="EZK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 4:12"/>È-ɠɔnɔgi ɠa ɠɛ eɠɛ wɔɔlezegi ma ɓului, ɗa gee nuɓusɛiti pɛ gaazu, ma abui laai ga nuɓusɛ ɓooi.» <verse eid="EZK 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 4:13"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛ: «Ʋele ɠana Izilayɛle nuiti ti ʋaazu kɔzɔba laamianigiti miizu la, zou ɠiligiti su, nà ti ɓɛɛna ʋɛti ti liizu náti.»<verse eid="EZK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 4:14"/>Gè kpeei looni, gè ɠɛ ma: «Ee, Màliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, kaipa gè la dɛ ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔni! Kaipa mà loungo yee, eyɛsu za, gè la dɛ saa ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ zua miini, ɓaa suai nii sua ɠili ge paai, kɔzɔba zua nɔpɛ ge la dɛ lɔɔni dàaʋɛ tɛi.» <verse eid="EZK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 4:15"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Wɛlɛ, gè vaa bu è nuɓusɛ ɓooi maavalibo ga nikɛ zaa ma ɓooi, è abui la ga naa, è ɗa-laamianigi ɠili la.» <verse eid="EZK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 4:16"/>É ɠɛni mà mɔnɔ: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, nà daamiani makɛ vaiti koloɠolosu Zeluzalɛme. Ta ɗa daamianigi ɠɔɠɔ ta kpɔɔle ɗɛi pɛ, ti ʋa sɔlɔɔ, ti ɠoozu ɠa ʋili gola. <verse eid="EZK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 4:17"/>Ɓului ta ziɛi ɠa ʋala ná, ti pɛ ti zasu ɠa ɓali gola, ti ɠilagilagi ɠa vɔ, tɔɔzei ta-ɠotoiti faa ʋa.»<verse eid="EZK 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZK 5"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ka ʋaazu Izilayɛle zalazu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 5:1"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, boɠa zɔkpɔ ɠaaligi ta zeɠe, è kɛ ga kpekai. Ɗɔungi wo da ta è-ɓɛlɛi. Naa ʋolu kiloi zeɠe, è ɗɔundeɠai ta è-ma leɠaiti kɔɠɔ ga, è seizei su, é mɔin. <verse eid="EZK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 5:2"/>Siɛgi zu seikɛlɛsu vai ɓesu la, ɗa seizu su saʋa, gilazuʋɛ ɠala abui ɠa taa zaamaʋɛ. È gilazuʋɛ velesiɛi zeɠe, è yɛ doɠazu ga boɠa zɔkpɔi, è taai maalati da. È seizu ɠaaɓelagi zeɠe, è naa vaza fiilɛi zu, nɔ̀un nà ʋilɛ naa ʋolu ga nà-boɠa zɔkpɔi. <verse eid="EZK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 5:3"/>Kɛlɛ tama, ɗa tago zeɠe ba, è pu ɗa-zeɠei la, è makɛ. <verse eid="EZK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 5:4"/>Ɗa ta zeɠe naati ba, è pili abui ɠa, è gala abui ɠa. Abu ɠa ɠula su, nii a so Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠei pɛ ba.»<verse eid="EZK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 5:5"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: «Naa ɠa é ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ga Zeluzalɛme, taa wolai gè pilɛni ziiti saama, gè zou ɠiligiti kɛ maaɠoolii zu. <verse eid="EZK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 5:6"/>Su nuɓusɛiti ti la ɠoloni tɔgiti bɛ ta deveiti gè ti veeni ti ya. Ti faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛni tɔun é leʋe ti ɠoba yooiti ta ti ɠoba nuɓusɛiti ba. Tɔun ti ɠɛlɛni nà-tɔgiti ba, ti ɠɛlɛ ga ti mina ziɛ ga nà-deveiti.» <verse eid="EZK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 5:7"/>Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: «Tɔɔzei wo ɠɛa ga kololala nuiti, wo leʋe zii ɠiligiti ba ti wo-maaɠoolii zu, wo la ɠoloni nà-tɔgiti bɛ, wo la ziɛni ga nà-deveiti, wo luʋa ʋelei la zɔleni vɔlɔ ga wo-maaɠoolii ma nuɓusɛiti kɛʋele, <verse eid="EZK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 5:8"/>naa maaʋele ma, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà ɓalaagi nà wuzeɠezu wo laalɔɠɔma, Zeluzalɛme ʋeaiti. Nà nà-tukpɔɠaaleʋei ɠɛ wo zaama, taa zaamaʋɛ, zii ɠiligiti ti ka ga ɠaazuʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 5:9"/>Nà faa ɠɛ wo laalɔɠɔma, nii gè la dɛ kɛɠala ɠɛɛni, ta gè la kɛɠala ɠɛa mɔnɔ pɛ, tɔɔzei wa-ɠɔzɔba vaiti ba. <verse eid="EZK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 5:10"/>Taazuʋɛ, doun kɛɛɠɛiti ta ti-lointi mi, dointi ti ti-ɠɛɛni mi. Nà nà-tukpɔi laalɛ wo wu. Niiti ti yɛsu vulua wo zu, nà naati faza fiilɛi zu ná pɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 5:11"/>«Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, tɔɔzei wo sèizu ɲadegai ɠɔzɔa ga wa-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani kɔzɔɠɔzɔgiti ta wa-ɠɔzɔba vaiti, nà ɓalaagi, nà kpekai ziɛzu wo ma. Gè la wo ɠaazumaawɔinɠaa, gè la wo makɛga,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 5:12"/>«Taaʋeaiti seizu saʋagɔi ɠilazuʋɛ ɠa za ga ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi ɓaa pului taazuʋɛ, seizu velesiɛi za ga boɠa zɔkpɔi taai maaɠoolii zu, gè seizu zaʋasiɛi zuvaza fiilɛi zu ná pɛ, gè ʋilɛ ti ʋolu ga nà-boɠa zɔkpɔi. <verse eid="EZK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 5:13"/>Nà yeeɓe nà-ziiɠaawanai ʋa, gè li ga nà-ziiɠulagi, gè zeeli la kwɛma, gè wanaɠula ti ʋa, názu ta suɠwɛɛ ga nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa kpɔ̀ɛai nà-toloi zu, gè li ga nà-ziiɠulagi, gè zeeli la kwɛma ti laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="EZK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 5:14"/>Zou ɠiligiti ti wo-maaɠoolii zu ta nuɓusɛiti pɛ ta ɠɛ leʋesu ná, ta ka ga gè Zeluzalɛme ɠɛa ga taai koloɠologai, ɓaaɠula ma mɛtu. <verse eid="EZK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 5:15"/>Nà nà-tukpɔi laalɛ bu, ta ziiɠaawana wolai, gè kpɔlɔ ga zeliloma wolaiti. Nuɓusɛiti ti maaɠoolii zu, naati ta taa wolai tɛi kɛ ga ɲɛɛɠulasu anii, ta poomu ganii, é ɠɛ ti ʋɛ ɓalaa ga tɛnɛgi, ta maalua zaɓui. Nà ʋe, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gè ɓɔɛzu.<verse eid="EZK 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 5:16"/>«Nà mɛɛn ɲɔi ʋilisu wo ma ga pului é ga saa gelei, wo-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe vai ma. Nà pului naa yeeɠaaɓaa, gè wa-laamiani sɔlɔɔsuʋɛti ta makɛsuʋɛti pɛ su ɓale. <verse eid="EZK 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 5:17"/>Pului nà teʋe wo ma, ta sua ɲɔiti nà yeeɓe ti ʋa wo laalɔɠɔma, ta wo ʋaa. Ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi ta toomai, naa ʋɛɛ kɔɔi ʋa, naati ta wo ɠoloɠolo, gè boɠa zɔkpɔi leʋe wo laalɔɠɔma. Nà ʋe, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gè ɓɔɛzu.»<verse eid="EZK 5:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZK 6"/>
  <para style="s">GALA gooi é woni <optbreak/> Izilayɛle yooi laalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 6:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 6:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɠaaʋote Izilayɛle ɠizeiti ma, è GALA gooi wo ti laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="EZK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 6:3"/>Ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Izilayɛle ɠizeiti, à woilo Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ma. Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa gizeiti ma, ta gize nɛmɛiti, naa ʋɛɛ pɛtugiti ba, ta nɛmɛiti: Nà ʋaazu ga kɔɔi wo laalɔɠɔma, é wa-zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti koloɠolo. <verse eid="EZK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 6:4"/>Wa-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti daa ɠa loo, wa-ansansegiti ma zalaɠa ɠalazuʋɛti ti wolowolo, wo zaama ma mɔinmɔin ka loo, ti za wa-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti kakalaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 6:5"/>Nà Izilayɛle nuiti ma ʋoomaiti suvaza ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti kakalaʋɛti, gè wo-ma ɠaeiti suvaza ta-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti maaɠooliiti su. <verse eid="EZK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 6:6"/>Wa-yooi ɠɔlɔkɔlɔma ná pɛ, taa wolaiti ta ɠolo, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti daaloo, nii a kɛ wa-zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti ti ɠoloɠolo, wa-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti suɠaleɠale, gaaʋala ti ʋa, wa-ansanse gala aniɲakaiti ti ɠolo, ta nii dɔin wo kpɛtɛni, tanɔpɛ ge la yɛga ná. <verse eid="EZK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 6:7"/>Ma mɔinmɔin ka za wo zaama. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="EZK 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 6:8"/>« ‹Anɛɛ naa ʋe, nà tanigaani zɛ ná wo zaama, kɔɔi la ti ʋaa, mɔta goi naati ta vaza zou ɠiligiti su. <verse eid="EZK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 6:9"/>Kula zou ʋa nui mɔtai naati ta yɛ zou ɠiligiti su, ti ɠisiɛ nɔ̀un su. Ti-ɠigi ɠa loo sù, ʋelei gè ta-wooʋalada yii ɠoloɠoloni da, tɔɔzei ta-ɠoloɠolo kisiɛiti ti zeɠeni nɔ̀un ba, ti ɠaazulo kpaan kɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti ba. Naazu ti wɔin ɠa zeɠe ɓɔɠɔ ma tiya ɓɔɠɔi, tɔɔzei tuʋa ʋele ɲɔiti ba ti ti ɠɛɛni, ti ga kɔzɔba vaiti. <verse eid="EZK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 6:10"/>Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gè la ɠɛni ɓɔɛni ti ʋɔ wafuun, siɛgi zu gè ɓaazaɠani la ti ma, ga nà nimizai zeizu ti ma.› »<verse eid="EZK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 6:11"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: «À yee loo ɓɛtɛaga ga kiteʋei, wo ɠɔɠɔa loɠa, wo kpeei loo, tɔɔzei Izilayɛle ná-kɔzɔba vaa ɲɔiti ba é ti ʋolu. Ti-ma zuwu ɠaa ɠa ʋaazu leʋezu ga kɔɔi, ta pului, naa ʋɛɛ ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 6:12"/>Zɔi a ɠɛ ɠoozama, naa ɠa za ga ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi, zɔi maaɓuɠaai, naa za kɔɔi zu, zɔi a yɛ ʋoluzu, naa ɠa zei kɛlɛ su, é za ga pului. Nà zeeli nà-ziiɠulagi ɠwɛgi ma ti laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="EZK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 6:13"/>Ta-nu ʋoomaiti ta vaza zooi ma ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti saama, ta-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti maaɠooliiti su, gize wolaiti ta gize goiti ma, naa ʋɛɛ gulu wolaiti bu ʋa, niiti ti ɠaa ɓiiliai, ta adaʋɛti pɛ ʋɛti ti ɠɛni zalaɠaiti kulazu ná ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti bɛ. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI. <verse eid="EZK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 6:14"/>Nà yeewuzeɠe ti laalɔɠɔma. Nà ta-yooi zuwo, ná ɠaalɛi eɠɛʋelei Liɓila teʋebai zu la, ʋɛ pɛ ti zeini ná. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.»<verse eid="EZK 6:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Folo ɠaaɓelagi ɠa ʋaazu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 7:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà:<verse eid="EZK 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 7:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:2">‹Wɛlɛ, yeeɠɛɠala ɠaaɓelagi ɠaa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:2">Ma ɠaaɓelagi zeelia zooi ma zoko naanigɔi pɛ bɛ.<verse eid="EZK 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 7:3"/>Niizu wɔnɔi ɓega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:3">nà nà-ziiɠaawanai lɛɛzu ga woye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:3">gè wo-ziɛ ʋelei ma lukpɔi ɠaaleʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:3">gè wo zala, é zoloo wa-ɠɔzɔba vaiti ma.<verse eid="EZK 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 7:4"/>Gè la wo ɠaazumaawɔinɠaa, gè la wo makɛga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:4">Nà wo zala ga wo-ziɛ ʋelei ta wa-ɠɔzɔba vaiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:4">wo ɠatani ti ɠɛɛ vai ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:4">Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.›<verse eid="EZK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 7:5"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:5">‹Nimizai, nimiza ɠila kpegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:5">kɛɠala la ná, naa ɠa é ʋaazu!<verse eid="EZK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 7:6"/>Gaaɓela foloi zeelia.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:6">Gaama ʋe, é zeelia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:6">wɔnɔi ɓega, toɠa nuu é ʋaazu.<verse eid="EZK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 7:7"/>Wo ɠoloɠolo foloi ʋaa, zooi ɠaa nuɓusɛiti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:7">Ungo, yeeɠɛɠalai zeelia, foloi maaɓuɠa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:7">Wɛlɛ, kidaaʋili fai ɠa é gizeiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:7">koozunɛɛi ʋotogi zu.<verse eid="EZK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 7:8"/>Niizu gaamago nɔ, nà nà-ziiɠaawanai lɔɔzu wo unga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:8">nà zeelizu nà-ziiɠulagi ɠwɛgi ma wo laalɔɠɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:8">Nà wo lukpɔɠaaleʋezu é zoloo wo-ziɛ ʋeleiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:8">gè wo zala ga wa-ɠɔzɔba vaiti pɛ.<verse eid="EZK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 7:9"/>Gè la wo ɠaazumaawɔinɠaa, gè la wo makɛga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:9">Nà wo zala ga wo-ziɛ ʋelei ta wa-ɠɔzɔba vaiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:9">wo ɠatani ti ɠɛɛ vai ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:9">Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, é wo loɠazu.› »<verse eid="EZK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faa ɠoloɠologi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 7:10"/>«Wɛlɛ tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:10">faa zuɠoloɠologi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:10">Doɠa ɓakɔi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:10">Wasogi zuwɔɔlɔa!<verse eid="EZK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 7:11"/>Toomai wuzeɠea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:11">ga é ɠɛ ga kpakɔi é lo faa ɲɔu ɠɛɛ vai ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:11">Tanɔpɛ ge la yɛga ná ɲɛgɛlɛin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:11">anɛɛ niima nuɓusɛiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:11">ɓaa bɛbɛ wolai nii é zɔngɔzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:11">ɓaa ti wɔɔlɔ ʋelei ta ta-lɛbiyai.<verse eid="EZK 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 7:12"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai ɠana zeeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:12">ma voloi maaɓuɠaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:12">ani ɠeya nui la mɔ ɠoozunɛa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:12">zɔi é ani ʋɔdizu, naa la mɔ ɠaazuɠilia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:12">mazɔlɔɔ nà-ziiɠaawanai ɠa nuɓusɛi pɛ daalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="EZK 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 7:13"/>Ani ʋɔdi nui la zooga é ʋa ná-sɔɔlai zɔlɔɔ ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:13">anɛɛ ni toɠa yɛ vulua.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:13">Tɔɔzei fai deveai nuɓusɛiti pɛ ma, é la zeɠea ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:13">Ti pɛ ta eteai ziɛzu faazupui zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:13">tanɔpɛ ge la zooga é ʋa yɛ vulua.<verse eid="EZK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 7:14"/>Ta yɛ puʋugi vɛɛzu ɠɔ, ti fai pɛ kpɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:14">kɛlɛ zunu nɔpɛ ge la lia kɔɔmaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:14">mazɔlɔɔ nà-ziiɠaawanai ɠa nuɓusɛiti pɛ daalɔɠɔma.»<verse eid="EZK 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kula ɠeleɠele ge la ná</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 7:15"/>«Kɔɔi ɠa ɓɔi taazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:15">ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi ta pului ɠɛ pɛlɛyeɠeiti bu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:15">Zɔiti ta ɠɛ ɓalaɠaiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:15">naati ta za kɔɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:15">niiti ti taazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:15">naati ti loo bu ga pului ta ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi.<verse eid="EZK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 7:16"/>Niiti ta yɛ vulua, ta ʋela, ti li gizeiti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:16">Eɠɛʋelei poopogi a ɗa kpalagi wo da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:16">ti pɛ ta kpalagi wo ta-vaaɠaaza golaiti faa zu.<verse eid="EZK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 7:17"/>Ti-yeeiti su ɠa ɠɛ yɔɔɠɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:17">ti-ɲiibiiti su ɗa ɓali.<verse eid="EZK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 7:18"/>Ta saa wɔlɔ wo seɠeiti too ɠɔba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:18">ti zasu ɗa ɓali ga dualuagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:18">ti-ɠaazuʋɛ maalɔɔɠu ga unfegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:18">tɔungiti pɛ kpuyegai.<verse eid="EZK 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 7:19"/>Ta ta-waliiti pili ya taazuʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:19">ta ta-zanugiti deve ga kɔzɔba aniiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:19">mazɔlɔɔ walii ɓaa zanugi la zooga é ʋa ti ɠizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:19">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-ziiɠaawana voloi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:19">Ani la mɔ ɠɛa ti ya a kula ɠɛ ti-ɠɔdayeɠei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:19">ɓaa a ti-ɠogiti sulaave,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:19">mazɔlɔɔ walii ta zanugiti ka ti ɠɛni ga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:19">ti ɠɔɠɔziɠa ɠɔtui ta-vaaɠaaza golaiti faa zu.<verse eid="EZK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 7:20"/>Ta-ɠɔbu ani pagɔiti ka ti ti ɠɛɛni ga ta-waso ganii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:20">ti naati kpɛtɛni ga kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti, ti ɠɔzɔai, ti maayo ge zeɠe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:20">Naa ɠa é ba, nà naa ɠɛɛzu ga ti ɠɔzɔ anii.<verse eid="EZK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 7:21"/>Nà wɛɛinti zɛsu na, ti ʋa, ti loo ma naavoloi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:21">zooi zu nu ɲɔiti ti kɛ ga kɔɔzoganii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:21">ti ɓega ʋoluma ga kɔzɔ.<verse eid="EZK 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 7:22"/>Nà ʋoluave ti ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:22">ta nà nɛ̀ɛbɛ adaʋɛ yɛ ná, ti ná ɠɔzɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:22">toosu nuiti ta lɛ ná, ti kɔzɔ.<verse eid="EZK 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 7:23"/>Kɔlu yɔlɔɠɔi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:23">mazɔlɔɔ zooi zulaavega ga ɲama ʋuu lukpɔɠaaleʋei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:23">taai zulaavega ga toomai.<verse eid="EZK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 7:24"/>Nà ʋaazu ga zii ɠiligiti ti ziliai gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:24">ti ta-ʋɛlɛiti so.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:24">Gè zobobɛ nuiti ta-wasogi ɠwɛteʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:24">ta-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti ti ɠɔzɔ.<verse eid="EZK 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 7:25"/>Kidaaʋiligi ʋaa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:25">Ta ziilɛigi ɠaiziɛzu, kɛlɛ ti la sɔlɔɔsu.<verse eid="EZK 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 7:26"/>Maanɔɠɔi ɠa ʋa, é la maanɔɠɔi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:26">woo ɲɔi ʋa, é la woo ɲɔi maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:26">ti ɗa GALA goo wo nui maanɛɛnɛ ga é kulakɛlɛmai ta lɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:26">Zalaɠa ɠula nui la mɔ nu ɠalaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:26">kɛwolaiti ti la mɔ nu lɛnɛga.<verse eid="EZK 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 7:27"/>Masagi ɠa zei gaazuɗɛʋui zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:27">kundiɠii ɠɛ kidaaʋiligi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:27">nuɓusɛiti sasu ɗa ɓali ga duai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:27">Nà ʋaazu ti zosu, eɠɛʋelei ti luʋa ʋeleiti ti la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:27">gè ti lukpɔɠaaleʋe, eɠɛʋelei soloogai la ti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 7:27">Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.»<verse eid="EZK 7:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ vai GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 8:1"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai gi ɠɛni la Ɓaɓilɔne, naama ɠonagi lɔzitasiɛi, ma alu dɔzitasiɛi, ma volo lɔɔlusiɛi ma, gè ɠɛni zeini nà-pɛlɛi wu, Zuda ɠɛwolaiti ti ɠɛni zeini kàkalaʋɛ. Miná ɠa Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-zɛbɛi yeini mà ná gaamago nɔ.<verse eid="EZK 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 8:2"/>Gè wɛlɛni, gè fuluanii ta ɠa, kulaai ga zunui. É zo saamaʋɛ é yei, miná ɠɛ eɠɛ abui, maazu ʋelei ɗa volo eɠɛ kɔlu ɓɔigi, ma ɓeɓelai ɗa ʋu. <verse eid="EZK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 8:3"/>Zunui naa anii ta maaleni eɠɛ zee, é sò nɔ̀undeɠai ʋa. Kulakɛlɛmai naa zu nii GALA ge teʋeni zɛnvui lɛɛni ga ze fiilɛi zu, é li ga ze Zeluzalɛme. Gè ɓɔɠɔ ɠaani nu lɛɛzuʋɛ siɠidaʋɛ é buu ʋelei, lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, ʋɛ kɔɔɠɔ ganigi ta ɠɛni ʋilɛni ná, nii é GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai wuzeɠezu. <verse eid="EZK 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 8:4"/>Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai é volozu, naa ɠɛni náʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei nɔ gè kaani la nɛmɛi zu.<verse eid="EZK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 8:5"/>GALA ge ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, wɛlɛ lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei.» Naa ɠa gè kɛɛni. Nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ kpogi ʋɔ bɛ, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠɛni ná, gè kɔɔɠɔ ganigi naa ɠaani, nii é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-ziiɠaawanai wuzeɠezu, é nu lɛɛzuʋɛ ɠobaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 8:6"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, è pɛtɛga nii ti kɛɛzu? Gaamazu Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɓɔɠɔ vea kɔzɔba vaa ɠɛɛ vai ya, ga ti màaɠooza sèizu ɲadegai ʋa. Kɛlɛ ɗa ʋaazu kɔzɔba vaiti kaazu, ti wɔɔlɔai niiti ba.»<verse eid="EZK 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 8:7"/>É liini ga ze nu lɛɛzuʋɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ. Gè wɛlɛni, gè zeɠei ɠa siɠigi ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 8:8"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, siɠigi ɓota.» Gè siɠigi ɓotani, pɛtɛ, nu ɠulazuʋɛ ɠɛni ba. <verse eid="EZK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 8:9"/>É ɠɛ mà: «Lɛ, è kɔzɔba ɠɛɛwoti ɲɔiti ka, nii niima nuiti ti kɛɛzu ʋɛ!» <verse eid="EZK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 8:10"/>Gè lɛɛni, pɛtɛ nii gè kaani: anii ma zii pɛ maaniinigi zaɠaai ga yeei siɠigi ma koozuʋɛ: kpokpo ganiiti, ta kɔzɔba zuaiti, naa ʋɛɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔi ma zii pɛ ba. <verse eid="EZK 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 8:11"/>Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠɛwolaiti saama nu ʋuulɔfela (70) ɠaalɔni, ti lo kɔɔɠɔ ganigi niiti kakala. Ansanse gala liɠii zoni ti ɠilagilagi ya, ansansegiti gala luului ɗa wuzeɠe eɠɛ tonaɓiingi. Safan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2CH 34:8-19">2DS 34:8-19</ref></char>.</note> ná-doun zunui Yaazania ɠɛni loni ti zaama. <verse eid="EZK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 8:12"/>Maliɠii ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, è kaa, nii Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti ti kɛɛzu dɔɔɠuzu, ti ɠilagilagi ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani pɛlɛiti bu? Ti ɗa woozuɠula ga: Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la gi ɠaazu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛlɛa zooi ʋa.» <verse eid="EZK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 8:13"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋaazu kɔzɔba vaiti kaazu ti ti ɠɛɛzu, ti wɔɔlɔai niiti ba.»<verse eid="EZK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 8:14"/>É liini ga ze nu lɛɛzuʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei. Anzanuiti ti zeini ná, ti ɗa galagi Tamuze<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Tamuze</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Mezopotami ɠalagi ta ʋe, Ɓaɓilɔne nuiti ta-yooi. Naati ti ɠɛni ná-saa wɔlɔi wosu kona-o-kona.</char></note> ná-saa wɔlɔi wo. <verse eid="EZK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 8:15"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, è kaa? Ɗa ʋaazu kɔzɔba vaiti kaazu, ti wɔɔlɔai niiti ba.»<verse eid="EZK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 8:16"/>É liini ga ze Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ buu ʋelei. Nu lɛɛzuʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zeizu ɲadegai, dooɠo bosuʋɛ ta zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ, zunu ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25) ɠɛɠala ɠɛni miná. Ti ʋoluavegai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zeizu ɲadegai ʋa, ti ɠaaʋote folo ɠulazu ʋelei, ti ɗa ʋilɛ ɲiibiɠa, ga ti nɔkɔ foloi wu. <verse eid="EZK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 8:17"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, è kaa? Kɔzɔba vai nii kpein Zuda nuɓusɛiti ti kɛɛzu ʋɛ, naa la dɛ kula ɠɛɛni ga tiye ɓaa? Kɛni pɛ ti zooi zulaave ga toomai, ti mina ɓe zìiɠaawana vaiti ba? Tiya ɠanu niina, ti gulu ɓekegi maaɓuɠazu ti-zokpai ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 8:18"/>Nà ɓalaagi nà ti zalazu nà-ziiɠaawana wolai zu. Gè la ti ɠaazumaawɔinɠaa, gè la ti makɛga. Ti unbɔliga ɓeei loo ʋa ga gè ɓɔ ti ʋa, gè la woiloga ma.»<verse eid="EZK 8:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme maaɠolo vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 9:1"/>Naa ʋolu gè Maliɠii wooi mɛnini, é bo ga woo wola, é ɠɛ ma: «À ʋa, wɔiti wo leveai ga wo potokulai wo taai ma, à wa-ɠɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti seɠe, ada ɠoloɠolo keleiti!» <verse eid="EZK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 9:2"/>Gè zunu lɔzita ɠaani, ti ɗa ʋa, ti zeɠe ga maazu ʋele ʋɛlɛla ʋelei nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, ɛsɛ ná-kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlai zoni zea, ada ɠoloɠolo kelei. Zunui ta ɠɛni ti zaama, maaɠiliai ga geze zeɠei, sɛʋɛ ɠɛ anii ɠɛni ná-saamaɠiligi ʋa. Ti pɛ ti ʋaani, ti lo zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠobaʋɛ, é ga kɔlu ɓɔigi. <verse eid="EZK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 9:3"/>Názu ɠa Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai wuzeɠeni la, é zeɠe seeluɓɛin maazu, é li GALA sei ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. Maliɠii zunui lolini nii maaɠilini ga geze zeɠei, sɛʋɛ ɠɛ anii ná-saamaɠiligi ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 9:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛ ma: «Leʋe Zeluzalɛme taazuʋɛ ná pɛ, é poogi ʋɛɛ naati pɛ toʋalaʋɛ, zɔiti pɛ ti kpalagi wosu, ti ɗa ɠaazuɠili tɔɔzei kɔzɔba vaiti ba ti ɠɛɛzu ná.»<verse eid="EZK 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 9:5"/>Naa ʋolu gè goomɛnini, é devei ve zɔiti zea, é ɠɛ ma: «À ʋilɛ zunui tɛi polu, wo taaʋeaiti paa. À mina nu ɠaazumaawɔinɠa, à mina nu makɛ! <verse eid="EZK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 9:6"/>À ti pɛ paa, wo ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe, kɛwola wɔlɔiti, zinipoiti, anzalopoiti, doungoiti, anzanuiti. Kɛlɛ à mina vɔɔɠu naati ti tanɔpɛ ba, niiti poogi ti-loʋalaʋɛ. À tɔɔzei sèizu ɲadegai ʋa.» Ti tɔɔzeini ga kɛwolaiti ese paa, ti ɠɛni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 9:7"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «À GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠɔzɔ, wo ma eteaʋɛ zulaave ga nu ʋoomai, naa ʋolu à li ɠoozama.» Ti liini, ti ɗa nu ʋaai ɠɛ taazuʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 9:8"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni nuiti paazu la, nà ɠila ko nɔ ɠa gè yɛni loni. Gè looni zooi ma, gè kpeei loo, gè ɠɛ ma: «Ee, Màliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è ɗa-yiiɠaawanai lopiga Zeluzalɛme ma, Izilayɛle nui mɔtaiti ti yɛgai, ɗa pɔ è naati ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe ɓaa?» <verse eid="EZK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 9:9"/>É gòoɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ mà: «Kotoiti ti ɠɛɛni Izilayɛle ta Zuda ta-masadai ma ziɛgiti su, ti zuwɔɔlɔni ga gola. Zooi zulaavega ga ɲamaba vaiti, taai zulaave ga telebotala vaiti. Nuiti ta ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛlɛa zooi ʋa, é la gi ɠaazu pa!› <verse eid="EZK 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 9:10"/>Nà ɓalaagi, gè la ti ɠaazumaawɔinɠaa, gè la ti makɛga, kɛlɛ zɔi soloogai ti luʋa ʋelei ma, naa ɠa nà da ti unma.»<verse eid="EZK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 9:11"/>Názu zunui maaɠilini ga geze zeɠei, sɛʋɛ ɠɛ anii ɠɛni ná-saamaɠiligi ʋa, é ʋaani, é ná-poluvaawogi wo ga: «Devei è boni mà, gè ti pɛ kɛa.»<verse eid="EZK 9:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZK 10"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-lɛbiyai zeɠe vai sei ʋɛlɛi ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 10:1"/>Gè wɛlɛni geei ɠaaʋɛ seeluɓɛinti tɔungi maazuʋɛ. Anii ta ɠɛni ná eɠɛ kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagi daa ga safiilegi, é ɠɛni ti maazuʋɛ, kulaai ga masa kpɔkpɔgi. <verse eid="EZK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 10:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni zunui ma, nii maaɠilini ga geze zeɠei: «Lɔ seeluɓɛinti kɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti zɔɠɔzu, yeelaave ga abulekai, è seɠe seeluɓɛinti saama, è li, è faza taai ma.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 10:2">Zunui liini gàazu, é naa ɠɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 10:3"/>Tama seeluɓɛinti ti ɠɛni loni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi yeezazuʋɛ, siɛgi zu zunui liai ma ti ʋɔ pelei. Pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ pɛ daaveni ga tonaɓiingi. <verse eid="EZK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 10:4"/>Naa ʋolu GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai wuzeɠeni, é zeɠe seeluɓɛinti maazu niiti ti zɛlɛni minazeɠe kesui ma lakulugi maazuʋɛ, é li GALA sei ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. Tonaɓiingi ʋaani, é GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wuulaave eyɛsu eteaʋɛ pɛ ge ɗa volo ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai. <verse eid="EZK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 10:5"/>Seeluɓɛinti koʋegi lugi ɠɛni mɛnisu eyɛsu etea ʋelei koi ʋoluʋɛ, eɠɛ GALA gooi, Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii, siɛgi zu é ɓɔɛzu la.<verse eid="EZK 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 10:6"/>Zunui maaɠilini ga geze zeɠei, é ɠɛni loni ma ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligi gila kobaʋɛ nɔ, siɛgi zu GALA ge devei veeni la zea ga é li, é abui zeɠe ma ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti zɔɠɔzu, seeluɓɛinti saama. <verse eid="EZK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 10:7"/>Seeluɓɛinti taɠila ge yeemaaleni abui ma, nii maaɓuɠaai ba. É ma lekaiti kula, é zunui yeelaave da, nii maaɠilini ga geze zeɠei, naa ɠula, é li ga tiye. <verse eid="EZK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 10:8"/>Nu ɠɛni nuɓusɛi yeei ma zii ɠaazu seeluɓɛinti koʋegi wu.<verse eid="EZK 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 10:9"/>Gè pɛtɛni ga ma ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠili naanigɔ ɠɛni ná, gilagila ge seeluɓɛin ɠilagilagi ɠobaʋɛ. Naama ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti ti ɠɛni volozu eɠɛ kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagi. <verse eid="EZK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 10:10"/>Ti naanigɔ pɛ ti ɠaazuʋɛti ti ɠulani ga ʋe, eɠɛ ti pɛ ta lɔ ɓɔɠɔ zu, ti ɠilagilagi pɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 10:11"/>Ta la ɠɛna ziaa, ta la zoo liizu lɛkpɛma naanigɔiti pɛ, ʋɛ ná nɛai ti ʋɛ, miná ʋele ɠa ti ɠɛni liizu la, ti ɓɛdɛ la ba ga ti ʋa lati. Ʋɛ ʋelei nɔ seeluɓɛinti tɔungi a lati ná, miná ʋele nɔ ɠa ti ɓena li ná, ti li, ti lati faa la ba. <verse eid="EZK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 10:12"/>Seeluɓɛinti gaazuɠɛzɛiti ti ɠɛni ti-ɓusɛi ʋa ná pɛ, ti-ʋoluʋɛ, ti-yeeiti, ti-ɠoʋegiti, ta ma ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠili naanigɔiti pɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 10:13"/>Gè mɛnini, ti daaseigi ʋɛɛni ma ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti ba ga «tɔngɔlɔ fiilɛi». <verse eid="EZK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 10:14"/>Seeluɓɛinti pɛ ti-ɠaazuʋɛ ɠɛni ti ʋa ga naaninaani, gaazu mɔungi ɠɛni eɠɛ seeluɓɛin ɠaazuʋɛ, gaazuʋɛ velesiɛi ɠɛni eɠɛ zunui ɠaazuʋɛ, gaazuʋɛ zaʋasiɛi ɠɛni eɠɛ zalai ɠaazuʋɛ, gaazuʋɛ naanisiɛi ɠɛni eɠɛ koɠɛi ɠaazuʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 10:15"/>Seeluɓɛinti ti wuzeɠeni. Ti ɠɛni ga zɛnvu aniiti nɔ gè ti ɠaani ziɛ wolai Keɓaal laaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 10:16"/>Siɛgi zu seeluɓɛinti ta la ɠɛna ziaa la, ti-ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti ti ɠɛni latisu ti ɠoba. Siɛgi zu ti wuzeɠezu la zooi ma ga ti-ɠoʋe, ma ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti ti la ɠɛni ɠulazu ti ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 10:17"/>Siɛgi zu ti losu da, naati ɓalaa ti lo, ni ta wuzeɠena zooi ma, naati ti wuzeɠe ɠana nɔ, mazɔlɔɔ zɛnvui é ɠɛni zɛnvu aniiti su, naa nɔ ɠa é ɠɛni ma ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti su.<verse eid="EZK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 10:18"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai é volozu, naa zeɠeni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, é li, é zɛlɛ seeluɓɛinti maazu. <verse eid="EZK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 10:19"/>Seeluɓɛinti ti ɠoʋe fai lɔɔzeini, ti wuzeɠe zooi ma gàazu, tiya-o, ti-ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti-yo ʋɔɔma. Ti loni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ folo ɠulazu ʋelei. Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai é volozu, naa ɠɛni ti ʋa, é zɛlɛni maazu. <verse eid="EZK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 10:20"/>Zɛnvu ani naanigɔiti kɛni de, gè ti ɠaani Izilayɛle nà-GALAGI ɠɔɠɔwu, ziɛ wolai Keɓaal ɠobaʋɛ. Gè kwɛɛni ga seeluɓɛinti kɛni de. <verse eid="EZK 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 10:21"/>Ti ɠilagilagi pɛ gaazuʋɛ ɠɛni naani, koʋe naanigɔ, nuɓusɛi yeei ma zii ɠɛni ti ʋa ti-ɠoʋegiti bu. <verse eid="EZK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 10:22"/>Ti-ɠaazuʋɛti ti ɠulani ga zɛnvu anii naati gaazuʋɛ, niiti gè ti ɠaani ziɛ wolai Keɓaal ɠobaʋɛ, tiya ɓɔɠɔi nɔ ɠɛni de. Ɛsɛ ge ɠɛni zɔlesu, é ɗa li ga ɠakala ʋelei nɔ.<verse eid="EZK 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EZK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme lukpɔɠaa ɠa leʋe <optbreak/> ná-ɲama ʋuu vai zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 11:1"/>Zɛnvui bùzeɠeni zooi ma, é li ga ze Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ folo ɠulazu ʋelei. Nu lɛɛzuʋɛ siɠidaʋɛ, gè zunu ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25) ɠaani. Gè nu felegɔ ɠwɛɛni ti zaama, ti ɠɛni ga nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti, Azuul ná-doun zunui Yaazania, ta Ɓenaya ná-doun zunui Pelatiya. <verse eid="EZK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 11:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, zunuiti ka, ti faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛzu, ti ɗa tɛnɛ ɲɔiti bo taai tɛi su. <verse eid="EZK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 11:3"/>Ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Eyɛsu yeeɠɛɠala zeeli, ade la dɛ pɛlɛa loga ʋɛ. Taa ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ kɔlu liɠii, ade ɠɛ ʋuuni su eɠɛ suai.› <verse eid="EZK 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 11:4"/>Naa ɠa é ba, GALA gooi wo ti laalɔɠɔma, GALA gooi wo, ɗa ʋe, zunui!»<verse eid="EZK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 11:5"/>Názu ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-Zɛnvui ʋaani pɔ̀. É ɠɛ mà: «Ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Gè naa ɠwɛɛga, nii wo bosu, Izilayɛle nuiti! Kisiɛi é lɔɔzu wo-yiimaʋɛ, gè naa ɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 11:6"/>Wo nu ʋaai wola ɠɛa taai tɛi su, wo koi yɔɠɔzu ʋeleiti pɛ sulaavega ga nu ʋoomaiti. <verse eid="EZK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 11:7"/>Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Taai ɠɛa ga kɔlu liɠii, kɛlɛ suai ɠa ga niiti wo ti ʋaai. Kɛlɛ wɔun, nà wo ɓɛɛzu, wo ɠula ná ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 11:8"/>Wa luazu kɔɔi ʋa ɓaa? Tama, nà kɔɔi leʋesu wo ma,› Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 11:9"/>‹Nà wo ɓɛɛzu, wo ɠula taai ʋa, gè wo lɔ wɛɛinti zeezu, gè nà-tukpɔi loo wo ma. <verse eid="EZK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 11:10"/>Nà wo lukpɔ Izilayɛle zooi ɠoozuʋɛ, wa za kɔɔi zu ga boɠa zɔkpɔi, wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI. <verse eid="EZK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 11:11"/>Taai tɛi ge la ɠɛa wo ʋɛ ga kɔlu liɠii, wo ʋa ɠɛ ga suai é makɛsu su, kɛlɛ nà wo lukpɔzu Izilayɛle yooi ɠoozuʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 11:12"/>Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, zɔi wo la ná-tɔgiti soni, wo la ziɛni ga ná-deveiti, tɔɔzei wo ziɛni nɔ ga zii ɠiligiti siɛ ʋelei, ti wo-maaɠoolii zu.› »<verse eid="EZK 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 11:13"/>Gè yɛni nɔ GALA gooi wosu, Ɓenaya ná-doun zunui Pelatiya za. Gè looni zooi ma, gè laaʋɛɛ, gè kpeei loo, gè ɠɛ ma: «Ee, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI! Ɗa ɠa è Izilayɛle nui mɔtai ma zuwu ɠaaleʋezu!»<verse eid="EZK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minazeɠegi é woni kula zou ʋa nuiti bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 11:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 11:15"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, niiti ti ga è-ma ziiti, è-ɠɛɛlointi, ti ga ɗa-nuiti, Izilayɛle nuɓusɛi niiti pɛ ti ti ɠulaai zou ʋa, naati ka Zeluzalɛme taaʋeaiti ti ɠɛɛzu ti ma: ‹À yɛ ɠoozama, wo maaɠooza Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ giya ɠa zooi tɛi feai gi ya ga gɔnɔ!› <verse eid="EZK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 11:16"/>Naa ɠa é ba, ɗa ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Anɛɛ ni gè ti maaɠoozani, ti li zii ɠiligiti saama, gè ti vazani zou ɠiligiti su, kɛlɛ nà ɠɛɛzu ti zaama miná yeeɠɛɠalai tanigaa laawu eɠɛ ada ɲadegai naama yooiti su, ʋɛti ti náti.› <verse eid="EZK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 11:17"/>Naa ɠa é ba, ɗa ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà wo ɠaalɛɛzu ba, wo ɠula nuɓusɛiti saama, gè wo zuzo, wo ɠula zooiti su wo vazagai ti zu, nà Izilayɛle yooi ve wo ʋɛ.› <verse eid="EZK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 11:18"/>Ta ʋaana, ti zeɠe miná, ta kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ vaiti pɛ seɠe ga, ta kɔzɔba vaiti pɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 11:19"/>Nà wo pɛ wo ɓɔ ɠi gilagi ma, gè zɛnvu niinɛ ɠilagi ve wo pɛ zea. Wo-ɠigi kpaai eɠɛ kɔtui, gè naa ɠula wo ɠoozu, gè maavalibo ga faaɠaaɠaa ɠigi, <verse eid="EZK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 11:20"/>naa ɠa a kɛ wo ziɛ ga nà-deveiti, wo woilo nà-tɔgiti ma, wo ti zo, wo ziɛ ga tiye, wo ɠɛ ga nà-nuɓusɛiti, gè ɠɛ ga wa-ƓALAGI. <verse eid="EZK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 11:21"/>Kɛlɛ zɔiti ti-yii ɠatagai kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ vaiti ba ta kɔzɔba vaiti, nà ti-ziɛ ʋelei ma ɠasɔi la ti unma,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-lɛbiyai zeɠe vai Zeluzalɛme ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 11:22"/>Seeluɓɛinti ti koʋegi lɔɔzeini, ma ɠɔɠɔ ɠiliɠiligiti ti ɗa lati ti ʋɔ, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai é volozu, naa ɠɛni ti maazuʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 11:23"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai wuzeɠeni taa zaamaʋɛ, é li, é lo gizei maazu, é Zeluzalɛme folo ɠulazu ʋelei. <verse eid="EZK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 11:24"/>Zɛnvui ʋuuni bù, é li ga ze Ɓaɓilɔne kula zou ʋa nuiti pɔ bɛ. Naa ɠɛɛni kulakɛlɛmai zu GALA Zɛnvui feeni. Kulakɛlɛmai gè kaani, naa zeɠeni pòlu niina. <verse eid="EZK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 11:25"/>Nii kpein Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI dɛɛni ga ze, gè naati pɛ dɛɛni ga kula zou ʋa nuiti.<verse eid="EZK 11:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EZK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Kula zou ʋa vai ma ʋoogiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 12:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà:<verse eid="EZK 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 12:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɗa zeini nuɓusɛiti saama, ti ɠaazulɛai. Gaazuɠɛzɛi ɠa ti ʋa ga ti wozaɠa, kɛlɛ ti la wozaɠaazu pɛ, goiyeɠei ɠa ti ʋa, ga ti faa mɛni, kɛlɛ ti la faa mɛnisu pɛ, tɔɔzei ta ga gaazulɛɛ nuɓusɛiti. <verse eid="EZK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 12:3"/>Ɗa ʋe, zunui, kula zou ʋa ɠasɔi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, è ɗa-ziɛi ɓɛtɛ kɛlɛmaʋɛ, nui pɛ gaazu. Ʋɛ è zeini ná, zeɠe miná, è li ada ɠili. Naa ɠɛ ɛsɛ pɛ gaazu, tanisu ta gaaɠa naazu ga ta ga gaazulɛɛ nuɓusɛiti. <verse eid="EZK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 12:4"/>Ɗa-ɠula zou ʋa ɠasɔi ɠula foloi ti ɠaazu, ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è ɠula kɛlɛmaʋɛ ti ɠaazu kpɔkɔi, è ɗa li, eɠɛʋelei kula zou ʋa nui a ɗa lii la. <verse eid="EZK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 12:5"/>Ɗa ɗa-ʋɛlɛi ma ziɠigi ʋaaɓota ti pɛ gaazu, è ɗa-ɠasɔiti kula ma yeɠei zu. <verse eid="EZK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 12:6"/>Ɗa kasɔi la ɠɔma ti pɛ gaazu, è ɠula la kpidii zu, ɗa ani ʋɛɛ ɠaazu, è mina wɛlɛ zooi ʋa. Mazɔlɔɔ nà pɔ è ɠɛ ga poogi Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ, é ʋilɛ naa ʋa, nii é ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu.» <verse eid="EZK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 12:7"/>Gè naa ɠɛɛni, nii Maliɠii deveni mà. Gè kasɔi ɠulani kɛlɛmaʋɛ, eɠɛ kasɔi nii soloogai kula zou ʋa nui ma. Kpɔkɔi gè siɠigi ʋaaɓotani ga zèei, gè kasɔi ɠula kpidii zu, gè da ɠɔma nuiti pɛ gaazu.<verse eid="EZK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 12:8"/>Poluma zobui, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 12:9"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti, gaazulɛɛ nuɓusɛi tɛiti, ti la è ɠaazaɠani ga: ‹Leeni ɠa è kɛɛzu?› <verse eid="EZK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 12:10"/>Ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nii ɠɛɛʋɛ ga tɛnɛ gooi, kundiɠii ʋɛ é Zeluzalɛme unda, ta Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ ti zeini ná.› <verse eid="EZK 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 12:11"/>Bo ti ma ga, è nii ɠɛɛʋɛ, é ɠɛ ti ʋɛ ga poogi, naa ɠa é ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ga tiye, ta liizu ga tiye Ɓaɓilɔne. <verse eid="EZK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 12:12"/>Zɔi é ti unda ga kundiɠii, naa ɠa ná-kasɔiti da ɠɔma kpidii zu, é ɠula taai ʋa. Ta zeɠei wɔ siɠigi ʋa, é ʋa ɠula ná. Toɠa ani ʋɛɛ ɠaazu ga é mina zooi zu ɠa. <verse eid="EZK 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 12:13"/>Nà nà-tumɔi lɔ unga, toɠa ɠɔ ga nà-balii, nà lii la Ɓaɓilɔne, Kaledé nuiti ta-yooi zu, é la naa ɠaa ga ɠaazuʋɛ, kɛlɛ ná ɠa a za ná. <verse eid="EZK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 12:14"/>Nà maaɠoolii ma nuiti pɛ faza mini-o-mini, makɛ nuiti, ta ná-kɔɔɠɔ nuiti, naa ʋolu gè ʋilɛ ti ʋolu ga nà-boɠa zɔkpɔi. <verse eid="EZK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 12:15"/>Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, siɛgi zu nà ti vazana da zii ɠiligiti saama, siɛgi zu nà ti zuvaza da zou ɠiligiti su. <verse eid="EZK 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 12:16"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, nà zunui tanigaani zɛ ná, ti ɠula kɔɔi zu, ta pului, ta ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi. Naati ka ta ɠɛ kɔzɔba vaiti bosu ziiti saama, ʋɛ ta li ná. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.»<verse eid="EZK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 12:17"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 12:18"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɗa è-ɠɔnɔgi mi ga sasuɓalii, è ɗa-ɗɛi ɓɔle ga dualuagi ta ziizoolɛi. <verse eid="EZK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 12:19"/>Ɗa bo zooi zu nuɓusɛiti ma ga: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa é wosu Zeluzalɛme nuɓusɛiti ma ti zeini Izilayɛle yooi zu: Ta ti-ɠɔnɔgi mi dualuagi zu, ti ta-ɗɛi ɓɔle ziizoolɛi zu. Mazɔlɔɔ ta-yooi ɠaaɠaalɛi, é ʋala gaa aniiti pɛ ma, tɔɔzei zou nuiti ta-lopele ɲɔi ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 12:20"/>Taa wolaiti su ɠa wo ga nuɓusɛiti, dɔɓɔi zu ɠɛ ga teʋebai zu. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.› »<verse eid="EZK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maliɠii laawooi ɠa ʋilɛ su</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 12:21"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 12:22"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, faalaalii ɓɛgele ɠa ga nii é wo la Izilayɛle yooi zu ga: ‹Yeeɠɛɠalai ɗa leʋe, kulakɛlɛma ɠila kpalaa ge la ɠɛɛzu›? <verse eid="EZK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 12:23"/>Bo Izilayɛle nuiti ma ga: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà naama vaalaalii ɓe, nu la mɔ ta woga Izilayɛle yooi zu.› Ɠɛ ti ma tɔun: ‹Yeeɠɛɠalai maaɓuɠaa, yeei kulakɛlɛmaiti pɛ ti ʋilɛsu su la.› <verse eid="EZK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 12:24"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɛɛ ɠulakɛlɛma nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛa Izilayɛle, ɓaa yaava ungaiziɛ vaa. <verse eid="EZK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 12:25"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà naa wo, nii é bɛ̀ ga gè bo, tama naa ɠa ʋilɛ su, su la ɠoozaa. Gaazulɛɛ nuɓusɛiti, wa yɛsu vulua, gè kpɔɛi tɛi bo, wo yɛ vulua, é ʋilɛ su,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 12:26"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 12:27"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, wɛlɛ nii ɠa Izilayɛle nuiti ti bosu ɗa-vaa zu, ti ɠɛ, ɗa-ɠulakɛlɛmaiti kɛ voloiti maaɠoozaʋɛ dɛ, nii gè bosu è ma ga è bo ti ma, naa ɠa ga siɛgi zu vaa nii maaɠoozaai. <verse eid="EZK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 12:28"/>Naa ɠa é ba, ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Wooi niiti kpein nà ti wo, su la ɠooza é ʋilɛ su,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI gooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 12:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EZK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Zɛɛ ɠala goo wo nuiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 13:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 13:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, gòoi laazeeli Izilayɛle ƓALA goo wo nuiti ma, niiti ti GALA gooiti bosu ga ti ɠisu vai nɔ, ɠɛ ti ma: ‹À woilo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi ma!› <verse eid="EZK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 13:3"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Maanɔɠɔi ɠa ɠimalala ƓALA goo wo nuiti tuɠɔ, ti ʋilɛgai ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠisiɛiti polu, ti la kulakɛlɛma nɔpɛ kaani! <verse eid="EZK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 13:4"/>Ee! Izilayɛle, ɗa-ƓALA goo wo nui tɛiti kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ koʋeiti ti ʋuuni adaʋɛ ná ɠoloɠologai! <verse eid="EZK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 13:5"/>Wa ʋe, GALA goo wo nuiti, wo la liini wo ʋa lo siɠigi ma yeɠeiti da, wo la siɠigi loni ga wo ʋa Izilayɛle nuiti makɛ, é ʋa lo kpaan kɔɔmaʋɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-ziiɠaawana voloi. <verse eid="EZK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 13:6"/>Zɛɛ ɠulakɛlɛmai ɠa ti kaazu, ta-vaawokɛɛyeeluɠɔiti ta ga yaava geleiti. Ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana! Tama Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laade é ʋa ti leʋe, ti ɗa ɠito ba ga ti-laawooi ɠa ʋilɛ su. <verse eid="EZK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 13:7"/>Ta ga zɛɛi, wa-ɠulakɛlɛmaiti wo ti ɠaazu! Ta ga yaavai, wa-ɓɔɛiti wo zezezu ga tiye siɛgi zu wo ɠɛɛzu la ga: Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana, tama nà laade gè ʋa ɓɔɛ!›<verse eid="EZK 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 13:8"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Tɔɔzei wo-laawooi ɠa ga yaava ɓɔɛi, zɛɛ ɠulakɛlɛmaiti ka wo ti ɠaazu, nà ga ʋa wo laalɔɠɔma,› Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 13:9"/>‹Nà yeewuzeɠezu GALA goo wo nuiti daalɔɠɔma, ti kpɛtɛ kisu ɠulakɛlɛma vaiti bosu, ti ɗa zɛɛ vaawokɛɛyeeluɠɔ vaiti bo. Seizu la vea ti ʋɛ nà-nuɓusɛiti ta-lotuɠɔiti saama, ti la zɛʋɛa Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti saama, ti la vɔlɔ ɠalega ma, ti ʋa zeeli Izilayɛle yooi zu. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI. <verse eid="EZK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 13:10"/>Tɔɔzei ta nà-nuɓusɛiti kakasu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: Ziilɛigi, siɛgi zu ziilɛi ge la ná la. Nà-nuɓusɛiti ti siɠigi loni, tiya ma ti kobegi ziɛ ma. <verse eid="EZK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 13:11"/>Ɠɛ kobe siɛ nuiti ma: Siɠigi ɠa ʋuuzu ya! Sabala golai ɠa ʋaazu, sakɔtui ʋu, fiilɛ wolai tokoleʋe. <verse eid="EZK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 13:12"/>Siɠigi a ʋuuna ya, ti la wo ɠaazaɠaga ɓaa, ga: Kobegi wo siɛni ma, tosuʋɛ ɠa mini?›<verse eid="EZK 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 13:13"/>«Naa ma ka Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Nà-ziiɠaawanai ɠa lokoleʋezu eɠɛ fiilɛ wolai, nà-ziiɠulagi ʋa eɠɛ sabala golai. Nà sakɔtuiti pu nà-ziimaleʋei zu, ti anii pɛ suɠoloɠolo. <verse eid="EZK 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 13:14"/>Nà siɠigi wolozu, nii wo kobegi ziaai ma, nà faza zooi ma, ma wuulaagi ɠula kɛlɛma. Toɠa ʋu ya, wo undaa ɠa ʋili naama vaiti saama, wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI. <verse eid="EZK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 13:15"/>Nà nà-ziiɠaawanai ɠula ɠɔbu ɠana siɠigi laalɔɠɔma, ta zɔiti ti kobegi ziɛni ma. Nà ɠɛ wo ma naazu: Mini ɠa mu siɠigi ná, mini ɠa naama nuiti ti ná, ti ɠɛni kobegi ziɛzu ma? <verse eid="EZK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 13:16"/>Izilayɛle ƓALA goo wo nui tanɔpɛ ge la mɔ ná, tɛiti ti ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu é ʋilɛ Zeluzalɛme ʋa, ti ɗa ná-ziilɛigi ma vai wo, siɛgi zu ziilɛi ge la ná la!› Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.»<verse eid="EZK 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pote faa ɠɛ anzanuiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 13:17"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɓɔɛ anzanuiti pɔ ɗa-nuɓusɛiti saama, ti kulakɛlɛma vaiti bosu ga ti ɠisu vai nɔ, GALA gooi wo ti laalɔɠɔma, <verse eid="EZK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 13:18"/>ɗa ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Maanɔɠɔi ɠa zeelizu wo ma, wɔiti wo seɠe zakpaiti zeeɠɔdaʋɛti pɛ puuzu, wo bɔɔlɔgi ɓɛtɛ nui ma zii zɔligɔi pɛ bɛ, wo vɔni ti-yɛnvui ma! Wo wɔinni wo nà-nuɓusɛiti zɛnvui ɠɛ ga wɔnɔ, wo wɔnɔ ma yɛnvui makɛ? <verse eid="EZK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 13:19"/>Wa ɓaaɠulazu mà nà-nuɓusɛiti gaazu ga moloi ma yeelaavegi ta ɓulu ɓuɠaiti, wo ɗa nuiti paa, maa la nɛɛni ti ʋa za, wo ɗa naati zɛ vulua, niiti ti maa la nɛɛni ti ʋa yɛ vulua, siɛgi zu wo zɛɛi wosu da nà-nuɓusɛiti ma, ti ɗa woilo ma.<verse eid="EZK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 13:20"/>« ‹Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà wa-zeɠe zakpaiti daalɔɠɔma, wo nuiti sosu da eɠɛ wɔniiti. Nà ti ʋalizu ga gè ti ɠula wo-yeeɠɔdaʋɛti, gè nuiti fie, wo ti zosu balii ɠa, ga ti ɠoʋe eɠɛ wɔnia. <verse eid="EZK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 13:21"/>Nà wa-wɔɔlɔgiti balizu ga gè nà-nuɓusɛiti fie, ti ɠula wa-zobogi wu. Wo la mɔ zooga wo ʋa ti zo ga baliiti. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI. <verse eid="EZK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 13:22"/>Wa telebo nuiti iɲɔteʋezu ga wa-yɛɛ wogaiti, niiti gè la ɠɛni faa ɲɔu ɓɛtɛni ti laalɔɠɔma, wo faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti iɲɔdɔ, ti yɛ ti-ziɛ ʋele ɲɔi ʋolu ti-yɛnvui undaaʋili fai zu. <verse eid="EZK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 13:23"/>Naa maaʋele ma, wo la mɔ kisu ɠulakɛlɛma ɠaa, wo la mɔ ɓɔɠɔ lɔa ungaiziɛ wo faa zu. Nà nà-nuɓusɛiti unmɔɔsu, gè ti ɠula wa-zobogi wu. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.› »<verse eid="EZK 13:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EZK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Woovele nuiti ta-vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 14:1"/>Foloi ta, Izilayɛle ɠɛwolai tanigaa ti ʋaani pɔ̀ bɛ, ti ʋu kàkala. <verse eid="EZK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 14:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 14:3"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, nui niiti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti ta ti ya ti-yiimaʋɛ, ti ɠaazulogɛ naa nɔ, nii é ti loozu kotoi zu. Nà va bu nɛi ga ti gàazaɠa ɓaa? <verse eid="EZK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 14:4"/>Naa ɠa é ba, ɓɔɛ ti ʋɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Ni Izilayɛle nui ta a ɠɛna ná, ná-kɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti ti ziimaʋɛ, gaazulogai naa ʋa, nii é toozu kotoi zu, é ʋa é GALA goo wo nui ɠaazaɠa, nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa nà gooɠaaʋotegi ve zea, é zoloo ná-kɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔ mɔinmɔingiti tosuʋɛ ma. <verse eid="EZK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 14:5"/>Naa maaʋele ma, nà Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti pɛ kigi maazɔlɔɔ ʋolu, tɛiti ti ʋoluavegai bà, ti ɠaaʋote ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti ma.›<verse eid="EZK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 14:6"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, ɠɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: À ʋa pɔ̀ ʋolu, wo ɠɛlɛ wa-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti ba, à zeɠe kɔzɔba vaiti polu, wo ti ɠɛɛzu!› <verse eid="EZK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 14:7"/>Ni Izilayɛle nui ta ɓaa seikɔɠɔma nui ta a ɠɛna ná, ná-kɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti ti ziimaʋɛ, gaazulogai naa ʋa, nii é toozu kotoi zu, é ʋa é GALA goo wo nui ta ɠaazaɠa, nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa nà gooɠaaʋotegi ve zea. <verse eid="EZK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 14:8"/>Nà wuzeɠe naama nui laalɔɠɔma, nà kɛ ga poogi, é ɗa wo faalaalii zu, nà kpeteʋe nà-nuɓusɛiti ba. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="EZK 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 14:9"/>«Ni GALA goo wo nui a ɓena ɓɔɠɔ ʋa é ɠaka, é ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɓɔɛi wo, nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa gè diai kakagi ma. Nà nà-zobogi lɛɛ la, gè teʋe ga, gè kula nà-nuɓusɛiti saama, Izilayɛle nuiti. <verse eid="EZK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 14:10"/>Ti felegɔ pɛ ta-vaaɠaazagi ma ɠasɔi ɠa la ti unma, GALA goo wo nui, ta zɔi é ʋaazu é gaazaɠa, <verse eid="EZK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 14:11"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, Izilayɛle nuiti ti mina loo ya, ti ʋa maaɠooza bà, ti ʋa ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ ga ta-lɔ koloɠologiti, ti ɠɛ ga nà-nuɓusɛiti, gè ɠɛ ga ta-ƓALAGI,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faa nɔpɛ <optbreak/> ge la GALA ná-tukpɔi zeɠea daazu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 14:12"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 14:13"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ni zou a kotoi ɠɛɛna dàalɔɠɔma, é la ɠɛɛni bɛ̀ ga wooɠɛɠila nu, nà nà-zobogi ɠula kɛlɛma daalɔɠɔma. Nà daamianigi zɔlɔɔ pelei ɠoloɠolo ti ma, gè pului leʋe ti ma, gè nuɓusɛiti ta suaiti suwuɠaaleʋe zooi ɠa. <verse eid="EZK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 14:14"/>Anɛɛ ni zunu saʋagɔi niiti ta la ɠɛ ti zaama, Nowe, Daniyɛle ta Zɔɓe, naati ta-lelebodai a la tiya ɓɔɠɔi nɔ ti-yɛnvui ɠizo,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 14:15"/>«Ɓaa mu ni nà sua ɲɔiti puuna ma yooi zu, ti ná zuwo, nuɓusɛi ɠula ná ʋa, zooi zu ɠɛ ga teʋebai, mazɔlɔɔ suaiti ta ná nuiti pɛ paa, nu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ zooga é ʋa zei ná, duai maaʋele ma, <verse eid="EZK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 14:16"/>zunu saʋagɔiti ti-laaseigi wogai, anɛɛ ni naati ta la ɠɛ ná, tiya ɠila nɔ ɠa ti-yɛnvui a la ɠizo. Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, ti la ɓena zoo ti ʋa ti ɓɔɠɔ loin taɠila kpalaa kizo, zunu ɓaa anzanu, zooi a la ɠɛ nɔ ga teʋebai zu,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 14:17"/>«Ɓaa mu gè ʋa ga kɔɔi niima nuɓusɛiti daalɔɠɔma, gè deve ve ga kɔɔi laalɛ zooi wu, é koloɠolo, ti nuiti ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe ta suaiti, <verse eid="EZK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 14:18"/>zunu saʋagɔiti ti-laaseigi wogai, anɛɛ ni naati ta la ɠɛ ná, eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, ti la ɓena zoo ti ʋa ti ɓɔɠɔ loin taɠila kpalaa kizo, zunu ɓaa anzanu, tiya ɠila nɔ ɠa ta ɠizo,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 14:19"/>«Ɓaa mu ni nà ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi leʋena nuɓusɛiti saama zooi zu, gè nà-ziiɠaawanai yei ti ma ga saai, é nuɓusɛiti ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe ta suaiti zooi ɠa, <verse eid="EZK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 14:20"/>anɛɛ ni Nowe, ta Daniyɛle ta Zɔɓeni ka ta la ɠɛ ná, naati ta-lelebodai a la tiya ɓɔɠɔi nɔ ti-yɛnvui ɠizo. Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, ti la ɓena zoo ti ʋa ti ɓɔɠɔ loin taɠila kpalaa kizo, zunu ɓaa anzanu,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 14:21"/>«Mazɔlɔɔ Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Gè faa ɓɔi naanigɔ zeini Zeluzalɛme ma, kɔɔi, ta pului, ta sua ɲɔiti, naa ʋɛɛ ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi ʋa, ga é nuiti ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe ta suaiti. <verse eid="EZK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 14:22"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe tanigaa nɔ ɠa ta yɛ vulua zunuiti su ta anzanuiti. Ta ti ɠulana taai ʋa, ta ʋa wo ʋɔ bɛ. Siɛgi zu wo ti-ziɛ ʋelei ɲɔi ʋɛtɛsu da, ta ti luʋa ʋelei ɲɔi, wa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaanɛɛnɛ é ʋilɛ maanɔɠɔi ʋa, nii gè seini Zeluzalɛme ma, ta fai nii kpein gè daani ma. <verse eid="EZK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 14:23"/>Wo-yii ɠa la názu, siɛgi zu wa ti-ziɛ ʋelei ta ti luʋa ʋelei ɠaana la, wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nii kpein gè kɛɛni ga taai tɛi, gè la ɠɛni kɛɛni wafuun,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EZK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Dɔɔɓɔi kpelei abui logai ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 15:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 15:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, leezɛn ansaɠɔgi losuʋɛ wɔɔlɔʋɛ zɔɔma wulu ɠiligiti ba ɓaa? Ma ɓekegiti fizɔgɛ dɔɓɔzu wului zɔiti tɔnɔiti ba ɓaa? <verse eid="EZK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 15:3"/>Nu ɠa zoo nɛi è ma wului ta zeɠe, è kpɛtɛ ga ani? Nu ɠa zoo nɛi è ta ɓɛtɛ ga kalagi, ani a zoo zɛlɛsu ga? <verse eid="EZK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 15:4"/>Pagɛ nɔ ga é ɠɛ ga abui ɠɔnɔgi. Siɛgi zu abui ɓesu la ga gaaɓelazuʋɛ felegɔiti gala, zaamazuʋɛ ɓɔɠɔi mu abui zogi miná ʋa, toɠa zoo ɠɛɛzu ga ani mɔnɔ ɓaa? <verse eid="EZK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 15:5"/>Pɛtɛ, siɛgi zu faa la ɠɛa ba la dɛ, nu la ɠɛa ɓɛdɛzu ma, tɔun abui a galana, é koloɠolo, nu ɓɛdɛ ɠa ɠɛ ba nɛi ga è faa ɠɛ la?<verse eid="EZK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 15:6"/>«Deɠɛmu, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Gè leezɛn ansaɠɔgi ʋili abui zu, naa vizɔgɛ dɔɓɔzu wulu ɠiligiti pili fai ʋa abui zu, zekana nà Zeluzalɛme nuiti pili da abui zu. <verse eid="EZK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 15:7"/>Nà wuzeɠezu ti laalɔɠɔma, ta kaazu ga ti ʋela abui ʋa, kɛlɛ abui taɠili ka ti ɠoloɠolo. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, siɛgi zu gè wuzeɠezu la ti laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="EZK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 15:8"/>Nà ta-yooi zu ɠɛɛzu ga teʋebai zu, tɔɔzei ti lɔɔni wooveledai zu,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 15:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EZK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme ná-kotoiti fai</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 16:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà:<verse eid="EZK 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 16:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, dɛɛ ga Zeluzalɛme ga siɛ ʋelei ɠa ga kɔzɔba vaa. <verse eid="EZK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 16:3"/>Ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa, Zeluzalɛme: È-lɔkulugi, è zɔlɔɔ pelei zu, ɗa ga Kanaan yooi zu nui, è-ɠɛɛ ɠɛni ga Amool nui, è-lee ɠɛ ga Ɠɛte nui. <verse eid="EZK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 16:4"/>È-zɔlɔɔsuʋɛ, foloi è zɔlɔɔni da, ti la ɠɛni è-wɔinkpaboi leʋeni, è maa la gbani ga ziɛi è ʋa ɲade, ti la ɠɛni kpolo ziɛni è ma, ti la seɠea veleveleni è ma. <verse eid="EZK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 16:5"/>Nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni maawɔinɠa wɛlɛ woni è ʋa, é ʋa niima vaiti tanɔpɛ kɛ è ʋɛ. Kɛlɛ è wɔinzeɠeni ti ma, è maaɲakai ʋilini ya dɔɓɔi zu, è zɔlɔɔ foloi.<verse eid="EZK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 16:6"/>« ‹Gè leʋeni è ɠobaʋɛ, gè è ɠaani, è ɗa maaɠɔɔ ɲamai zu. Anɛɛ ni ɲamai ɠɛni è ma, gè ɠɛni è ma kɛni è zɛnvui wo, ungo, gè ɠɛni è ma kɛni è zɛnvui wo. <verse eid="EZK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 16:7"/>Gè è ɠulani su, eɠɛ siinziin gani é dɔɓɔi zu. È wɔɔlɔni, è ɠulani ɓasu, ɗa-ʋadai laazeeli gola, è-ɲiimiiti ti la, ɗɔundeɠaiti ti ɠula. Kɛlɛ ná pɛ su è ɠabei ɠɛni de nɔ.<verse eid="EZK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 16:8"/>« ‹Gè leʋeni è ɠobaʋɛ mɔnɔ, gè pɛtɛni ga è zeelia nɛɛbɛ yeeɠɛɠalai ma. Názu ɠa gè nà-seɠe wolai ʋɛɛni la è ma, é è ɠabei maalɔɔɠu. Gè kona woni è ʋɛ, gè minazeɠe kɛ de yɔɠɔzu. Ʋele ɠana è ɠɛni la ga nɔ̀nɔ,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 16:9"/>« ‹Gè ziɛi zeɠeni, gè ɲamai gba la è ma, gè gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi ziɛ è ma. <verse eid="EZK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 16:10"/>Gè seɠeiti feeni è ya, ti zuʋuai, ta saʋalagiti ti ga sua ɠɔlɔi, ta geze ʋagɔi ma zaamaɠiligi, gè è maaɠili ga soa zeɠei. <verse eid="EZK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 16:11"/>Gè è maaɠilini ga ani ɓii pagɔiti, gè balaiti dɔɔni è-yeeiti ba, gè kɔbu anii loo è ɠɔbu, <verse eid="EZK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 16:12"/>gè balaɠaegi lɔ è-zokpai ʋa, ta goizu anigiti è-woiiti ba, masa bɔɔlɔgi é volozu, gè naa lɔ è unba. <verse eid="EZK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 16:13"/>Ʋele ɠana è maaɠilini la ga zanugi ta walii, è-maazeɠei ɠɛ ga geze ʋagɔi, ta soa zeɠei, ta seɠeiti ti zuʋuai. Ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi ɠa é ɠɛni ga è-ɠɔnɔgi ta kɔin gulɔi, ta gulɔi. Naa ɠa é kɛa è ʋaga gola, è zoloo masadai zɔlɔɔ fai ma. <verse eid="EZK 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 16:14"/>È-maawoo ziaa eteai zu ná pɛ, ɗa-ʋagi maaʋele ma, daazeeliai, mazɔlɔɔ gè è maaɠilini ga è ɗa volo,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 16:15"/>« ‹Kɛlɛ è yeelaani ɗa-ʋadai ma, ta ɗa-lɔɠɔɠulagi, è ɓɔɠɔ lɔ koloɠologi zu. È ɓɔɠɔ veeni koloɠologi ya, eyɛsu è ɓɔɠɔ ve teʋe nui ma zii pɛ zea. <verse eid="EZK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 16:16"/>È ɗa-zeɠei tanigaa zeɠeni, è li, è zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ maaɠili ga tiye, è ɗa koloɠologi ɠɛ ti zu, naa ɠɛɠala vaa la ɠɛni dɛ ɠɛɛni, tama naa ta la mɔ ɠɛa pɛ! <verse eid="EZK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 16:17"/>È ɗa-maaɠili zɔɔla ʋagɔiti seɠeni, nà-zanugi ta nà-walii niiti gè ti veeni è ʋɛ, naati ka è kɔɔɠɔ gani zinɛiti kpɛtɛni ga tiye, è ɓɔɠɔ lɔ koloɠologi zu ti zaama. <verse eid="EZK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 16:18"/>È ɗa-zeɠe zuʋuaiti seɠeʋɛ, è pɛɛ ti ma, è gulɔi ve ti ya, ta ansansegiti è ti zɔlɔɔni zèa. <verse eid="EZK 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 16:19"/>Daamiani pagɔi kpein gè feeni è ya, ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, ta gulɔi, ta kɔin gulɔi, gè ɠɛni è ɠɔnɔkulazu, è naa ɠɛa ga zalaɠai nii makugi nɛai, è fe ti ya,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 16:20"/>« ‹È è-loun zunuiti ta è-loun anzanuiti seɠeni, niiti è ti zɔlɔɔni bɛ̀, è ti ɠulani ga zalaɠai, kɔɔɠɔ ganigi naati bɛ, ti ti mi. Ɗa-ɠoloɠologi la dɛ kula ɠɛɛni ga ɗe ɓaa? <verse eid="EZK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 16:21"/>È dòun zunuiti kɔdaaleʋeni, è ti ɠulani ga zalaɠai, nii abui galaai, kɔɔɠɔ ganigi naati bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 16:22"/>Naama ɠonagiti kpein daawu, è ɓɔɠɔ lɔɔni kɔzɔba vaiti su, ta koloɠologi, è la ɠitooni è ma loungoyai zu, siɛgi zu è ɠabei ɠɛni de la, è laani, è ɗa maaɠɔɔ ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è-ma ɲamai zu.<verse eid="EZK 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 16:23"/>« ‹È luʋa ʋele ɲɔi pɛ poluma, è maanɔɠɔa, maanɔɠɔ ʋe è ʋɛ,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana, <verse eid="EZK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 16:24"/>« ‹è losuʋɛti kpɛtɛa, naama ada ɠaaɠoozagiti ta è ya gaalɛba wosuʋɛti pɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 16:25"/>È-losuʋɛti ta pele zaɠalaʋɛti pɛ, è ɓaaɠulaa ɗa-ʋadai ma, è ɓɔɠɔ veeni teʋe nuiti pɛ zea, è ɗa-ɠoloɠologi zuwɔɔlɔa. <verse eid="EZK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 16:26"/>È koloɠologi ɠɛɛni ta Ezipete nuiti, è-zeiɲɔɠɔiti ti-ɓusɛiti bɔɔlɔai, è ɗa-ɠoloɠologi lateʋeni ga è zìiɠaawana.<verse eid="EZK 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 16:27"/>« ‹Naa ma, gè wuzeɠeni è laalɔɠɔma, gè ta ɠulani ɗa-yooi la, gè è lɔɔni è zili nuiti ziimai zu, Filisiti laa wolaiti, tiya ɓɔɠɔi ti wanani su ga ɗa-ɠoloɠologi ma ziɛ ʋele ɲɔi, é ga tɔɠɔ ɠoloɠologi. <verse eid="EZK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 16:28"/>Kɛlɛ è yiima vai laa la ɠɛni dɛ zeelini, è koloɠologi ɠɛɛni wa Asiili nuiti. Anɛɛ naa ʋe, è-yii la ɠɛni lɛini. <verse eid="EZK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 16:29"/>È ɗa-ɠoloɠologi lateʋeni wa Ɓaɓilɔne nuiti, niiti ti ga yaaɠoiti, kɛlɛ gaa la ɠaani è-yiimai laa ʋa zeeli.<verse eid="EZK 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 16:30"/>« ‹Kpɛ, ɓaaʋalagɛ è zu ga gola,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. « ‹È-ziɛ ʋelei ɲɔuʋɛ koloɠolo anzanu ziɛ ʋele ʋa, nii gola ɲɔuɗai koloɠolo anzanuiti kpein saama. <verse eid="EZK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 16:31"/>È koloɠolo pɛlɛiti toni ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ pele zaɠalaʋɛti, è ada ɓɛtɛ, naati buzeɠeai, ti è ya gaalɛba wosuʋɛti pɛ. È la è-zala maalolisu, eɠɛʋelei koloɠolo anzanu a kɛ la! <verse eid="EZK 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 16:32"/>È ɠulani ga wɛɛnziɛ anzanui, é yeezeizu zunu ɠiligiti bu sinigi ʋotogi zu. <verse eid="EZK 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 16:33"/>Ta ɗa koloɠolo anzanuiti pɛ sala, kɛlɛ ɗɔnɔi, ɗa faanɛɛi ɠɛɛzu ɗa-wɛɛinti bɛ, è ti zalani, ti ʋa zeɠe adaʋɛ pɛ, ti ʋa ti ɗa la ga ɗe. <verse eid="EZK 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 16:34"/>Ɗa-ɠoloɠologi zu, ɗa-vai ɠulani kazemazu, é la ga koloɠolo anzanui zɔiti tɔnɔi ɠɛʋele. Nu la è ɠaiziɛzu, é ʋa è zala, kɛlɛ ɗɔun ka è nuiti salazu. Naa ma è faiti maavaliboni.› »<verse eid="EZK 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kotoi ma zalai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 16:35"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, koloɠolo anzanui, woilo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ma. <verse eid="EZK 16:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 16:36"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹È è ɠabei lɛa mɛtu, è è-ɓusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛ pɛ dɛa, è ɓɔɠɔ vee vai zu koloɠologi ya, ɗa-wɛɛinti zea, ta ɗa-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti. È è-lointi ma ɲamai ʋuuni, è ti ɠulani ga zalaɠai ɗa-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 16:37"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà ɗa-wɛɛinti pɛ gaalɛɛzu ba, zɔiti è ɓɔɠɔ veeni ti ya, niiti pɛ è ti nɛɛni ʋɛ, ta zɔiti è ti wɔinzeɠeni, gè naati pɛ kpɔ ti ʋa. Nà ti ɠaalɛɛzu ba è ma, ti zeɠe adaʋɛ pɛ, gè è ɠabei ʋilɛ, ti pɛ ti pɛtɛ mɛtu. <verse eid="EZK 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 16:38"/>Nà è lukpɔzu ga kasɔi é laazu wɛɛnziɛ anzanuiti unma ta nu ʋaa nuiti, gè naa la è unma. Nà è lɔ ɲamai zu, mazɔlɔɔ nà faa zei è ma, nà-ziiɠaawanai ta nà-toloi zu. <verse eid="EZK 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 16:39"/>Nà è lɔ ti yeezu, ti ɗa-ɠoloɠolo pɛlɛiti kpezeɠele, ti è-lɛɛzuʋɛti koloɠolo, è naati kpɛtɛni. Ta è maaɲakai ɠula, ti loo è zu, ti ɗa-maaɠili zɔɔlaiti seɠe, ti è ɠabei ʋilɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 16:40"/>Ta bɛbɛi wuzeɠe è laalɔɠɔma, ti è zɔɔ ga kɔtuiti, ti è zuleʋeleʋe ga ta-woɠa zɔkpɔiti, <verse eid="EZK 16:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 16:41"/>ta ɗa-ʋɛlɛiti gala ga abui, ɗa-lukpɔi gaaleʋeai, naa ɠa ti daazeelizu anzanu ʋɛbɛi ɠaazu. Miná ɠa nà ɗa-wɛɛnziɛ eteai ɓela ná, eyɛsu pɛ è la mɔ ɗa-wɛɛn zala. <verse eid="EZK 16:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 16:42"/>Nà nà-ziiɠulagi zu vai laazeeli è laalɔɠɔma, siɛgi zu nà kaa la ga nà-tolo ɠula un taade niina, nà maaɠɛ kpɔ, gè la mɔ yiiɠaawana pɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 16:43"/>È la ɠizɛni ɗa-loungo ziɛgi zu, è zìiɠaawana ga ɗa-ɠɛɛwotiiti. Tama è luʋa ʋele ɲɔi ma lɔnɔgi ɠa gè feezu è ya,› Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. ‹È la unfetala ɠoloɠologi laani kɔzɔba vaiti maazu ɓaa?<verse eid="EZK 16:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 16:44"/>« ‹Wɛlɛ faalaali wo nuiti pɛ ta nii wo è ma: Doun deei ɠɛʋelei, ná-doun anzanui ɠɛʋelei! <verse eid="EZK 16:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 16:45"/>Ɗa ga è-lee ná-doun anzanui, nii sinigi ta ná-dointi wɔinzeɠeni ma. È ɠulaʋɛ ga è-ʋaazeela anzanuiti, ti ti-zinigiti wɔinzeɠeni ta ti-lointi. Wo-lee ɠɛni ga Ɠɛte nui, wo-ɠɛɛ ɠɛ ga Amool nui. <verse eid="EZK 16:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 16:46"/>È-liɛ anzanui é zeini è ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, naa ɠa é ga Samali ta ná-anzanu lointi. È-leɠe anzanui é zeini è yeezazuʋɛ, naa ɠa é ga Sɔdɔme ta ná-anzanu lointi.<verse eid="EZK 16:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 16:47"/>« ‹È ziɛ vai ga ti-ziɛ ʋelei, è ʋokɔɠɔ ta-ɠɔzɔba vaiti ma, naa la ɠɛni è yiilɛini, naa lɔini è ɠaazu! Kɛlɛ è-ziɛ ʋelei ɲɔuni é leʋe tɔnɔi ʋa! <verse eid="EZK 16:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 16:48"/>Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, è-ʋaazeelai Sɔdɔme ta ná-doun anzanuiti kaipa ti la ɠɛni naa ɠɛɛni, nii wo kɛɛni, ɗa-o, è-loun anzanuiti-yo,› Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 16:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 16:49"/>‹Wɛlɛ nii ɠa é ɠɛni ga è-ʋaazeelai Sɔdɔme ná-faaɠaazagi: Ta ná-doun anzanuiti ti ɠɛni ta-eteai ziɛzu wasogi zu, daamianigi ti ya, ti gaanɛɛi zu, ziizoolɛ la ti ma. Kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni ɓɔni bala nu ʋa, ti la yeeveeni maanɔɠɔ nu ʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZK 16:50"/>Ti yɛni ɠɛɛzu ga waso nuiti, ti kɔzɔba vai ɠɛ gàazu. Gè ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋeni, gè ti ɠula eteai zu, eɠɛʋelei è kwɛɛ da. <verse eid="EZK 16:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZK 16:51"/>Ɗa-ɠotoiti è ti ɠɛɛni, Samali la ti ma ʋalisaama ɠɛɛni ga è ɠɛʋele! È kɔzɔba vai wola ɠɛɛni, é leʋe tɔun ba. È-ʋaazeelaiti, Sɔdɔme ta Samali, wo yɔɠɔzu ma, ti vizɔgɛ è ʋa! <verse eid="EZK 16:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZK 16:52"/>Niizu, daaloga ɗa è unfe kasɔi zeɠe, nii è ɠɛni daazu è-ʋaazeela anzanuiti ma, ɗɛigi kotoiti maaʋele ma è ti ɠɛɛni, ti ga kɔzɔba vaa, é leʋe tɔnɔiti ba, naa dɛa ga è-ʋaazeela anzanuiti sɔlegɛ è ʋa. Ɗɔnɔ ma yeeɠɛɠalai zeelia, è ɠaazuɓɔi su, è unfe kasɔi zeɠe, tɔɔzei è-ziɛ ʋelei dɛa ga è-ʋaazeela anzanuiti sɔlegɛ è ʋa.<verse eid="EZK 16:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZK 16:53"/>« ‹Nà taa wolai tɛiti kpɛtɛ ʋolu, nà Sɔdɔme ɓɛtɛ ʋolu ta ná-doun anzanuiti, nà Samali ɓɛtɛ ʋolu ta ná-doun anzanuiti. Ɗa ɓalaagi, nà è ɓɛtɛ ʋolu ti zaama, <verse eid="EZK 16:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZK 16:54"/>naa ɠa a kɛ è ɓaaɠulama ɠasɔi zeɠe, è unfe ga è-ɠɛɛ vai pɛ, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga ti yiilaa vaa. <verse eid="EZK 16:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZK 16:55"/>È-ʋaazeelai Sɔdɔme ta ná-doun anzanuiti, ta vɔni ti ɠɛʋele wɔlɔmai zu. Samali ta ná-doun anzanuiti, ta vɔni ti ɠɛʋele wɔlɔmai zu. Ɗa ɓalaagi, wa è-loun anzanuiti, wa vɔni wo ɠɛʋele wɔlɔmai zu. <verse eid="EZK 16:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZK 16:56"/>Siɛgi zu è ɠɛni ɲaɠai ɠulazu la ga ɓɔɠɔ, è la ɠɛni è-ʋaazeelai Sɔdɔme ʋɛlɛʋilisu ɓaa? <verse eid="EZK 16:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZK 16:57"/>Naa ɠɛɛni, aisa ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è-zɔ ɲɔi ʋa ɠula kɛlɛma. Daaloga è ʋa niina ga Edɔme laa wolaiti ta ti-maaɠoolii zu laaiti ta-ɲɛɛɠulasui zeeli è ma, naa ʋɛɛ Filisiti laaiti ta-ʋoomugiti ba, niiti ti ta-ʋɛlɛlalai ɠulazu kɛlɛma pele ungi pɛ ma. <verse eid="EZK 16:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZK 16:58"/>Ɗa-unfetala vaiti ta kɔzɔba vaiti è ti ɠɛɛni, naati ma ɠasɔi ɠa è seɠezu,› Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 16:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZK 16:59"/>«Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Naa ɠa é ba, ʋelei è kɛa la ga ze, ʋele nɔ ɠana gè ʋaazu kɛɛzu la ga ɗe. È la ɠizɛni ɗa-ɠona wooi zu, kɛlɛ è minazeɠegi ɠoloɠoloni. <verse eid="EZK 16:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZK 16:60"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, nɔ̀un nà, nà ɠizɛ minazeɠegi zu gè boni è ʋɛ, è ma loungo ziɛgi zu. Nà minazeɠe bo è ʋɛ, é ga ɠɔoɠɔ kelei. <verse eid="EZK 16:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZK 16:61"/>Ɗa ʋaazu ɠisiɛzu è-ziɛ ʋelei zu, ɗa unfe da, siɛgi zu è ʋaazu yeezeizu la è-ʋaazeela anzanuiti bu, ma mɔungiti ta ma goiti, nà ti lɔɔzu è yeezu, eɠɛ è-loun anzanua, anɛɛ ni naa la minazeɠegi zu bogai è ʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZK 16:62"/>Nà nà-minazeɠegi niinɛzu è ʋɛ, ɗa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI. <verse eid="EZK 16:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZK 16:63"/>Naazu ɗa ɠitoo ʋoluzu ʋelei vaiti su, è unfe, è ɠaazuɓɔi su, è la zooga è ʋa ɓɔɛ, kɛlɛ nɔ̀un nà, nà è zuvaayɛ ga faa ɲɔi pɛ è kɛɛni,› Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.»<verse eid="EZK 16:63"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EZK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Koɠɛ wolai ta leezɛn ɓelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 17:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 17:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, faalaalii ta wo Izilayɛle nuiti ma, è wɔlɔwɔlɔ vai ta wo ti ma. <verse eid="EZK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 17:3"/>Ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Koɠɛ wolai, koʋegiti koozaai, koʋe deɠaiti koozaai, maaleɠai ɗufukulu, é ʋɔnɛ, naa ɠa é ɠoʋeni, é li Liɓan ɠizei ma, é sɛdelegi ma wului unsu ɠale. <verse eid="EZK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 17:4"/>É ma ɓekegi ɠale ba nii gaaɠoozani ti pɛ ba. É liini la yaaɠo yooi ta zu, é da yaaɠoiti ta-laai ta zu. <verse eid="EZK 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 17:5"/>Naa ʋolu é Izilayɛle yooi zu wulu ʋɔnɔgi ta zeɠeni, é li, é tɔɔ lɔ adaʋɛ ta, ʋɛ a yɛ ná tago ɓaɠo, é siinni zooi ma ziɛ wolai laaʋɛ, eɠɛ pɔnɔba ani. <verse eid="EZK 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 17:6"/>Ani ʋɔnɔgi naa wuzeɠeni, é ɠɛ ga leezɛn ansaɠɔgi, é ɓɔvɔ. Ma ɓekegiti gaaʋoteni koɠɛi ʋɔ pelei, ma zapeiti ti ɗa ziɛ bu. Leezɛn ansaɠɔgi ɠɛni ma ɓeke niinɛ ɠulazu nɔ ɠɔ.<verse eid="EZK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 17:7"/>« ‹Koɠɛi taɠili ge ɠɛni ná, bɔɔlɔai, koʋega leɠaiti koozaai, maaleɠai ɗufukulu. Leezɛn ansaɠɔgi ma zapeiti gaaʋoteni ma, é ma ɓekegiti dii ga pɔ pelei. É ɠɛni kaazu ga toɠa ziɛ zɔlɔɔ naazu, é leʋe ʋɛ ʋa siingai ná. <verse eid="EZK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 17:8"/>Siinga ɠɛni de zou ʋagɔi zu, ziɛ wolai ɠobaʋɛ, nii a kɛ ma ɓekegi mɔin, é gwaai wo, é ɠɛ ga leezɛn ansaɠɔgi maanɛai.›<verse eid="EZK 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 17:9"/>«Ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Gaa ɠa wɔɔlɔ nɛi? Koɠɛ mɔungi la ʋa nɛi, é ʋa ma zapeiti tɔɔɠula, é ma waaiti koloɠolo, é ɠaaɓa ga ma ʋɔnɔ niinɛiti ti vɔ? Kpɛdɛ la ba ga kɛni zɛbɛ wolai, ɓaa kɔɔɠɔ nua ti mɔin pɛ, ti ʋa tɔɔɠula. <verse eid="EZK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 17:10"/>Leezɛn ansaɠɔgi ziingɛ ga pagɔ, kɛlɛ é la zooga gaa ʋa wɔɔlɔ. Folo ɠulazu ʋele viilɛi ɠa loɠa ba nɔ feya, toɠa vɔ gaamanɔ mɛtu. Ʋɛ é ʋɔnɔni ná zooi ma, toɠa vɔɔzu ná nɔ.› »<verse eid="EZK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 17:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 17:12"/>«Ɠɛ kololala nui tɛiti ma: ‹Wo la naa ʋoluʋɛ ɠwɛɛ ɓaa?› Ti loo ɠisu ga ʋelei Ɓaɓilɔne masagi liini la Zeluzalɛme, é masagi zo, ta kundiɠiiti, é li ga tiye ná-zooi zu. <verse eid="EZK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 17:13"/>Naa ʋoluma é nu ɠila seɠeni masa pɛlɛyeɠei wu, é minazeɠe bo bɛ, é ɠɛ naa ma kɛni è gooɠɛɠiladai ma ɠonai wo bɛ. É liini ga nu wolaiti pɛ, é ti maaɠooza zooi ʋa, <verse eid="EZK 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 17:14"/>naa ɠa a kɛ masadai ɠaalɛɠɛ, buzeɠe zobo ge mina ɠɛ ná, nii a kɛ é minazeɠegi makɛ kpaan, ziilɛigi ɠɛ ná. <verse eid="EZK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 17:15"/>Kɛlɛ naa mu ge wuzeɠeni Ɓaɓilɔne masagi laalɔɠɔma, é keelaiti teʋe Ezipete yooi zu, ga ti sooiti teʋe ma, ta salaʋusu ɓulugiti. Toɠa zobo sɔlɔɔ nɛi ɓaa? Zɔi é naa ɠɛai, toɠa ɓɔɠɔ ɠula su ɓaa? É minazeɠegi ɠoloɠologa, toɠa ɓɔɠɔ ɠula su? <verse eid="EZK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 17:16"/>Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, masagi tɛi ka za masagi naa ná-zooi zu, nii é seini masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa. É la ɠɛni ɠizɛni minazeɠegi zu é boni, é minazeɠegi ɠoloɠoloni. Toɠa za naa ʋɔ bɛ Ɓaɓilɔne yooi zu, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 17:17"/>‹Falaɠɔn la zooga é ʋa ɓɔ ba, é ʋa ɓɔɠɔ maaɠɔkɔ, anɛɛ ni naa ɠa salaʋusuiti ta kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti feezu ti mɔin, siɛgi zu Ɓaɓilɔne nuiti ti kɔɔlaaɠai ɓɛtɛzu la, ti zeɠeiti bɔ, ti lɔɔɠu su, ti ɗa nuiti undaaʋili. <verse eid="EZK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 17:18"/>É la ɠizɛni konai zu é boni, é minazeɠegi ɠoloɠoloni, tama tɔ ɠa é vaani bu. Naama vaaɠaazagi ɠɛa ʋoluma, kula ɠeleɠele ge la ná naa zu.›<verse eid="EZK 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 17:19"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, konai é boni dàaseigi zu, naa ɠa é seɠeni ma, é nà-minazeɠegi ɠoloɠolo, nà ma ɓɔlɔi la unma. <verse eid="EZK 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 17:20"/>Nà nà-tumɔi lɔɔzu unga, toɠa ɠɔ ga nà-balii. Nà lii la Ɓaɓilɔne, nà tukpɔ miná, é ʋilɛ ná-yaava vai ʋa, é kɛɛni ga ze. <verse eid="EZK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 17:21"/>Ná-salaʋusu zɔɓelamaiti pɛ ta za kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ, zɔiti ta yɛ vulua, naati ta vaza adaʋɛ pɛ. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa kpɔ̀ɛai.› »<verse eid="EZK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maliɠii ná-minazeɠegiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 17:22"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: «Nà ɓɔɠɔi, nà ma ɓeke niinɛ goi ta leʋezu sɛdele gului ma ɓekegi zokpai ʋa, nà kula ma ɓekegiti gaaɓelazuʋɛ, gè sin gize ɠaaɠooza golai ma. <verse eid="EZK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 17:23"/>Nà sin Izilayɛle ɠize ɠaaɠoozagi gila ma. Toɠa ma ɓekegiti suvie, é waa, é ɠɛ ga sɛdele gului maayikiai. Wɔni ma zii pɛ ka ɠɛ laɠagi losu ma ɓekegiti su, ti ɗa looɠo ma ɓekegiti ma niinigi wu. <verse eid="EZK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 17:24"/>Názu dɔɓɔi zu wuluiti pɛ ta suɠwɛɛ ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, é gului ɠaayeizu nii gaaɠoozaai, gului gaaɓuɠaai é naa ɠaaɠooza, é gulu wundui vɔ, zɔi fɔai é naa wundu su. Nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa kpɔ̀ɛai, nà kɛ nɔ.»<verse eid="EZK 17:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EZK 18"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ka ɛsɛ tukpɔɠaaleʋe, <optbreak/> é zoloo tuʋa ʋelei ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 18:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 18:2"/>«Leeni vaa zu wo niima vaalaalii wosu Izilayɛle yooi zu ga: ‹Doun kɛɛɠɛiti ti leezɛn ɓoei miini, ti-lointi ɲiigai ɠaalaɓa›? <verse eid="EZK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 18:3"/>Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, wo la mɔ naama vaalaalii ta woga pɛ Izilayɛle yooi zu!» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 18:4"/>«Tama, zɛnvui pɛ ka ga nɔ̀nɔ, doun zɔlɔɔ nuiti zɛnvui ta dointi zɛnvui. Nui a kotoi ɠɛ, naa ɠa a za.<verse eid="EZK 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 18:5"/>«Zunui ta ʋɛtɛ, telebogai, é ziɛzu ga sɔledai ta telebodai. <verse eid="EZK 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 18:6"/>É la gize ɠɔɔ zalaɠa miizu, é la Izilayɛle nuiti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔi ta ɠɔɔzu. É la ɠaazuɠulazu seiɲɔɠɔi anza ʋa, é la laa ga anzanu, naa a ɠɛna alugi ɠaa. <verse eid="EZK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 18:7"/>É la nu zuziɠaa. A kuye ʋɛɛna nu ma, kpɔunmai naa seizu ma, toɠa naa ɠaaɠale ma. É la unma wosu. Zɔi pului ma, é ná-daamianigi ve naa ya. Zɔi seɠe la zea, é ta ve naa ya. <verse eid="EZK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 18:8"/>É la ná-walii lɔɔzu ga lɔdɔ, ta ʋa la ma, ɓaa tɔnɔ sɔlɔɔ faa. Zee la telebotala vaa nɔpɛ su, é ɗa tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe ga gaamai nuiti zɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="EZK 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 18:9"/>É ɠolo deveiti bɛ ta tɔgiti gè ti zeiɗai, é ziɛ ga gaamai. Niima nu zii ɠa ga telebo nu, gaamazu toɠa zɛnvui wo,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 18:10"/>«Ni a doun zunu zɔlɔɔna, é ga toosu nui, nu ʋaa nui, ɓaa é tuʋa ʋele ɲɔi ma zii pɛ kɛɛzu, <verse eid="EZK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 18:11"/>tama kɛɛɠɛ la naa tanɔpɛ kɛɛni, é gize ɠɔɔ zalaɠaiti mia, é ʋilɛga seiɲɔɠɔi anzai ʋolu, <verse eid="EZK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 18:12"/>é maanɔɠɔ nuiti suziɠaa, ta bala nuiti, é nuiti unmaa, é la kpɔunma ɠaaɠalega ma kuye zeɠe nui ma, é ɓɔɠɔ ve kɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔ ɠɔɔ vaiti zea, é kɔzɔba vaiti kɛa, <verse eid="EZK 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 18:13"/>é kuye ʋɛa ga talamai tɔnɔ fai ma. Naama nu zii maanɛɛʋɛ é yɛ vulua ɓaa? É mina yɛ vulua pɛ! É kɔzɔba vai ma zii pɛ kɛa, gaamazu kɛni é za nɔ. Ma ɲamai ɠa yɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi unma.<verse eid="EZK 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 18:14"/>«Kɛlɛ ni zunui naa a doun zunui ta zɔlɔɔna, kotoi kpein kɛɛɠɛ kɛai, é naati pɛ ka, kɛlɛ é la kɛɛni é ʋa ziɛ ga naa ziɛ ʋelei. <verse eid="EZK 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 18:15"/>É la gize ɠɔɔ zalaɠa miizu, é la Izilayɛle nuiti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔi ta ɠɔɔzu. É la ʋilɛsu seiɲɔɠɔi anza ʋolu. <verse eid="EZK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 18:16"/>É la nu zuziɠaa. A kuye ʋɛɛna nu ma, é la yeezeizu kpɔunma wu. É la unma wosu. Zɔi pului ma, é ná-daamianigi ve naa ya. Zɔi seɠe la zea, é ta ve naa ya. <verse eid="EZK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 18:17"/>É la yeelɔa telebotala vaa zu, é la kuye ʋɛa talama vaa zu, ɓaa tɔnɔ faa. Toɠa ɠolo ɠana deveiti ta tɔgiti bɛ gè ti zeini. Ná-doun zunui la zaa kɛɛɠɛ ná-faaɠaazagiti faa zu, gaamazu toɠa zɛnvui wo. <verse eid="EZK 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 18:18"/>Kɛɛɠɛ ɠa é nuiti nimizaa, é seiɲɔɠɔiti unmaa, é loa maaɠoolii zu nuiti ma, naa ɠa é ba, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠa za ná-faaɠaazagiti faa zu.<verse eid="EZK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 18:19"/>«Wa gaazaɠagi wosu ga, leeni vaa zu doun kɛɛɠɛi ná-faaɠaazagi ma ɠuyei la sala ná-doun zunui ma? Toɠa ga, doun zunui ziɛ ʋelei zolooni sɔledai ma ta telebodai, é ɠoloni nà-tɔgiti bɛ. Gaamazu toɠa zɛnvui wo. <verse eid="EZK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 18:20"/>Zɔi a kotoi ɠɛ, naa ɠa a za. Dointi ti la ti zɔlɔɔ nuiti ta-vaaɠaazagi ma ɠasɔi zeɠea ti ʋɛ, dointi sɔlɔɔ nuiti ti la ti-lointi ta-vaaɠaazagiti ma ɠasɔi zeɠea ti ʋɛ. Zɔi telebogai, ná-sɔledai ɠa leve unma, faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ɠa ná-faa ɲɔi ma ɠasɔi ɠa la unma.<verse eid="EZK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 18:21"/>«Ni faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui a zeɠena tuʋa ʋele ɲɔiti polu, é nà-tɔgiti so, é ziɛ ga sɔledai é zoloo telebodai ma, gaamazu toɠa zɛnvui wo, é la zaa. <verse eid="EZK 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 18:22"/>Tɔ koloɠologiti kpein é kɛɛni, naa la mɔ levea, toɠa zɛnvui wo tɔɔzei telebodai ʋa, nii é kɛɛzu. <verse eid="EZK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 18:23"/>Wa kaazu ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui zaa vai ɠa nɛai bɛ̀ ɓaa? Nii wɔ̀inɗai la, naa ɠa ga é siɛ ʋelei maavalibo, é zɛnvui wo,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 18:24"/>«Kɛlɛ ni telebo nui a ɠɛlɛna ná-sɔledai ʋa, é ɗa faa ɲɔi ɠɛ, é ʋokɔɠɔ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ma kɔzɔba ɠɛɛwotiiti su, wa kaazu ga toɠa zɛnvui wo? Nu la mɔ kɛɛwoti ʋagɔi tanɔpɛ devea, é ti ɠɛɛni mɔungi, toɠa za ná-kololalai vaa zu ta ná-faaɠaazagiti.<verse eid="EZK 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 18:25"/>«Wa ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Maliɠii ziɛ ʋelei la zolooni.› À woilo dɛɛ deɠɛmu, Izilayɛle nuiti, sìɛ ʋelei ɠa é la zolooni ɓaa? Tɔun wo-ziɛ ʋeleiti tɛi ti la zolooni ɓaa? <verse eid="EZK 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 18:26"/>Ni telebo nui a ɠɛlɛna sɔledai ʋa, é ʋilɛ ga faa ɲɔi ɠɛa, a zaana naazu. Faa ɲɔi é kɛai, naa maaʋele ma ɠa é ʋalasu da zɛnvui ma. <verse eid="EZK 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 18:27"/>Ni tama faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui a ɠɛlɛna tuʋa ʋele ɲɔi ʋa, é ziɛ ga sɔledai, é zoloo telebodai ma, toɠa zɛnvui ɠizo. <verse eid="EZK 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 18:28"/>Tɛi é ná-tɔ koloɠologiti kwɛɛga niiti é ti ɠɛɛni, é ɠɛlɛ ti ʋa, toɠa zɛnvui wo, é la zaa pɛ. <verse eid="EZK 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 18:29"/>Kɛlɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ta ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Maliɠii ziɛ ʋelei la zolooni.› Nɔ̀un siɛ ʋelei ɠa é la zolooni, Izilayɛle nuiti? Wo-ziɛ ʋeleiti tɛi ti la zolooni tɔun ɓaa?<verse eid="EZK 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 18:30"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, deɠɛmu, nà wo ɠilagilagi lukpɔɠaaleʋe ga wo-ziɛ ʋeleiti, Izilayɛle nuiti,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. «À wo-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo deɠɛmu, wo ɠɛlɛ tɔ koloɠologi pɛ ba, wa-vaaɠaazagi mina ɠɛ ga wo undaaʋili saɓui. <verse eid="EZK 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 18:31"/>À tɔ koloɠologiti pɛ pili ya, niiti wo ti ɠɛɛni dàalɔɠɔma, wo ti maaɠooza ɓɔɠɔ ʋa. À wo-ɠigiti niinɛ, wo-yɛnvuiti ti niinɛ, mazɔlɔɔ lee vaa zu wo pɔ wo za, Izilayɛle nuiti? <verse eid="EZK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 18:32"/>Tɔɔzei nɔ̀un ziima vaa la ga gè nu nɔpɛ ka é ɗa za. Naa ɠa é ba, à wo-ziɛ ʋeleiti falibo, nii a kɛ wo yɛ vulua,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 18:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EZK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Maawɔin wuyei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 19:1"/>«Ɗa ʋe, maawɔin wuyei loo Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti ma. <verse eid="EZK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 19:2"/>Ɗa ɠɛ ti ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:2">‹Wo-lee ɠɛni ga zala zaai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:2">É ʋɛɛni sakpamaalegai zala zinɛiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:2">zala yiʋoiti saama é ná-ziʋoiti kulazu su ná.<verse eid="EZK 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 19:3"/>É ná-ziʋoi taɠila maaɠoloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:3">naa ɠɛni ga zala ɓokpagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:3">É zooni daamianigi zosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:3">é ɗa nuiti suʋaliʋali.<verse eid="EZK 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 19:4"/>Zii ɠiligiti ti maawooi mɛnini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:4">Ti soni ga ta-ʋalii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:4">ti kalagi lɔ sokpayeɠei zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:4">Ti liini la Ezipete yooi zu.<verse eid="EZK 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 19:5"/>Siɛgi zu zala zaai kaani la ga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:5">ná-maaɓɔungi zuɠooza wafuun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:5">kitosuʋɛ ɠoloɠologa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:5">É ná-ziʋoi taɠili seɠeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:5">é kpɛtɛ ga zala ɓokpagi.<verse eid="EZK 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 19:6"/>É ɠɛni leʋeteʋesu zalaiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:6">é ɠɛni ga zala ɓokpagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:6">É zooni daamianigi zosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:6">é ɗa nuiti suʋaliʋali.<verse eid="EZK 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 19:7"/>É ta-masa pɛlɛi woloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:7">é ta-laa wolai ɠoloɠolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:7">Zooi ta gaa nuɓusɛiti ti luani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:7">sikɔ lugi ʋa ti mɛnini.<verse eid="EZK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 19:8"/>Zii ɠiligiti ti maaɠoolii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:8">ti wuzeɠeni daalɔɠɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:8">Ti maaɠoolini ga ta-lumɔiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:8">ti soni ga ta-ʋaliiti.<verse eid="EZK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 19:9"/>Ti kalagi ʋilini sokpa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:9">ti pili sasa goi zu kɛai eɠɛ sekagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:9">Ti liini la Ɓaɓilɔne masagi ʋɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:9">Ti pilini kasoi ɠa, nu a ʋa goomɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:9">é ɗa zikɔ Izilayɛle ɠizeiti ma.› »<verse eid="EZK 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dɔɔɓɔi gului ta ma ɓekegiti</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 19:10"/>« ‹Wo-lee ɠɛni eɠɛ leezɛn ansaɠɔgi siingai ziɛlaʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:10">Ma waaiti ti ɠɛni ga ta gaalaagiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:10">ziɛi zaɓu zu é ɠɛni sɔlɔɔsu.<verse eid="EZK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 19:11"/>Ma ɓekegiti ti ɠɛ ba, ti maayikiai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:11">naati ti ɠɛɛni ga masa tukpɔiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:11">É loni gulu wolaiti maazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:11">Gaaɠooza ʋelei ta ma ɓekegiti mɔin ʋelei</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:11">ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛni kaazu.<verse eid="EZK 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 19:12"/>Kɛlɛ tɔɔɠulani ga ziiɠaawanai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:12">é ʋili ya zooi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:12">Folo ɠulazu ʋele viilɛi fɔɔni ta ma waaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:12">naati ti looni bu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:12">Ma ɓekegiti ti maayikini, ti vɔɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:12">abui ti ɠalani.<verse eid="EZK 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 19:13"/>Leezɛn ansaɠɔgi tɛi siinga ɠɛni de teʋebai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:13">zou vɔɔi zu, ziɛ la ná.<verse eid="EZK 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 19:14"/>Abui ɠulani ma lɔkulugi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:14">é ma ɓekegiti ta ma waaiti koloɠolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:14">Ma ɓeke maayikia la mɔ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:14">nii a ɠɛ ga masa tukpɔi.› »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 19:14">Maawɔin wuyei ɠana, maanɛai é loo ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 19:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EZK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle ná-kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 20:1"/>Kona dɔfelasiɛi ma alu dɔɔlusiɛi ma volo puugɔi ma, Izilayɛle ɠɛwolai tanigaani ti ʋaani ti gàazaɠa, ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiimai ɠwɛɛ. Ti zeini kàkala. <verse eid="EZK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 20:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 20:3"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle ɠɛwolaiti pɔ, ɗa ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Wo yiilɔɔʋɛ ʋaazu gàazaɠasu? Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, gè la vaa bu, wo ʋa gaazaɠa!› Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 20:4"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ta-lukpɔi ɠaaleʋe! Mina inɛinɛ è naa ɠɛ! Ti-mɛmɛwolani ta luʋa ʋele ɲɔiti, kɔzɔba vaiti ti ti ɠɛɛni, ti ɠula kɛlɛma! <verse eid="EZK 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 20:5"/>Ɗa ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Siɛgi zu gè yiimazeɠeni la ga Izilayɛle, gè minazeɠeni Zakɔɓe mavofodaiti pɛ bɛ. Gè ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛni ga tiye Ezipete yooi zu, gè minazeɠe ti ʋɛ, gè ɠɛ ti ma: Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI. <verse eid="EZK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 20:6"/>Naama volo ná, gè yeewuzeɠeni, gè ɠona ti ʋɛ, ga nà ti ɠulazu Ezipete yooi ʋa, gè lo ti luɠɔ, ti li zooi naa zu nii gè kɛʋele ɓɛtɛai ti ʋɛ, ʋɛ nɔnɔi ta kɔin gulɔi ʋooʋaai ná, pagai zooi pɛ ba. <verse eid="EZK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 20:7"/>Gè ɠɛni ti ma: Wo pɛ à kɔzɔba vaiti pili ya wo ɠaazulogai ti ʋa, à mina mɔ ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ pɛ ga Ezipete ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti kɔɔ vai. Nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="EZK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 20:8"/>« ‹Kɛlɛ ti ɓakani zèa, ti la ɠɛni kɛɛni ti ʋa ɠolo bɛ̀. Ti tanɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ɠɛlɛni kɔzɔba ɠalagiti ba ti ɠaazuloni ba, ti la ɠɛni ɠɛlɛni Ezipete ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti ba. Gè ɠigaiziɛni ga gè nà-ziiɠaawanai yei ti ma, gè zeeli kwɛgi ma Ezipete yooi nɔ zu. <verse eid="EZK 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 20:9"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, dàaseigi maaʋele ɠa gè la naa ɠɛɛni la, ga tɔ̀ɠɔi a ʋa ɠoloɠolo zii ɠiligiti zea ti zeini ti zaama, mazɔlɔɔ gè ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛni ga tiye zii ɠiligi naati gaazu, ga nà ti ɠulazu Ezipete yooi ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 20:10"/>Gè ti ɠulani Ezipete yooi ʋa, gè li ga tiye teʋebai zu. <verse eid="EZK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 20:11"/>Gè nà-tɔgiti feeni ti ya, gè nà-deveiti dɛɛni ga tiye, niiti ti zo fai zobo feezu nuiti bɛ, ti zɛnvui wo ga ti maaʋele. <verse eid="EZK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 20:12"/>Gè nà-dooɠo foloiti feeni ti ʋɛ, ti ɠɛ ga kpɔfaamai ma ʋoogi gi yɔɠɔzu, ga ti suɠwɛɛ ga nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, é ti ɲadesu.<verse eid="EZK 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 20:13"/>« ‹Kɛlɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ti wuzeɠeni dàalɔɠɔma teʋebai zu. Ti la ɠɛni ziɛni ga nà-tɔgiti, nà-deveiti ti ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛni ti ɠaazu, niiti ti zo fai zobo feezu nuiti bɛ, ti zɛnvui wo ga ti maaʋele. Ti ɠɛni nà-dooɠo foloiti maaɲɛɛi ʋuuzu ma ga kɛʋele ɲɔu. Gè ɠigaiziɛni mɔnɔ ga gè nà-ziiɠaawanai yei ti ma teʋebai zu, gè ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe. <verse eid="EZK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 20:14"/>Kɛlɛ dàaseigi ɠa gè luani la, ga tɔ̀ɠɔi a ʋa ɠoloɠolo zii ɠiligiti zea, niiti gè ti ɠulani Ezipete yooi ʋa ti ɠaazu. <verse eid="EZK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 20:15"/>Nà ɠa gè yeewuzeɠeni, gè ɠona ti ʋɛ teʋebai zu, ga gè la mɔ loga ti luɠɔ, gè ʋa li ga tiye zooi zu gè feeni ti ʋɛ, ʋɛ nɔnɔi ta kɔin gulɔi ʋooʋaai ná, pagai zooi pɛ ba. <verse eid="EZK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 20:16"/>Gè naama ɠonai woni, tɔɔzei ti la ɠɛni kɛɛni ti ʋa nà-deveiti so, ta nà-tɔgiti, ti ɠɛni nà-dooɠo foloiti maaɲɛɛi ʋuuzu ma, ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti faa ɠa é ʋilini ti-yii ʋolu. <verse eid="EZK 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 20:17"/>Kɛlɛ ti maawɔin ɠa é sòni gola, gè la ti ɠoloɠoloni, gè la ɠɛni ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋeni teʋebai zu.› »<verse eid="EZK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle ɓetalai kololalai ʋa GALA bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 20:18"/>«Anɛɛ naa ʋe, gè ɠɛni ti-lointi ma teʋebai zu: ‹À mina ziɛ ga wo-ɠɛɛni ta-lɔgiti, ta ta-leveiti ti ti ɓɛtɛni ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, à mina ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ ga ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti kɔɔ vai. <verse eid="EZK 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 20:19"/>Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI. À ziɛ ga nà-tɔgiti, wo ɠolo nà-deveiti bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 20:20"/>À dooɠo foloi maaɲɛ, é ga kpɔfaamai ade yɔɠɔzu, poogi à ɠwɛɛ da ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.›<verse eid="EZK 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 20:21"/>«Kɛlɛ dointi ɓalaa ti ɓakani zèa. Ti la ziɛni ga nà-tɔgiti, ti la nà-deveiti soni, niiti ti zo fai zobo feezu nuiti bɛ, ti zɛnvui wo ga ti maaʋele. Ti nà-dooɠo foloiti maaɲɛɛi ʋuuni ma. Gè ɠigaiziɛni naazu ga gè nà-ziiɠaawanai yei ti ma, gè nà-ziiɠaawanai lɛ ga tiye teʋebai zu. <verse eid="EZK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 20:22"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, gè yeezeɠeni ma, gè la naa ɠɛɛni, dàaseigi maaʋele ma, tɔ̀ɠɔi a ʋa ɠoloɠolo zii ɠiligiti gaazu, niiti gè ti ɠulani Ezipete yooi ʋa ti ɠaazu.<verse eid="EZK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 20:23"/>«Kɛlɛ anɛɛ naa ʋe, gè yeewuzeɠeni, gè ɠona ti ʋɛ teʋebai zu, ga nà ti vazasu nuɓusɛiti saama, zou ɠiligiti su. <verse eid="EZK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 20:24"/>Gè ɠonani, tɔɔzei ti la ɠɛni nà-deveiti soni, ta nà-tɔgiti, ti nà-dooɠo foloiti maaɲɛɛi ʋuuni ma, kɛlɛ ti-ɠɛɛni ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti nɔ ɠa ti ʋilini ti-yii ʋolu. <verse eid="EZK 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 20:25"/>Naa ɓalaa ɠa é kɛɛni, gè tɔgiti feeni ti ya, é la faa ʋaa ti ma, gè deveiti fe ti ya, ti la ɓena zoo ti ʋa zɛnvui wo ga ti maaʋele. <verse eid="EZK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 20:26"/>Gè ti ɠɔzɔni ga ta-vebɛaniiti, nii é ɠɛni ga ti-loun mɔungiti gala vai ga zalaɠai. Naa ti lɔɔni kidaaʋili golai zu, ti suɠwɛɛni naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="EZK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 20:27"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Wo-mɛmɛwolani ti ɓaaɠoni mà, ti ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga wooʋalada nuiti tètema. <verse eid="EZK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 20:28"/>Gè loni ti luɠɔ, gè li ga tiye naama yooi zu, gè ɠonani ga nà feezu ti ya. Ti gizeiti pɛtɛni miná, ta gulu wolaiti ti ɠaaɓiiliai. Miná ɠa ti ta-zalaɠaiti kulani ná. Ti zìiɠaawana vaiti kɛɛni ná, ta-vebɛani vaiti su, ta zalaɠaiti ti makugi nɛai, ta dɔɔ zalaɠaiti ti ɠɛni ti ʋuuzu ya. <verse eid="EZK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 20:29"/>Gè ɠɛni ti ma: Zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti wa ɗa li náti, naati ta ga leeni? É zo naama yee ma eyɛsu za, naama adaʋɛti daasei ka ga zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti.›<verse eid="EZK 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 20:30"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, bo Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Wo la ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔzu nɛi ɓaa, ga wo-mɛmɛwolani kɛʋele? Wa bɛ̀ ga wooʋalada nuiti, wa koloɠologi ɠɛɛzu siɛgi zu wo ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani ɲɔiti dɛbizu la! <verse eid="EZK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 20:31"/>Niizu niina, wa ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔzu, wa ʋaana ga zalaɠaiti ta wo wo-lointi kula ga zalaɠaiti kɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti bɛ. Naa maaʋele ma, Izilayɛle nuiti, wa kaazu ga nà vaa bu, wo gàazaɠa? Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, gè la vaa bu wo ʋa gàazaɠa pɛ,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faa niinɛi lɔɔzeigi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 20:32"/>«Wa-ɠigaiziɛi wo bosu, naa la ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu, wo ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Gá pɔ gi ɠɛ ga zooi zɔiti kɛʋele, gi ɠɛ ga zɔɔma nuɓusɛiti kɛʋele, gi ɗa kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti kɔ, ti ga guluiti ɓaa kɔtuiti.› <verse eid="EZK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 20:33"/>Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, nà masadai ɠɛ wo unda, gè sɛ̀bɛi ta nà-zobogi ɠula kɛlɛma, gè yeeɓe nà-ziiɠaawanai ʋa,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 20:34"/>«Nà wo ɠula nuɓusɛiti saama, gè wo ɠaalɛ ba, wo ɠula zooiti su, ʋɛti wo vazagai náti, gè sɛ̀bɛi ta nà-zobogi ɠula kɛlɛma, gè yeeɓe nà-ziiɠaawanai ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 20:35"/>Nà li ga woye yɛ teʋebai zu, zɔɔma nuɓusɛiti gaazu ɠɔpoluma, ade lo ɠaazu, gè wo lukpɔ. <verse eid="EZK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 20:36"/>Ʋelei nɔ gè wo-mɛmɛwolani tukpɔni la teʋebai zu, Ezipete yooi ɠobaʋɛ, zekana nà kɛ la ga woye, wa ɓalaa,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é boga. <verse eid="EZK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 20:37"/>«Nà wo leʋe nà-tukpɔi wu, gè li ga woye ʋolu nà-minazeɠegi ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 20:38"/>Nà kololala nuiti kula wo zaama, niiti ti wuzeɠeni dàalɔɠɔma. Nà ti ɠula zooiti ba, ʋɛti ti náti seikɔɠɔmai zu, kɛlɛ ti la ɠalega ma Izilayɛle yooi zu pɛ. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="EZK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 20:39"/>«Wa ʋe, Izilayɛle nuiti, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹À liina, wo wa-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti dɛbi! Kɛlɛ naa ʋoluma, kɛni nɔ wo ɠolo bɛ̀, wo ɓe dàasei ɲadegai ɠoloɠolosu ga wa-vebɛaniiti wo ti ɠulazu ga zalaɠaiti kɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 20:40"/>Tama Izilayɛle yooi zu nuɓusɛiti pɛ ta lɛbiyai ve bɛ̀ nà-gize ɲadegai ma, Izilayɛle ná-gize ɠaaɠoozagi ma. Nà yeezei wo wu miná ga pagɔ, gè bo wo ma ga wo ʋa ga anii pɛ pɔ̀ niiti wo ti veezu bɛ̀, ta wa-vebɛani mɔungiti, ani ʋagɔi kpein,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 20:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 20:41"/>« ‹Nà wo ɠula nuɓusɛiti saama, gè wo ɠaalɛ ba, wo ɠula zooiti su, ʋɛti wo vazagai náti. Wa zìima eɠɛ gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi. Nà nà-ɲadedai ɠula kɛlɛma ga wo maaʋele zii ɠiligiti gaazu. <verse eid="EZK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 20:42"/>Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, siɛgi zu gè ʋaazu la ga woye ʋolu Izilayɛle yooi zu, gè ma ɠona woni wo-mɛmɛwolani bɛ ga nà fe wo ya. <verse eid="EZK 20:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 20:43"/>Miná ɠa wa ɠisiɛ ná wo-ziɛ ʋele wɔlɔmaiti su, ta wo luʋa ʋeleiti ti wo ɠɔzɔni. Wa lɛɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ zu, tɔɔzei faa ɲɔi pɛ ba wo kɛɛni. <verse eid="EZK 20:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 20:44"/>Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, siɛgi zu gè wo zosu da ɠana, dàaseigi maaʋele ma, gè la ʋaazu wo zosu ga wo luʋa ʋelei ta wo-ziɛ ʋele ɲɔiti, Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 20:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EZK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 21:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 21:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɠaaʋote lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋelei, ɠaazulo zooi ʋa lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu yeezazuʋɛ. Zelii lo dɔɓɔi ma lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu yeezazuʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 21:3"/>Ɗa ɠɛ nu yeezazu lɔɓɔi ma: ‹Woilo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ma! Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà ɠa gè abui ɠaazosu è ʋa, toɠa gulu wundui pɛ gala ta gulu vɔɔi pɛ. Ani nɔpɛ ge la zooga ma abuzogi ʋaazu, toɠa vaza é zo lɛkpɛma nu yeezazuʋɛ, é li lɛkpɛma nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, ná pɛ, ná-galai ɠa zeeli ɛsɛ pɛ ma. <verse eid="EZK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 21:4"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ka ka ga nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa gè abui ɠaazogai, ani la zooga é ʋa paa pɛ.› » <verse eid="EZK 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 21:5"/>Gè gooɠaaʋoteni, gè ɠɛ ma: «Ee, Màliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI! Ta ɓɔɛzu unsu ga ze, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Faalaali wo nu nɔ ʋe.› »<verse eid="EZK 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 21:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 21:7"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɠaazu lati Zeluzalɛme ma, zelii lo zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti ma. GALA goo wo Izilayɛle yooi laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="EZK 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 21:8"/>Ɠɛ Izilayɛle yooi ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà laalɛɛzu è wu, nà nà-boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠulazu ma laɠagi zu, gè telebo nuiti ta faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti tɔɔɠula wo zaama. <verse eid="EZK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 21:9"/>Telebo nuiti ta faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti suwuɠaaleʋe vai ɠa é kɛɛzu gè nà-boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠulazu la ma laɠagi zu, gè pili ɛsɛ pɛ ma, é zo lɛkpɛma nu yeezazuʋɛ, é li lɛkpɛma nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 21:10"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ka suɠwɛɛ ga nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gè nà-boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠulani ma laɠagi zu. Gè la mɔnɔ dɔa su pɛ.› »<verse eid="EZK 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 21:11"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, maaʋɛɛ kiteʋe ɠasɔi wu, è ɗa ɓala ti pɛ gaazu ga ziizoolɛi. <verse eid="EZK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 21:12"/>Siɛgi zu ti è ɠaazaɠasu da ga: ‹Lee vaa zu è ɓalasu?› ɗa ti wooɠaaʋote, è ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Gè woo ɲɔu mɛnigɛ, toɠa ʋaazu ʋilɛsu su. Ɛsɛ pɛ iɲɔ ka leʋe, ti yeezu ɠɛ yɔɔɠɛ, ti yiiɓɔlɔ, ti ɲiibiiti suɓɔlɔ, ti ɗa ziɠa ɓɔɠɔ ʋa. Adea ɠaa! Naa ɠa ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu niina!› Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.»<verse eid="EZK 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 21:13"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 21:14"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, GALA gooi wo! Ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Maliɠii wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:14">Wɛlɛ boɠa zɔkpɔi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:14">gaaliai, é ɗa volo.<verse eid="EZK 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 21:15"/>Gaaliʋɛ paa wo fai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:15">toɠa volozu, é ʋa ɗa mainmain zaɠa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:15">Da zoo nɛi de ɠoozunɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:15">dòun zunui masagi ná-tukpɔi ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:15">Boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠa ɗa gulu ɓuɠai naama zii wɔinzeɠe.<verse eid="EZK 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 21:16"/>Gè feeni ga maaloun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:16">ga so daa ʋa nɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:16">gaalini maaloun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:16">ga é ve paa wo nui ya.<verse eid="EZK 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 21:17"/>Kidaaʋili kpeei loo, ɗa ʋe, zunui!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:17">Boɠa zɔkpɔi tɛi ka liizu nà-nuɓusɛiti daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:17">ta Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:17">ti pɛ ti undaaʋilisu ʋɔɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:17">Yeeloo ɓɛtɛaga ga kidaaʋiligi!<verse eid="EZK 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 21:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ʋoluɠula wola ɠana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:18">Ni masagi ná-tukpɔi nii boɠa zɔkpɔi wɔinzeɠezu, naa a ɲɛɛlɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:18">leeni ɠa a ɠɛ?›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:18">Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 21:19"/>Deɠɛmu, ɗa ʋe, zunui, GALA goo wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:19">yee felegɔiti gaaloɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:19">mazɔlɔɔ boɠa zɔkpɔi ʋili, daa ɠa ɠɛ fele, saʋa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:19">Mazɔlɔɔ nu ʋaa woɠa zɔkpɔi ʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:19">nu mɔinmɔin paa woɠa zɔkpɔi ʋe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:19">a ʋilɛ ti ʋolu adaʋɛ pɛ.<verse eid="EZK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 21:20"/>É iɲɔteʋei lɔ ɛsɛ ziimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:20">é nui pɛ ziiɓali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:20">Nà nu ʋaa woɠa zɔkpɔi la siɠidaʋɛti pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:20">é ɗa volo eɠɛ mainmain,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:20">kɛʋele ɓɛtɛai ga é paai wo.<verse eid="EZK 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 21:21"/>Boɠa zɔkpɔ ɠaaligi, è-ɠaaʋɛɛ naa ɠaaliai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:21">ʋili è yeezazuʋɛ, ʋili è ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:21">Ɠaaʋɛɛ lati adaʋɛ pɛ!<verse eid="EZK 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 21:22"/>Nà ɓalaagi nà yealoɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:22">gè nà-ziiɠulagi laazeeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:22">Nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gè boga.»<verse eid="EZK 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme zo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 21:23"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà:<verse eid="EZK 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 21:24"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, pele felegɔ la ti ɠula zou ɠilagi zu, nii Ɓaɓilɔne masagi a ziɛ la, é ʋa ga ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi. Ɗa poogi ʋilɛ ma ʋele undaʋɛti, é taa wolai ɠilagilagi letema lɛɛzu. <verse eid="EZK 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 21:25"/>Pele ɠilagi ɠa li ga Ɓaɓilɔne ɠɔɔɓɔgi Amɔn nuiti ta-laa wolai zu é ga Laɓa, zɔi li Zeluzalɛme, siɠigi ma, Zuda yooi zu. <verse eid="EZK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 21:26"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɓaɓilɔne masagi ɠa lo pele felegɔiti saɠalaʋɛ ga ungaiziɛi. É ɗa ná-mɛɛinti pili, é ɗa ná-pɛlɛ wu zaleiti gaazaɠa, é ɗa ma mɔɛin ʋɛtɛ. <verse eid="EZK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 21:27"/>Mɛɛin é Zeluzalɛme zoni, naa looni zeezai ɠa, ʋɛ ta kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti to ná, ti nu ʋaa wolai ɠɛ ná, ti kɔɔ ɓeei loo, ti wooɠula la. Ti kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti gili ná kpogiti ba, ti kɔɔɠɔ yeɠeiti bɔ, ti lɔɔɠuzuʋɛti kpɛtɛ ná. <verse eid="EZK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 21:28"/>Zeluzalɛme nuiti ti ɠɛni ɠigaiziɛzu ga ungaiziɛi naa la faa nɔpɛ kɛa ga tiye, tɔɔzei minazeɠe ka ná é ti makɛsu. Kɛlɛ Ɓaɓilɔne masagi ɠa ta-vaaɠaazagi lɛɛzu ga tiye, é ti lɛnɛ ga ta zosu. <verse eid="EZK 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 21:29"/>Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Wa kitoozu yeenɔpɛ wa-vaaɠaazagi zu ga wa-lɔ koloɠologi maaʋele, gaaɠalagai, wa dɛɛzu wa-ɠɛɛwotiiti pɛ su ga wa ga sɔba nuiti. Tama, tɔɔzei wo faiti gaazuloga ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, wa lɔ wo zili nui yeezu.<verse eid="EZK 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 21:30"/>« ‹Ɗa ʋe, Izilayɛle ɠundiɠii, tɔɠɔ ɠoloɠolo nui, nu ɲɔi, ɗa-voloi ɠa zeeli, yeei ɗa-vaaɠaazagiti pɛ gaaɓelazu la. <verse eid="EZK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 21:31"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Ɗa ʋala ɗa-masadai ma ʋoogi ma, ti ɗa-masa bɔɔlɔgi zeɠe. Faiti ta valibo! Zɔi é ɓɔɠɔmaayeizu, naa wɔɔlɔ, zɔi é ɓɔɠɔ wɔɔlɔzu, naa ɠaayei. <verse eid="EZK 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 21:32"/>Faa zuɠoloɠologi, faa zuɠoloɠologi! Nà naa zuɠoloɠolo, nii kɛɠala la dɛ ɠɛɛni, eyɛsu naa ʋa, zɔi nɔnɔ ga tukpɔɠaaleʋei, zɔi gè naa ɠalivaazu ma.› »<verse eid="EZK 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amɔn nuiti sala vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 21:33"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, GALA gooi wo, ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa Amɔn nuiti ma, é ʋilɛ ta-ɓaaɠulama vaiti ba. Ɠɛ ti ma: Boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠulaa ma laɠagi zu, paa wo fai ma, toɠa volozu, é ʋa teʋei wo, é ʋa mainmainti kula. <verse eid="EZK 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 21:34"/>Siɛgi zu ti zɛɛ ɠulakɛlɛmaiti bosu la wo ma, ta faawokɛɛyeeluɠɔ yɛɛ ɓɔɛiti, boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠa ʋaazu GALA kwɛɛtala nuiti unteʋezu ta nu ɲɔiti, ta-vaaɠaazagi ɠaaɓela foloi zeelia.<verse eid="EZK 21:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 21:35"/>« ‹Boɠa zɔkpɔi lɔɔna ma laɠagi zu. Ʋɛ è ɓɛtɛni ná, zooi ti è zɔlɔɔni su, miná ɠa gè è lukpɔzu ná. <verse eid="EZK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 21:36"/>Nà nà-ziiɠaawanai lɛ ga ɗe, gè nà-ziiɠula abui lo è ʋa, nà è lɔ toosu nuiti zeezu, ti zoogai faa zuɠoloɠologi la. <verse eid="EZK 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 21:37"/>Ɗa ɠɛ ga abuzogi laamianigi, è-ɲamai ɠa ʋu zooi zu ná pɛ. Nu nɔpɛ ki ge la mɔ loa è zu pɛ. Nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa kpɔ̀ɛai.› »<verse eid="EZK 21:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EZK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme ɲamaba vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 22:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 22:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ è Zeluzalɛme taai lukpɔɠaaleʋe, sulaavegɛ ga nu ʋaa vai, mina inɛinɛ! È ná-kɔzɔba vaiti dɛɛ la. <verse eid="EZK 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 22:3"/>Ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Ɗa ɗa-nuɓusɛiti zɛsu ná, ti ɗa nu ʋaa vai ɠɛ, ti ɗa ti ɠoloɠolo foloi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ ɠana, ti ɗa kɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti kpɛtɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ. <verse eid="EZK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 22:4"/>È-laazɔgi ɠa nu ʋaa vai naati pɛ su, è ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔni ga kɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti è ti ɓɛtɛni. È è ɠoloɠolo foloiti suɓuɠaa, ɗa-ɠonagiti kpe geei zeelia. Naa ɠa é ba, nà ɓaaɠulazu è ma zii ɠiligiti pɛ gaazu, è ɠɛ ga ɲɛɛɠulasu anii zooiti pɛ zea. <verse eid="EZK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 22:5"/>È-lɔɠɔi ɠoloɠologa, ɗa-vaiti ti zupu. Zooiti ti è ɠoba, ta zooiti ti maaɠoozaai è ʋa, ti pɛ ta ɲɛɛɠula è zu.<verse eid="EZK 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 22:6"/>« ‹È ʋɔ bɛ ɠa Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti ti yeelaazu ná ta-zobogi ma, ti ɗa nu ʋaa vaiti kɛ. <verse eid="EZK 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 22:7"/>È ʋɔ bɛ ɠa ti ti-ɠɛɛni pɛlɛʋɛlɛsu ná ta ti-leeni, è ʋɔ bɛ nɔ ɠa ti seikɔɠɔma nuiti suziɠazu ná, ti ɗa podointi ta poanzaiti kpɔnɔ ná. <verse eid="EZK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 22:8"/>Ti la unfema veezu nà-ada ɲadegaiti bɛ, ti ɗa dooɠo foloiti maaɲɛɛi ʋu ma. <verse eid="EZK 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 22:9"/>È ʋɔ bɛ, nuiti ta tɔɠɔ ɠoloɠolo faiti kɛɛzu, ti ʋa nui ʋaa. Ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ta zalaɠaiti miizu gizeiti ma, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ve koloɠologi ya. <verse eid="EZK 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 22:10"/>È ʋɔ bɛ ɠa tanigaa ti laazu ná ga ti-ɠɛɛ anzai. È ʋɔ bɛ ɠa ti ʋuuzu ná anzanui ma ná-alu kaa ziɛgi zu. <verse eid="EZK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 22:11"/>È ʋɔ bɛ, tanigaa ta wɛɛnziɛgi wosu ga ti-zeiɲɔɠɔi anzai, tanigaa ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ ga ti la ga ti-loun anzai, ɓaa ti-ʋaazeelai. <verse eid="EZK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 22:12"/>È ʋɔ bɛ, ta ɗa lobɛanii zo ga ti nui ʋaa. Ta ɗa walii ve, ti maalamai ʋooʋa ma, ti ɗa loo ti-zeiɲɔɠɔiti ma, ti ʋa ɓɛtɛ. Nɛ̀i gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ti yeema nɔ̀un ma mɛtu,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 22:13"/>« ‹Wɛlɛ nà ʋaazu yealoɠazu è ma, tɔɔzei tɔnɔ ɲɔi ʋa è sɔlɔɔni, ta nu ʋaa vai ʋa kɛai è ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 22:14"/>È-yii ɠa lɔɔ nɛi ɓaa, zobo ge ɠɛ è ya, naama volo ná, nà wuzeɠena è laalɔɠɔma? Nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa kpɔ̀ɛai, nà kɛ nɔ. <verse eid="EZK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 22:15"/>Nà wo vaza zii ɠiligiti saama, gè wo leʋe wɛɛn yooiti su, gè ɲadetalai ɠula wo zaama mɛtu. <verse eid="EZK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 22:16"/>Ɓaai ɠa ɠula wo ma zii ɠiligiti gaazu. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.› »<verse eid="EZK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 22:17"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 22:18"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠɛa gàazu ga kɔlui kɔzɔi ba. Ti ɠɛa eɠɛ kɔlu ɓɔigi, ɓaa foɠagi, ɓaa kɔlui, ɓaa bɔbɔgi, ti ɠɛa eɠɛ kɔzɔi é walii ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 22:19"/>Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Wo pɛ wo ɠɛa ga kɔlui kɔzɔi ba. Nà ʋaazu wo ɠaalɛɛzu ba Zeluzalɛme taazuʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 22:20"/>Eɠɛʋelei nu a ɗa pɔlɔi ɠaalɛ ba la, nii walii su, ta kɔlu ɓɔigi, ta kɔlui, ta bɔbɔgi, ɓaa foɠagi, é pu ani ɠaawuun aniɲakai ta zu, é abui zei bu ga gaawuun, ʋele ɠana nà wo ɠaalɛ ba la nà-ziiɠaawanai zu, zìi a ɠulana, gè wo ɠaalɛ ba, wo ɠaawuun abui ɠa! <verse eid="EZK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 22:21"/>Zeluzalɛme ɓɔɠɔi nɔ ɠa nà wo ɠaalɛ ba ná, gè nà-ziiɠaawana abui zei wo wu, wo ɠaawuun. <verse eid="EZK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 22:22"/>Eɠɛʋelei walii ɠaa a ɗa wuun da zeɠei zu, ʋele ɠana wo ɠaawuunsu da Zeluzalɛme taa zaamaʋɛ. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga, nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa zìiɠaawanaai wo ma.› »<verse eid="EZK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 22:23"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 22:24"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɠɛ Zeluzalɛme ma: ‹Ɗa ga zooi é la ɲadeni, zooi tona la ɠɛni ʋuuni su nà-ziiɠaawana voloi. <verse eid="EZK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 22:25"/>Ná-kundiɠiiti ta yaavai lɔɔzu, eɠɛ zalai é zikɔzu, é ɗa daamianigi ʋali ga, ti ɗa nuiti paa, ti loo waliiti su ta ti-zeiɲɔɠɔiti zeaɠɔligiti, ti anzanui bɔɔlɔzu ɠɛ ga poanzaiti. <verse eid="EZK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 22:26"/>Ná-zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta nà-tɔgiti koloɠolosu, ti la unfesu nà-zalaɠa ɠulazu ɲadegaiti ma. Ti la zoosu zeeɠaaɠwɛɛzu ɠwɛɛsu ani ɲadegai ta ɲadetala gelei ʋa, naa ʋɛɛ nii ʋa kɔzɔai ta nii é la ɠɔzɔni. Ta ɠaazuzeɠezu nà-dooɠo foloiti ba, nu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ unfesu mà ti zaama. <verse eid="EZK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 22:27"/>Nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti ta ga ɲama ʋuu nuiti, eɠɛ zuluɓuiti ti ti-laamianigi ʋalizu ga, ti nui ʋaazu, ti ʋa ɓɛtɛ. <verse eid="EZK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 22:28"/>Ná-GALA goo wo nuiti ta naa pɛ maalɔɔɠuzu kobe siaai wu, ti ɗa kpɛtɛ kisu ɠulakɛlɛma vaiti bo, ti ɗa zɛɛ vaawokɛɛyeeluɠɔ vaiti bo, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa, tama Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laade é ʋa ɓɔɛ ti ʋɔ. <verse eid="EZK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 22:29"/>Zooi zu ná pɛ, ta toomai wosu, ta unmai, ti ɗa maawɔin nuiti suziɠa, ta bala nuiti, ti ɗa loo seikɔɠɔma nuiti ma ti ʋee vai zu.<verse eid="EZK 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 22:30"/>« ‹Gè wɛlɛni ti zaama fɔ nà nu ɠila ka, a siɠigi lo ti ma, é lo siɠigi ma yeɠeiti daaʋɛ bɛ̀, é zooi maalobo, nà ʋa koloɠolo, kɛlɛ gè la nu nɔpɛ sɔlɔɔni. <verse eid="EZK 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 22:31"/>Naazu gè nà-ziiɠulagi laazeelia ti ma, gè ti ɠoloɠolo nà-ziiɠaawana abui zu, gè ti luʋa ʋelei ma ɠasɔi la ti unma,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 22:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EZK 23"/>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme ta Samali ta-nɛɛbɛ ɲɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 23:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 23:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, anzanu felegɔ ɠɛni ná, ti zɔlɔɔgai anzanu ɠilagi ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 23:3"/>Ti ɓɔɠɔ lɔɔni koloɠologi zu Ezipete yooi zu ti ma nu niinɛlai zu. Miná ɠa mɔunpa ti yeeziɛni ná ti-yiilaʋɛ ma, anzalopo ɲiimii é ɠɛni ti ʋa, ti naa maaɲɔfɔni ná. <verse eid="EZK 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 23:4"/>Ma mɔungi laaseigi ɠɛni ga Woɠola, deɠe anzanui laa ɠɛ ga Woɠoliɓa. Ma mɔungi ɠa é ga Samali, felesiɛi ɠɛ ga Zeluzalɛme. Ti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga nɔ̀nɔ, ti doun zunuiti ta doun anzanuiti sɔlɔɔni bɛ̀.<verse eid="EZK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 23:5"/>«Kɛlɛ Woɠola koloɠologi ɠɛɛni, anɛɛ ni é ɠɛni ga nɔ̀nɔ. É ɠaazuɠulani seiɲɔɠɔiti ba, Asiili nuiti, é wɛɛnɠaa zoni ti zaama. <verse eid="EZK 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 23:6"/>Ti maaɠiliai ga seɠe ɓɔigiti, zou zɛʋɛ maazu vaawo nuiti ta kundiɠiiti, buzeɠe niinɛgiti ti ɠaazuɠulaai, kɔɔɠɔ nuiti ti sooiti kɔma. <verse eid="EZK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 23:7"/>Woɠola ɓɔɠɔ lɔɔni koloɠologi zu Asiili nu wolaiti zea. Siɛnɔpɛ su a la ɓɔɠɔ veena la ti ta ya, é ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔzu ga é ɗa nɔkɔ ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti bu. <verse eid="EZK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 23:8"/>Zɛgɛ ná-wɛɛnziɛ fai ʋolu, nii é tɔɔzeini Ezipete yooi zu. É ɠɛni miná ga doungo, zunuiti ti ɗa laa la, ti ɗa anzalopo ɲiimii maaɲɔfɔ, ti ta-ɠoloɠologi pɛ puuni ma. <verse eid="EZK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 23:9"/>Naa ɠa é ba, gè dɔa ná-wɛɛinti zeezu, Asiili nuiti, gola wɔinɗai ga tiye. <verse eid="EZK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 23:10"/>Naati ti kabei ɠulani, ti ná-doun zunuiti so ta ná-doun anzanuiti, ti tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ʋaa ga boɠa zɔkpɔi. É zalai zɔlɔɔni ga tukpɔi naa, é ɠɛ ga poogi anzanuiti bɛ.<verse eid="EZK 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 23:11"/>«Ná-seelai Woɠoliɓa naa pɛ kaani, kɛlɛ tɔun ge ɠoloɠoloni ná-gaazuɠulapɔi zu, ná-koloɠologi ɲɔu é leʋe ná-seelai nɔnɔi ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 23:12"/>Tɔ ɓalaagi ɠaazuɠulani Asiili nuiti ba, zou zɛʋɛ maazu vaawo nuiti ta kundiɠiiti, ti maaɠiliai ga pagɔ, kɔɔɠɔ nuiti ti sooiti kɔma, buzeɠe niinɛgiti ti ɠaazuɠulaai. <verse eid="EZK 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 23:13"/>Gè kaani ga é ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔni koloɠologi zu. Ti felegɔ pɛ ti-ziɛ ʋelei ɠɛni ga ɠɛʋele.<verse eid="EZK 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 23:14"/>«Woɠoliɓa ta ɓɔni mɔnɔ ná-koloɠologi ʋa. É nuiti maaniinigi ɠaani seɠeai ga yeei siɠigi ma, kpɔiɗai, Ɓaɓilɔne nuiti maaniinigi ɠɛni de. <verse eid="EZK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 23:15"/>Ti zaamaɠiliai ga saamaɠiligiti, seɠe zakpai velevelegai tɔungiti ma, ti ɠaazulo pelei dɛɛzu ga ta ga kɔɔɠɔ nuiti. Ɓaɓilɔne nuiti maaniini kiteɠitegi ʋe, ʋelei ti la Kaledé, ta-yooi ɓɔɠɔi zu. <verse eid="EZK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 23:16"/>Woɠoliɓa ti ɠaai ma, gaazuɠulani ti ʋa, é keelai leʋeni ti ma ta-yooi zu. <verse eid="EZK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 23:17"/>Naa ma, Ɓaɓilɔne nuiti ti liini, ti laa la. Ti kɔzɔni ga ta-ɠoloɠologi. Ti ɓegai ma ga ɓaaɠulaai ma mɛtu, ta-vai wɔinzeɠeni ma. <verse eid="EZK 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 23:18"/>É ná-koloɠolo fai ɠulani kɛlɛma ɛsɛ pɛ bɛ, é ɓɔɠɔ ɠabei lɛɛni, eyɛsu ná-fai wɔinzeɠe mà, eɠɛʋelei nɔ ná-seelai ná-fai wɔinzeɠeni mà la. <verse eid="EZK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 23:19"/>Kɛlɛ é ná-koloɠologi zuwɔɔlɔni, eɠɛʋelei nɔ ná-nu niinɛlai zu ɠɛɛni la, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni koloɠologi ɠɛɛzu la Ezipete yooi zu. <verse eid="EZK 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 23:20"/>Gaazuɠulani koloɠolo zunuiti ba, é wɔin ga tiye, niiti ti-wuu wɔɔlɔai ga soovalegiti kɛʋele, ta ti ma ɗɛi ʋuuzu ga sooiti tɔnɔi ɠɛʋele. <verse eid="EZK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 23:21"/>È ɗa-nu niinɛlai ma ɠoloɠologi lɔɔzeiɗa ʋolu, siɛgi zu Ezipete nuiti ti ɠɛni è-yiilaʋɛ maaɲɔfɔsu la, ti yeeziɛ ɗa-anzalopo ɲiimii ma.<verse eid="EZK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 23:22"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, Woɠoliɓa, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Nà ɗa-wɛɛinti buzeɠezu è laalɔɠɔma. Niiti ta-vai wɔinzeɠeni è ma, nà ʋaazu ga tiye è laalɔɠɔma, ti zeɠe adaʋɛ pɛ. <verse eid="EZK 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 23:23"/>Nà Ɓaɓilɔne nuiti buzeɠezu è laalɔɠɔma, Kaledé nuiti pɛ, ta Pekɔde nuiti, ta Soa nuiti, ta Koa nuiti, Asiili nuiti pɛ ta ʋɛɛ ti ʋa. Nà buzeɠe niinɛgiti gaalɛ ba, nu ɠaazu a ɠula ti ʋa, zou zɛʋɛ maazu vaawo nuiti, ta kundiɠiiti, kɔɔɠuluɓaiti ti zoogai, kundiɠi wolaiti, kɔɔɠɔ nuiti ti sooiti kɔma. <verse eid="EZK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 23:24"/>Ta ʋa è laalɔɠɔma ga ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti pɛ, ta kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti, ta kɔɔɓɔgi nu la gaaluga. Ti ɓɔɠɔ makɛ ga kɔɔɠɔ ɠɔlu zɛpɛ koiti ta ma wolaiti, ta bɔɔlɔgiti, ta è maalati mini-o-mini. Nà è lukpɔ vai yɛ ti yeezu, ta è lukpɔɠaaleʋe, é zoloo tiya ɓɔɠɔi ta-lɔgiti ma. <verse eid="EZK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 23:25"/>Nà-ziiɠaawanai gè su è laalɔɠɔma, nà è yɛ ná, ti è zopele ɲɔu. Ta è-zokpai leʋe ta è-woiiti, zɔiti ta yɛ vulua, ta loo bu ga ta-woɠa zɔkpɔiti. Ta è-loun zunuiti seɠe ta è-loun anzanuiti, ta zɔiti ta yɛ vulua, ti ti ma vului ɠala abui zu. <verse eid="EZK 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 23:26"/>Ta ɗa-zeɠeiti kula è ma ta ɗa-maaɠili zɔɔlaiti. <verse eid="EZK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 23:27"/>Ɗa-eteai è siɛni koloɠologi zu, koloɠologi è tɔɔzeini Ezipete yooi zu, naa ɠa ɓe niina. È ɠaazu la mɔ ɠulaa nu nɔpɛ ba, è-ɠi ge la mɔ ʋilɛga Ezipete nuiti ba eyɛsu pɛ.<verse eid="EZK 23:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 23:28"/>« ‹Mazɔlɔɔ Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà ʋaazu ɠɛlɛzu ɗa, è yɛ naati zea niiti ti wɔinzeɠeai è ma, è lɔ naati zeezu niiti ti la è yiimani. <verse eid="EZK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 23:29"/>Ta è zo ga sili zogi, ta è-mɔɔlɛzu anii pɛ seɠe, ti è maaɲakai ɠula eɠɛ koloɠolo anzanui. Ɗa-ɠoloɠologi ta ɗa-wɛɛnziɛgi ɠana, <verse eid="EZK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 23:30"/>ta è zo ɠana, mazɔlɔɔ è koloɠologi ɠɛɛni wa zii ɠiligiti, è ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔni ga ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti. <verse eid="EZK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 23:31"/>È ziɛni ga è-ʋaazeelai ziɛ ʋelei. Tɔ-o, ɗa-o, wa ɓɔɔle ga nà-ziiɠaawana ɗaawɔi.<verse eid="EZK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 23:32"/>« ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:32">Ɗa ɓɔɔle ga ziawɔ ɠilagi naa nɔ è-ʋaazeelai ɓɔɔleni la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:32">ziawɔ be bɔɔlɔai, kpogi ɠooza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:32">toɠa ɠɛ ga ɲɛɛɠulasu ɠani, ta ɓaaɠulamai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:32">mazɔlɔɔ su vai wola mɔinʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 23:33"/>È laa ɠa ve ga dɔɔzodai ta ziizoolɛi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:33">Ziawɔi nii ɠa ga faa zuɠoloɠologi ta maalua anii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:33">ɗa-zeelai Samali ná-ziawɔi ʋe.<verse eid="EZK 23:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 23:34"/>Ɗa ɓɔɔle la, è suwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:34">ɗa golowolo ga è-ɲiigaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:34">è è-ɠakazuʋɛ maawana ga ma ɓuɠaiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:34">Mazɔlɔɔ nà ɠa gè boga,› »</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:34">Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 23:35"/>« ‹Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Mazɔlɔɔ è yeemani mà, è ʋoluaveni bà, è pìli ya ʋoluʋelei, ɗa ɗa-wɛɛnziɛgi ta ɗa-ɠoloɠologi zuɓoloi ɠɔmɔ.› »<verse eid="EZK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ge zelii lo fai <optbreak/> Samali ta Zeluzalɛme ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 23:36"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ, è Woɠola ta Woɠoliɓa lukpɔɠaaleʋe. Ta-ɠɔzɔba vaiti dɛɛ ga tiye, ti ti ɠɛɛni. <verse eid="EZK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 23:37"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti ɓɔɠɔ lɔɔni wɛɛnziɛgi zu, ti yee ɠa ɲama ʋuu vai zu. Ti koloɠologi ɠɛɛni ga ti nɔkɔ fai kɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti bu, ti nu ʋaai ɠɛ, ti-loun zunuiti ti ti veeni bɛ̀, naati kula vai zu kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti bɛ ga zalaɠai. <verse eid="EZK 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 23:38"/>Wɛlɛ nii ɠa mɔnɔ ti kɛɛni ga ze! Folo ɠilagi nɔ, ti sèizu ɲadegai ɠɔzɔni, ti nà-dooɠo foloiti maaɲɛɛi ʋu ma. <verse eid="EZK 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 23:39"/>Tama ti ti-loun zunuiti kulaai ma ga zalaɠai ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti bɛ, naama voloi nɔ ɠa ti liini la sèizu ɲadegai, ga ti ná ɠɔzɔ. Naa ɠa ti kɛɛni sèi ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ɓɔɠɔi wu.<verse eid="EZK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 23:40"/>«Tiya ɓɔɠɔi ti keelai leʋeni, ti zunuiti gaiziɛ, ti ti loli, ti zeɠe ɠoozama, ti ʋa. Gaamago nɔ, naati ti keela wooi zɔlɔɔni, ti ɓizɛ, ti ʋa ti ʋɔ bɛ. Ta-vaa ɠa, ti ɓɔɠɔ maagbani la, ti aniiti siɛ ɠaazuʋɛti, ti balaiti dɔ. <verse eid="EZK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 23:41"/>Naa ʋolu ti zeini bete ʋagɔ wolai ma, ti taɓalii ʋilɛ ɠakalaʋɛ, ti nà-ansansegi ta nà-gulɔiti sei ga. <verse eid="EZK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 23:42"/>Nu mɔinmɔin ge ʋaani ti ʋɔ bɛ, bɛbɛi ɠɛni zɔɔlɛzu ná, maaɠili la ti ma. Zunu ɓulu golai ʋaani, ti ɠula teʋebai zu ná pɛ. Ti balaiti dɔ zeela nu felegɔiti zeeiti ba, ti masa bɔɔlɔ pagɔiti dɔ tɔungiti ba.<verse eid="EZK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 23:43"/>«Názu ɠa gè ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠani da, gè ɠɛ ma: ‹Anzanui pɔlɔzaɠagai ná wɛɛnziɛgi zu, naa ɠa dɛ ɓɔɠɔ lɔɔzu koloɠologi zu! <verse eid="EZK 23:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 23:44"/>Zunuiti ta ʋilɛsu polu, eɠɛʋelei ti ʋilɛsu la koloɠolo anzanui ʋolu! Ʋele ɠana ti ʋilɛsu la Woɠola ʋolu ta Woɠoliɓa, koloɠolo anzanui tɛiti!› <verse eid="EZK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 23:45"/>Kɛlɛ zunuiti ti lelebogai, naati ka ta anzanuiti tukpɔɠaaleʋe, eɠɛʋelei ta ɗa wɛɛnziɛ anzanuiti tukpɔɠaaleʋe la, ta anzanuiti niiti ti-yee ɲama ʋuu vai zu! Mazɔlɔɔ ta ga wɛɛnziɛ anzanuiti, naa ʋoluma ɲamai ɠa ti-yeeiti ma.»<verse eid="EZK 23:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 23:46"/>«Mazɔlɔɔ Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹À bɛbɛi ɠaalɛ ba, ti li ti laalɔɠɔma, ti ti lɔ kidaaʋiligi zu, ti loo ti zu, ti ti maavo. <verse eid="EZK 23:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 23:47"/>Bɛbɛi naa ɠa ti zɔɔ ga kɔtuiti, ti ti ɓulukpulu ga boɠa zɔkpɔi, ti ti-loun zunuiti paa, ta ti-loun anzanuiti, ti ta-ʋɛlɛiti gala ga abui. <verse eid="EZK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 23:48"/>Nà koloɠologi ɠula ɠana zooi ʋa. Anzanuiti ta lɛnɛ naazu, ti la mɔ ʋokɔɠɔga ti-ʋaazeela felegɔiti ma koloɠologi zu. <verse eid="EZK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 23:49"/>Anzanui tɛiti ta ta-wɛɛnziɛgi ma zalai zɔlɔɔ, ta ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti kɔɔ vai ma ɠotoi zuɓoloi ɠɔmɔ. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.› »<verse eid="EZK 23:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EZK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme ʋokɔɠɔ fai <optbreak/> kɔlu liɠii ma koikoigi sogai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 24:1"/>Konagi laaʋuusiɛi ma alu puugɔi ma volo puugɔi ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 24:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, za voloi zɛʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ za voloi ɠa Ɓaɓilɔne masagi tɔɔzeizu la ga Zeluzalɛme zeiɗa kɛlɛ su. <verse eid="EZK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 24:3"/>Faalaalii ta wo kololala nuɓusɛiti ma, ɗa ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:3">Kɔlu liɠi ɠila kpɛtɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:3">Ziɛi ʋu su.<verse eid="EZK 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 24:4"/>Sua ɓulukpulugiti pu su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:4">ma ɓulukpulu pagɔiti, ma ɓalai, ma ɓakigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:4">daave ga ma ɠae ʋagɔiti.<verse eid="EZK 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 24:5"/>Baalagi zeɠe pagai gola ma ɓulugiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:5">koʋii ʋu diɠii wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:5">è ti pɛ gili ga abu wolai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:5">mazɔlɔɔ kɛni ma ɠaeiti ɓalaa ti ɠili.<verse eid="EZK 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 24:6"/>« ‹Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Maanɔɠɔi ɠa nu ʋaa laai luɠɔ, kulaʋɛ ga diɠii koikoigai, nu la zooga é ʋa gba, é ʋa ɠula ba! Ma ɓuɠaiti kula su ga gilagila, ta la yɛga su ga kpakutooma vaa. <verse eid="EZK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 24:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɲamai é puuni, toɠa dɛ ná. É ʋuuni kɔtu ɲakai ma, é la puuni zooi ma, fufiligi ʋa ʋɛɛ gaazu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 7:13-14">Lev 7:13-14</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="EZK 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 24:8"/>Gè ɲamai naa yɛni kɔtu ɲakai ma, ʋɛ é la zooga lɔɔɠuzu ná, nii a kɛ é nà-ziiɠaawana wolai wuzeɠe, é kìtoo su ga kɛni gè potokulai ɠɛ.<verse eid="EZK 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 24:9"/>« ‹Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Maanɔɠɔi ɠa nu ʋaa laai luɠɔ! Mazɔlɔɔ nà ɓalaagi nà koʋi lukpe wolai ʋuuzu ná. <verse eid="EZK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 24:10"/>Koʋii ɠaalɛ ba gola, è abui ɠaazo, suai ɠili vai ɠaaɓela, tufa maku nɛɛnɛgiti pu ma, ma ɠaeiti ti ɠala. <verse eid="EZK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 24:11"/>Diɠi ɲakai zei abulekai ɠa, naa ɠa a kɛ é ɓadi, kɔlui ɓɔi. Naazu nɔɠɔi é su, naa ɠa ɲɛɛlɛ su, koikoigi ɠa ɠala. <verse eid="EZK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 24:12"/>Boti wafuun ka ga naa pɛ! Koikoigi liegɔi é ba, abu laade a naa ɠula ba. <verse eid="EZK 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 24:13"/>Zeluzalɛme, è ɠɔzɔni ga ɗa-ɠoloɠolo kɛɛwotiiti. Gè ɠɛni pɔ gè è ɲade, kɛlɛ è la ɠɛni kɛɛni. È la mɔ ɲadega ɲɛgɛlɛin ɗa-ɠɔzɔba vai zu, eyɛsu è nà-ziiɠaawanai zuɓoloi ɠɔmɔ. <verse eid="EZK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 24:14"/>Nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa kpɔ̀ɛai. Tama yeeɠɛɠalai zeelia, nà kɛ nɔ. Gè la seɠea ma, gè la maawɔinɠaa ɠɛa, gè la nà-devei zeɠea ma. Ta è lukpɔɠaaleʋe é zoloo è luʋa ʋelei ma ta ɗa-ɠɛɛwotiiti.› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ezekiyɛle ná-gɔlɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 24:15"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 24:16"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, nà ʋaazu anzanui naa ɠulazu è ya ga kulafiliba zaai, zɔi è ɠaazulosu ba, è ɗa ɠoozunɛ. Kɛlɛ mina saa gba, mina wɔlɔ, mina va bu è-ɠaazuɗɛi ʋa ʋu pa. <verse eid="EZK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 24:17"/>Ɗa zoo è ɗa ɓala ɠɔ bu, kɛlɛ mina saa gba vaa ɠɛ. Ɗa-zeɠe zakpai velevele unma, è ɗa-zaʋalagiti dɔ. Mina è-ɓɛlɛi maalɔɔɠu. Mina daamiani mi nii è-zeiɲɔɠɔiti ti feezu è ya saa vai zu.»<verse eid="EZK 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 24:18"/>Gè ɓɔɛni nuɓusɛiti pɔ sobui, ma ɓɔkɔi nɔ ànzai za. Poluma zobui, gè naa ɠɛɛni, nii é veeni zèa ga devei. <verse eid="EZK 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 24:19"/>Nuiti ti ɠɛni mà: «È luʋa ʋelei naa è kɛɛzu, bo dɛɛ gi ma, poluʋɛ ɠa ga leeni gi ʋɛ?» <verse eid="EZK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 24:20"/>Gè ti wooɠaaʋoteni ga: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI keela wooi veeʋɛ zèa <verse eid="EZK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 24:21"/>Izilayɛle nuiti wa-vaa zu ga: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà sèizu ɲadegai yɛsu ná ɓaaɠula ma, wa-ɓɔɠɔlɛsu anii, wo-ɠaazuʋɛ ɠoozunɛɛzu ma, wa-ɠito ganii. Wo-loun zunuiti ta wo-loun anzanuiti ti yɛsu Zeluzalɛme, ta ti ʋaazu. <verse eid="EZK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 24:22"/>Wa kɛ eɠɛʋelei gè kɛɛni la. Wo la ɓɛlɛiti maalɔɔɠua, wo la daamiani mia nii wo-zeiɲɔɠɔiti ti feezu wo ya saa vai zu. <verse eid="EZK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 24:23"/>Wa wa-zeɠe zakpaiti felevele unba, wa-zaʋalagiti ti yɛ wo ɠɔɠɔa. Wo la saa gbaa, wo la wɔlɔa. Kɛlɛ wa vɔ ɠae ma ga wa-ɠotoiti, wa ɠɛ kpalagi wosu yɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="EZK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 24:24"/>Nii Ezekiyɛle kɛa, poogi ɠana wo ʋɛ, nii wo ʋaazu kɛɛzu. Wa kɛ nɔ eɠɛʋelei nɔ é kɛɛni la. Siɛgi zu fai niiti ti wogai ta ɠɛɛna la, wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.›<verse eid="EZK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 24:25"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, siɛgi zu, foloi gè ʋaazu la ti ʋalasu da, GALA seizu ɲadegai ma, é ga ti-ʋoluzeizuʋɛ, ti-ɠaazuʋɛ ɠoozunɛɛzu ma, ta-ɓɔɠɔlɛsu anii, ta-ɠito ganii, nà ti ʋala ti-loun zunuiti ta ti-loun anzanuiti ma. <verse eid="EZK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 24:26"/>Naama volo ná, nui nii a yɛ vulua, toɠa ʋa, é naama vaiti bo è ma, è mɛni. <verse eid="EZK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 24:27"/>Naama volo ná nɔ, è-laaʋɛ ɠa vie, è ɠula ɓoɓoyai zu, è ɗa ɓɔɛ, wa yɛpɛ wa nui zɛgai vulua. È ɠɛ nuɓusɛiti ʋɛ ga poogi, ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.»<verse eid="EZK 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EZK 25"/>
  <para style="ms1">Zii Ɠiligiti Tukpɔɠaaleʋe Vai, <optbreak/> Niiti Ti Izilayɛle Maaɠoolizu</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="EZK 25:1-32:32">25:1—32:32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Amɔn nuiti daalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 25:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 25:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɠaaʋote Amɔn nuiti pɔ pelei, è GALA gooi wo ti laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="EZK 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 25:3"/>Bo Amɔn nuiti ma: ‹À woilo Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ma: Wo ɲɛɛi woni, siɛgi zu sèizu ɲadegai ɠɔzɔni la, siɛgi zu Izilayɛle yooi zuwoni da, ti ɗa li ga Zuda nuiti Ɓaɓilɔne. <verse eid="EZK 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 25:4"/>Naa maaʋele ma, nà ɓesu folo ɠulazu ʋele nuiti ba, ti ɗa-yooi zeɠe ga tɔnɔ, ta ta-ɠɔɔlaaɠai ʋu ɗa-yooi ɠa, ta ta-zeɠe ɠotaiti to ná. Tiya ɠa ta ɗa-yooi ma lɔnɔgi pɛ mi, nɔnɔiti ti ga ɗɔnɔiti, ti naati kpɔle. <verse eid="EZK 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 25:5"/>Nà wa-laa wolai Laɓa ɠɛ ga ɲɔmɛiti daamiizuʋɛ, Amɔn nuiti ta-yooi pɛ ge ɠɛ ga baala sasai. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI. <verse eid="EZK 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 25:6"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Wo yealoɠani, wo ɠɔkɔ ga koozunɛɛi Izilayɛle ná-maanɔɠɔi vaa zu. Ʋele ɠana wo wa-wɔinzeɠemai ɠulaai la kɛlɛma é lo nà-nuɓusɛi Izilayɛle ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 25:7"/>Naa ma, nà zobogi ɠulazu kɛlɛma wo laalɔɠɔma, gè wo lɔ zii ɠiligiti zeezu, ti wo yeavoo. Nà wo ɠoloɠolo mɛtu, wa ɲɛɛlɛ nuɓusɛiti saama, zou la mɔ ɠɛa wo ʋɛ. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.› »<verse eid="EZK 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Moaɓe nuiti daalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 25:8"/>«Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa Moaɓe nuiti ta Seyiil nuiti daalɔɠɔma, niiti ti ɠɛni: ‹Zuda ʋɛlɛyeɠei ɠa ga nuɓusɛi, ga zii ɠiligiti kɛʋele.› <verse eid="EZK 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 25:9"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà Moaɓe laalaosu ná-taa wolaiti pɔ pelei, ta ná-kwɛpelemaʋɛ, ti pɛ ti ɠoloɠolo, anɛɛ niiti ti wola ʋagai, eɠɛʋelei Ɓɛte-Yesimɔte la, ta Ɓaale-Meyon, ta Kiliyatayime. <verse eid="EZK 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 25:10"/>Nà daalaosu folo ɠulazu ʋele nuiti tuɠɔ, ti Moaɓe zeɠe ga tɔnɔ, eɠɛʋelei ti Amɔn zeɠeni la. Naazu ʋelela ʋelei nu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠizɛga Amɔn zu. <verse eid="EZK 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 25:11"/>Nà-tukpɔi ɠa loo Moaɓe nuiti ma, ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.»<verse eid="EZK 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Edɔme nuiti daalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 25:12"/>«Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Edɔme nuiti ti potokula ɲɔu ɠɛɛni Zuda nuɓusɛiti daalɔɠɔma, naa ɠa é ti ɠɛɛni ga sɔba nuiti. <verse eid="EZK 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 25:13"/>Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà yeewuzeɠezu Edɔme laalɔɠɔma, nà nuiti ma zuwu ɠaaleʋezu ma yooi zu ta suaiti, gè ná valibo, é ɠɛ ga teʋebai zu, é zo Teman taa wolai ma, é zeeli Dedan, ná-nuɓusɛiti pɛ ta za kɔɔi zu. <verse eid="EZK 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 25:14"/>Nà naa ɠaliva nà-nuɓusɛiti ma, Izilayɛle nuiti, ga ti nɔ̀nɔ ʋotokula Edɔme nuiti ma. Izilayɛle nuiti ta ti zo eɠɛʋelei nà-ziiɠaawanai ta nà-ziiɠulagi ti levezu la, ti ti ɠala ga nu a ɓaaɠona mà, ʋelei a ɗa zale la.› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Filisiti nuiti daalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 25:15"/>«Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Filisiti nuiti ti kɛɛʋɛ ga potokulai, ti tɔnɔi ʋotokula ti zili nu wɔlɔmaiti ma ga wɔinzeɠema wolai, ti naati suwuɠaaleʋe. <verse eid="EZK 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 25:16"/>Naa maaʋele ma, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà yeeʋɛɛzu Filisiti nuiti ma. Zɔiti ti ʋaai, ti zeɠe Kelɛte, nà ti pɛ koloɠolosu, mɔtaiti ti zeini kpoloɗɛi laaʋɛ, nà naati pɛ undaaʋili. <verse eid="EZK 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 25:17"/>Nà-potokulai ta nà-doɠaiti ta ɲɔu ti ma. Siɛgi zu naati ti zeelizu la ti ma, ta suɠwɛɛ ga nà ɠa gè ga Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.› »<verse eid="EZK 25:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EZK 26"/>
  <para style="s">Tiil nuiti daalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 26:1"/>Kona puugɔ maazu ɠilasiɛi (11), ma alugi ma volo mɔungi, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 26:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, tɔɔzei Tiil nuiti ti ɲɛɛɠulani Zeluzalɛme zu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹A kela-o! É ɠoloɠologa, taa wolai ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛni liizu pɔ! Tosuʋɛ ɠa ve niina gi ya, gá ɓɛtɛ niinɛ ʋolu, Zeluzalɛme zuwoga!› <verse eid="EZK 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 26:3"/>Tama, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Nà ʋaazu wuzeɠezu è laalɔɠɔma, Tiil taa wolai. Nà nuɓusɛ ʋɛbɛi wuzeɠezu è laalɔɠɔma eɠɛʋelei kpoloɗɛi a ɗa ma lakpatakpagiti buzeɠe la. <verse eid="EZK 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 26:4"/>Ta Tiil ziɠigiti golo, ti ná-pɛlɛ ɠaaɠoozagi toka. Nà ma vufiligiti pɛ kpale, gè ná-kɔtui maaɲakai yɛ de. <verse eid="EZK 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 26:5"/>Toɠa ɠɛ niina ga ziɛ zaama yooi nɔ, ʋɛ kale ɓɛɛ nuiti ta ɠɛ ta-lumɔiti fɔɔzu ná, mazɔlɔɔ nà ɠa gè boga,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. « ‹Zii ɠiligiti ta ʋa, ti loo taai zu. <verse eid="EZK 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 26:6"/>Taa wolai niiti ti è-maaɠoolii zu, ti logai ziɛlaʋɛ, toɠa naati su nuɓusɛiti paa. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="EZK 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 26:7"/>« ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà ʋaazu ga Ɓaɓilɔne masagi Neɓukadenɛzaal, Tiil taai laalɔɠɔma, masagi ná-zobogi wɔɔlɔai masagiti ta-zobogi ʋa, gè zeɠe la lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei. Toɠa ʋa, é laalɛ è wu ga sooiti ta kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti, ta soo ɓizɛ zalaʋusuiti, ta salaʋusu ɓulugiti. <verse eid="EZK 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 26:8"/>Taa wolai niiti ti è-maaɠoolii zu, ti logai ziɛlaʋɛ, toɠa naati su nuɓusɛiti paa, é kɔɔɠɔ yeɠeiti bɔ è laalɔɠɔma. Toɠa kɔɔɠɔ ziɠigiti kpɛtɛ ta é kɔɔɠɔ ɠɔlu zɛpɛgiti to ga siɠigi è laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="EZK 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 26:9"/>Ta ɗa-ziɠigiti golo ga ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti, ta ɗa-ʋɛlɛ ɠaaɠoozagiti toka ga ta-ʋekasiiti. <verse eid="EZK 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 26:10"/>Ná-soo ɓulugiti ta-vufili buzeɠeai ɠa ʋɛɛ è unga, é è maaɓɔle, soo ɓulu kɛɛ nuiti ta kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti su lugi ɠa ɗa-ziɠigiti ɲiikpi, siɛgi zu ti lɛɛzu la ɗa-ziɠidaʋɛti, eɠɛʋelei nu a taai zei la kɛlɛ su é zeɠe wɔ siɠigi ʋa, é leʋe su é ɗa lɛ taai zu. <verse eid="EZK 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 26:11"/>Ta ziɛ ga ta-zooiti ɗa-laazuʋɛ ná pɛ, ta ɗa-nuɓusɛiti paa ga boɠa zɔkpɔi, ɗa-ɠɔtu ziɠigiti ti loni ga ɗa-zobogi ma ʋoogi, ta naati suvaza zooi ma. <verse eid="EZK 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 26:12"/>Ta ɗa-naavoloiti seɠe, ti loo è-ɠɔligiti su, ti siɠigiti golo ɗa-laaiti ma, ti ɗa-ʋɛlɛ ʋagɔiti golo, ta ɗa-ɠɔtuiti pili ya kpoloɗɛi wu, ta ɗa-wulu zɛʋɛiti, ta ɗa-vufiligiti. <verse eid="EZK 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 26:13"/>Nà è ɓesu ɗa-wuye loo vaiti ba, nu la mɔ ɗa-ɠɔni goomɛniga. <verse eid="EZK 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 26:14"/>Nà è ɠɛ ga kɔtui maaɲakai, nii kale ɓɛɛ nuiti ta ɠɛ ta-lumɔiti fɔɔzu maazu, è la mɔ loga ʋolu eyɛsu pɛ. Mazɔlɔɔ nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa gè boni,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ziɛ zaama yooiti ta ɓali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 26:15"/>«Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa Tiil taa wolai ma: ‹È loo lugi a ɠɛna ɠulaa, siɛgi zu nuiti ti saamaaɠɔgi wosu da, siɛgi zu nu ʋaai ɠɛɛzu la taa zaamaʋɛ, ziɛ zaama yooiti ta kpoloɗɛi laaʋɛ yooiti ti la ɲiikpiga ɓaa? <verse eid="EZK 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 26:16"/>Kpoloɗɛlaʋɛ masagiti kpein ti ʋilɛ, ti zeɠe ta-masa kpɔkpɔgiti ga, ti ta-zeɠeungiti kula ɠɔba, ti ɠula ta-zeɠe ɠɔsuʋugiti su, ti ɓɔɠɔ maaɠili ga dualuagi, ti zei zooi ma, yeeɠɛɠalai pɛ su ti zasu ɗa ɓali, ti lua ʋelei ma ɗa-vaa zu. <verse eid="EZK 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 26:17"/>Ta maawɔin wuyei nii loo è ma, ti ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 26:17">Ee, tooʋɛ bu ɠale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 26:17">ɗɛi kpoloɗɛi ɠaa leʋe bo nuiti ti ɠɛni è maamɔinzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 26:17">tɔɠɔɠula taa wolai, ná-zobogi ɠɛni kpoloɗɛi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 26:17">ta ná-nuɓusɛiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 26:17">nii ɠɛni maaɠoolii zu nuiti sasuɓalizu!<verse eid="EZK 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 26:18"/>Ziɛ zaama yooiti sasu ɠa ɓali niina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 26:18">naama voloi è ɠoloɠolosu da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 26:18">Kpoloɗɛi zaamaʋɛ yooiti ta lua gola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 26:18">yeei ɗa-vaiti ti ɓesu da.<verse eid="EZK 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 26:19"/>« ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Siɛgi zu gè è ɠɛɛzu la ga taa wolai koloɠologai, eɠɛ taa wolai naati nu la mɔ ti zu, siɛgi zu gè è lɔɔɠuzu la pali ɓomaʋɛ, ziɛ wolaiti ti è maaɓɔle, <verse eid="EZK 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 26:20"/>nà yeizu ga ɗe naati pɔ bɛ, niiti ti yeiɗai zeɠezaɠai zu, wɔlɔwɔlɔ nuɓusɛiti pɔ bɛ, ɗa yɛ zeini zooi wu eɠɛ puulega ɠɔtu wɔlɔwɔlɔgiti ti zooi wu, wo ɠɛ ʋa wa gɔvɛiti ti liini è luɠɔ. È la mɔ ɠɛa ga taa nu a zei su, è la mɔ ʋuuzu zɔlɔɔga nu vuluiti ta-yooi ɠa. <verse eid="EZK 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 26:21"/>Ɗa-vai ɠa nuɓusɛi pɛ maalua, mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠoloɠolo mɛtu. Nuiti ta è ɠaiziɛ, kɛlɛ ti la è ɠa mɔnɔ pɛ,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 26:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EZK 27"/>
  <para style="s">Tiil maawɔin wuyei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 27:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà:<verse eid="EZK 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 27:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, maawɔin wuyei loo Tiil taa wolai ma.<verse eid="EZK 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 27:3"/>Ɗa ɠɛ Tiil ma: ‹Ee, ɗa ʋe è zeini kpoloɗɛi laaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:3">è yaaɠolai ɠɛɛzu wo yɔɠɔzu, wa ziɛla nuɓusɛiti pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:3">Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:3">Ee, Tiil, ɗa ɠa è ɠɛni: Nà-pagi laazeeliʋɛ!<verse eid="EZK 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 27:4"/>Ɗa-you ɠwɛmaʋɛ zeeliʋɛ kpoloɗɛi zaamaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:4">è lo nuiti ti ɗa-ʋagi laazeelini mɛtu.<verse eid="EZK 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 27:5"/>Seniil<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Seniil</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Ɠɛɛlɛmɔn gizei laaseigi taɠili be, Liɓan yooi zu.</char></note> sipɛlɛ guluiti ka ti è ɓɛtɛni ga tiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:5">è ɠakamaʋɛti pɛ kpɛtɛʋɛ ga naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:5">Ti Liɓan sɛdele gului ta zeɠeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:5">ti naa ɠɛ ga zaamazu wului.<verse eid="EZK 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 27:6"/>Ti Ɓasan sɛne gulu wolai ta zaɠani ga kein kpizɛ mitɛiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:6">è ziɛ vai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:6">Ti ɗa-lakaiti kpɛtɛni ga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:6">Kitime ziɛ zaama yooiti ma sɛdele guluiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:6">see ɲiigai ʋɛai ti ʋa.<verse eid="EZK 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 27:7"/>Ɗa-zeɠe wolai fiilɛi zeizu su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:7">naa ɠɛni ga geze ʋagɔi suʋuai, Ezipete gelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:7">è yɛsu ɠoozama, ti ɗa è ɠwɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:7">Seɠei naati ti looni ga ma ɓiinii ta ma ɓɔigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:7">é zeɠe ziɛ zaama yooi zu, daa ga Sipele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:7">tandai naati ka ti ɠɛni ɗa-zɔɔlaiti makɛsu.<verse eid="EZK 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 27:8"/>Sidɔn ta Aalevade nuiti ka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:8">è ɠɛni ti zeɠezu ga ɓato li nuiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:8">Tiil nuiti ti wola zooni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:8">naati ka ti ɠɛni ga ɗa-ɓatoi ma ɠundiɠiiti.<verse eid="EZK 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 27:9"/>È ɠɛni botiɠɛ nuiti seɠezu, ti Ɓiɓelɔse ɠima nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:9">ga naama ɲɛɛliɠi nuiti ti ɗa ɓatoi ʋalizuʋɛti kpɛtɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:9">Kpoloɗɛi ɠaaʋɛ ɓatoiti ta ma wotiɠɛ nuiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:9">ti ɠɛni ɠomisu è ʋɔ bɛ, ti ɗa ɗa-zɔɔlaiti geya.<verse eid="EZK 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 27:10"/>Pɛɛlese zalaʋusuiti ta Lude geleiti, é ʋɛɛ Pute geleiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:10">ti ɠɛni botii ɠɛɛzu ɗa-zalaʋusui zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:10">Ti ɠɛni ga ɗa-ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:10">ti ɓena kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgiti ta ta-ɠɔlu wɔɔlɔgiti sɛlɛ è ʋɔ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:10">ti ɠɛni ta ɓɔsu ɗa-lɔɠɔɠulagi ʋa.<verse eid="EZK 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 27:11"/>Aalevade nuiti ta ɗa-zalaʋusuiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:11">ti ɠakuni ɗa-ziɠigiti ma, ti ɗa ti makɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:11">Gamade nuiti ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu taai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:11">ti ɠɛni ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgiti sɛlɛsu siɠigi ʋa, koozuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:11">ti ɠɛni ɗa-ʋadai laazeelizu.› »<verse eid="EZK 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaaɠo laa wolai Tiil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 27:12"/>« ‹Wa Taalasise nuiti wo ɠɛni yaaɠolai ɠɛɛzu yɔɠɔzu, è-zɔlɔɔ ganiiti pɛ su ti mɔinni è ya. Ti ɠɛni ɗa-yaaɠo zɔɔlaiti geyazu ga walii, ta kɔlui, ta kɔlu ɓɔigi, ta bɔbɔgi. <verse eid="EZK 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 27:13"/>Wa Yavan nuiti ta Tuɓale nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ Mesɛke nuiti ba, wo ɠɛni yaaɠolai ɠɛɛzu yɔɠɔzu, ti ɗa duɔiti fe è ya ta kɔlu ɓɔigiti ga ɗa-yaaɠo zɔɔlaiti maavalibogi. <verse eid="EZK 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 27:14"/>Ɓɛte-Togaalema nuiti ti ɠɛni kɔɔɠɔ zooiti teʋesu ɗa-lɔɔɠɔi zu, ta kɔɔɠɔ zoo ɓulugiti, ta soovale fuuluiti. <verse eid="EZK 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 27:15"/>Wa Dedan nuiti wo ɠɛni yaaɠolai ɠɛɛzu yɔɠɔzu. Ziɛ zaama yooi bɔɔlɔzu ná-yaaɠolai ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu è yeezaama, ti ɠɛni ɗɔnɔ ma lɔnɔgi zalazu ga see ɲiigaiti ta ebɛne wuluiti. <verse eid="EZK 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 27:16"/>Wa Siili yooi wo ɠɛni yaaɠolai ɠɛɛzu yɔɠɔzu, ti ɗa è yea aniiti geya, wo ɠɛni ti ɓɛtɛzu ga bɔɔlɔa. Ti ɠɛni ɗa-lɔɔɠɔiti sulaavesu ga kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagiti ti ga gelenategiti, ta seɠeiti ti loai ga ma ɓɔigi, ta seɠe zuʋuaiti, ta geze ʋagɔ zeɠeiti, ta kpɔzɔiti, ta kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagiti ti ga luɓiiti. <verse eid="EZK 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 27:17"/>Wa Zuda ta Izilayɛle yooi wo yaaɠolai ɠɛɛni yɔɠɔzu, ti ɠɛni Minite moloi leʋesu è ma, ta gatoiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɔin gulɔi ta gulɔi ʋa, ta gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgiti. <verse eid="EZK 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 27:18"/>Wa Damase nuiti wo yaaɠolai ɠɛɛni yɔɠɔzu, ti ɗa wo-yeaɠɔligiti geya, wo ti ɓɛtɛni ga bɔɔlɔa, ti ɠɛni Ɠɛlebon lɔɔi veezu wo ya, ta Saɠaal ʋaala deɠa ɠolegi. <verse eid="EZK 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 27:19"/>Vedan ta Yavan ta Uzale wa naati wo ɠɛni yaaɠolai ɠɛɛzu yɔɠɔzu, ga kɔlu ɠaingaiti niiti ti ɓɛtɛai mɛtu, ta kasegi, naa ʋɛɛ seeli kpaɠa maku nɛɛnɛgiti ba. <verse eid="EZK 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 27:20"/>Wa Dedan wo ɠɛni yaaɠoi ɠɛɛzu yɔɠɔzu ga soo maaɠili zɔɔlaiti. <verse eid="EZK 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 27:21"/>Wo yeezoni wa Alaɓuiti ta Kedaal you ɠundiɠiiti pɛ, ti ɠɛni pɔdii loozu è ma ga baala ziʋoiti, ta baala sinɛ wolaiti, ta boli zinɛiti. <verse eid="EZK 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 27:22"/>Saɓa ta Layema yaaɠoiti ti ɠɛni pɔdii loozu è ma. Pɔdi anii ti ɠɛni teʋesu ɗa-lɔɔɠɔi zu, é ɠɛni ga tufa maku nɛɛnɛgi ma ʋagɔi ma zii pɛ, kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagi ma zii pɛ, ta zanugi. <verse eid="EZK 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 27:23"/>Wo ɠɛni pɔdii loozu ɓɔɠɔ ma wa Ɠalan, Kané, ta Edɛn, taa wolai naati, ta Saɓa yaaɠoiti, ta Asiili, ta Kilimade. <verse eid="EZK 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 27:24"/>Nii ti ɠɛni pɔdizu è ma, é ɠɛni ga seɠe laaɓaagiti, tookɔba wolaiti ma ɓɔigi, seɠe zuʋuaiti, seɠeiti ti ʋɛɛzu pɛlɛwuʋɛ, galu vɛlɛaiti ta ma maaɓiligiti, naati ti ɠɛni ɗa-lɔɔɠɔi zu.› »<verse eid="EZK 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maawɔin wuyei ma lodai é ʋilɛ Tiil ʋa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 27:25"/>« ‹Taalasise ɓato wolaiti ka ti ɠɛni ɗa-zɔɔlaiti mɛɛnsu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:25">È ʋɔ bɛ laaveni, è ɠasɔɠili ga pɔdi anii kpoloɗɛi zaamaʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 27:26"/>Ɗa-ɠein dii nuiti ti liini ga ɗe ziɛ wuuzeigi zaamaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:26">folo ɠulazu ʋele viilɛi è zuɠaleɠaleni kpoloɗɛi zaamaʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 27:27"/>Ɗa-naavoloiti, ɗa-laamianigiti, ta ɗa-ʋɔdi aniiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:27">naa ʋɛɛ ɗa-nuiti ba ti botii ɠɛɛzu ziɛi ɠa, ta ɗa-ɠein dii nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:27">ɲɛɛliɠi nuiti ti ɠɛni ɗa-ɠeingiti kpaalɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:27">ta yaaɠoiti ti ɠɛni ɗa-ʋɔdii loozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:27">naa ʋɛɛ ɗa-zunuiti kpein ba ti è ya ga salaʋusuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:27">ta bɛbɛi gaalɛai ba è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:27">ti pɛ ta ʋu ya kpoloɗɛi zaamaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:27">voloi è loozu bu la.<verse eid="EZK 27:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 27:28"/>Keingi zu wotiɠɛ nuiti ta-ɠidaaʋili kpeei ɠa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:28">ziɛla nuiti pɛ suɓali ɲɛgɛlɛin.<verse eid="EZK 27:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 27:29"/>Naazu zɔiti pɛ kein dii mitɛi ti ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:29">ta ɠula ta-ɓatoiti su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:29">Kein su wotiɠɛ nuiti, kpoloɗɛi ɠaa ɠein dii nuiti pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:29">ta lo zooi ma.<verse eid="EZK 27:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 27:30"/>Ti pɛ ta ɓain ɗa-vaa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:30">ta wɔlɔ ga gola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:30">Ta fufiligi ʋu tɔungiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:30">ti ɗa ɠilikili zuʋui zu.<verse eid="EZK 27:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 27:31"/>Ta tɔungiti kpuye ɗa-vaa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:31">ti saa wɔlɔ wo seɠeiti too ɠɔba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:31">ti ɗa wɔlɔ è ma ta-yiiɠoloɠologi zu, ti ɗa zɔngɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 27:32"/>Ta-yiiɓɔlɔi zu, ti ɗa gɔlɔi wo è ma ga maawɔin wuyei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:32">ti ɗa saa wɔlɔi wo ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:32">Ɓɛ ɠa é ɠɛni ga Tiil ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:32">taai tɛi kɛʋele goloai kpoloɗɛi zaamaʋɛ?<verse eid="EZK 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 27:33"/>Siɛgi zu ɗa-ʋɔdi aniiti ti ɠɛni liizu la kpoloɗɛi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:33">è ɠɛni nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔin maavaa ɠɛɛzu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:33">È-zɔlɔɔgi ná-mɔin maaʋele ma ta ɗa-ʋɔdi zɔɔlai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:33">è ɠɛni etea masagiti ta-ɓɛtɛi lɛɛzu su.<verse eid="EZK 27:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 27:34"/>Kɛlɛ wɛlɛ, ɗa ɠaa è zuɠaleɠaleai kpoloɗɛi ma lakpatakpagiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:34">è ʋilini ya ziɛi ɓoma munu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:34">Ɗa-ʋɔdi aniiti ta wɔiti wo botii ɠɛɛzu ʋɔɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:34">ti pɛ ti ungi yɛga kpoloɗɛi wu.<verse eid="EZK 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 27:35"/>Ziɛ zaama laaiti ma nuɓusɛiti sasuɓalia</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:35">ga naama vaiti ti zeeliai è ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:35">Ta-masagiti sasu ɠa ɓalizu ga duai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:35">Maaɠilii é ti ma, toɠa ɠaazu ti-ɠaazuʋɛti.<verse eid="EZK 27:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 27:36"/>Yaaɠoiti ti zii ɠiligiti saama, ta foei vɛɛzu è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:36">è ɠɛa ga ti maalua anii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:36">è ɠoloɠologa, è la mɔ wuzeɠea eyɛsu ɠɔ!› »<verse eid="EZK 27:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EZK 28"/>
  <para style="s">Tiil masagi loobu vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 28:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 28:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, naa wo Tiil masagi ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: È-yiimaʋɛ laaveni ga wasogi, è ɠɛni: Nà ga gala, nà zeini galagiti ta-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa, kpoloɗɛi zaamaʋɛ! Kɛlɛ ɗɔun, ɗa ga nui, gala ta ga ɗe, ɗa ɗa-ɠisiɛi ɠaazu ga GALA ná-kisiɛi ʋe. <verse eid="EZK 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 28:3"/>Ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazu ga ɠima nu è leʋe Daniyɛle ʋa, dɔɔɠuzu vaa la lɔɔɠua è ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 28:4"/>Ɗa-ɠimalai ta ɗa-ɠeleɠelegi zu, è kulanumai ɠaalɛa ba, zanugi ta walii é ga naavoloi. <verse eid="EZK 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 28:5"/>Ɗa-ɠimala wolai zu yaaɠo vai zu, è ɗa-naavoloi ɠaawɔɔlɔa, naama naavoloi è yiilaavega ga wasogi.<verse eid="EZK 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 28:6"/>« ‹Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Tɔɔzei ɗa ɗa-ɠisiɛiti kaazu ga GALA ná-kisiɛiti be, <verse eid="EZK 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 28:7"/>nà ʋaazu ga wɛɛinti è laalɔɠɔma, ti wola ziliai ziiti saama. Ta boɠa zɔkpɔi ʋili ɗa-ɠimalai ma lɔnɔ pagɔiti ma, ti ɗa-ʋadai ɠɔzɔ. <verse eid="EZK 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 28:8"/>Ta è ʋili kabayeɠei zu, ɗa za ga maaɓaai kpoloɗɛi zaamaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 28:9"/>Ɗa ɠɛna loni è ʋaa nui ɠakala, ɗa zoo è ɠɛ ma nɛi: Nà ga gala? Ɗa yɛ nɔ nuɓusɛlai zu, è la ɠɛa ga gala, naama nui yeezu nii é è ʋaazu. <verse eid="EZK 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 28:10"/>Ɗa za ga tatipɛlɛʋolulala nuiti saa ʋelei, zii ɠiligiti zeezu, mazɔlɔɔ nà ɠa gè boga,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔungi zu ta niizu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 28:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 28:12"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, maawɔin wuyei loo Tiil masagi ma, ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: È ɠɛni ga daazeelii ma ʋoo pagɔi, è laaveni ga ɠimalai, è laazeeli pagi zu. <verse eid="EZK 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 28:13"/>È ɠɛni Edɛn, GALA ná-kpelei zu. È maaɠilini ga kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagi ma zii pɛ, saaledowanegi, ta topazegi, ta diamai, ta kelizolitegi, ta wonikesegi, ta zasepegi, ta safiilegi, ta gelenategi, ta emelɔdegi, ɗa-lamadegiti ta ɗa-ɠooleiti ti ɠɛni è yeema, ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni ga zanugi è ɓɛtɛ voloi ma vaa ma. <verse eid="EZK 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 28:14"/>È ɠɛni ga seeluɓɛin nii é makɛi wosu, koʋegiti ba. È ɠɛni zeini GALA ná-gize ɲadegai ma, è ɠɛni ziɛzu kɔtuiti saama, ti volozu gola. <verse eid="EZK 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 28:15"/>È-ziɛ ʋelei ʋani, è zoloo su, tɔɔzei è ɓɛtɛ volo ma, eyɛsu faa ɲɔi ɠula kɛlɛma è ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 28:16"/>Ɗa-yaaɠolai ɠaa yɛ ga wɔɔlɔzu è ya, é è lɔa toomai zu, è kotoi ɠɛ. Naa ma, gè è-losuʋɛ ɠulaa è ya, è ɠɛ ga tanɔ, gè è ɓɛ nà-gizei ma, ɗa ʋe, seeluɓɛin nii é makɛi wosu, gè è laaʋiliga, è ɠula kɔtuiti saama, ti volozu. <verse eid="EZK 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 28:17"/>Ɗa-ʋadai è wasoga, è vaa bu foloi è bosu, naa ɗa-ɠimalai yaava. Gè è ʋilini ya zooi ma, è ɠɛ ga pɛtɛ gani zɔɔma masagiti bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 28:18"/>Ɗa-ɠotoi mɔin ʋelei ma ɗa-yaaɠolai zu è kɛɛzu ga telebotalai, è ɗa-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti kɔzɔni. Naa ma, nà abu ɠaazosu è-zeizuʋɛ, é è ɠala. Nà è ɠɛ ga zuʋui eteai zu, naati pɛ gaazu ti è ʋɛtɛsu. <verse eid="EZK 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 28:19"/>Ɗa-vai ɠa maaɠili lɔ nuɓusɛiti pɛ ma ti è ɠwɛɛ, ɗa ɠɛ ga ti maalua ɠani, ɗa ɠoloɠolo eyɛsu ɠɔ.› »<verse eid="EZK 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sidɔn yooi laalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 28:20"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 28:21"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɠaaʋote Sidɔn taai ma, GALA gooi wo daalɔɠɔma, <verse eid="EZK 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 28:22"/>ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà ʋaazu wuzeɠezu Sidɔn laalɔɠɔma. Nà lɛbiya zɔlɔɔ taai zaama. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, siɛgi zu nà tukpɔiti gaaleʋena la daalɔɠɔma. Naazu nà nà-ɲade faiti kula kɛlɛma ga tɔun maaʋele. <verse eid="EZK 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 28:23"/>Nà ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi la è wu, ɲamai ɠa ʋu taazuʋɛ ná pɛ, nu ʋoomaiti ti ɠɛ ʋuuni ná pɛ, ti zaazu ga boɠa zɔkpɔi é zeɠezu mini-o-mini, é ʋa è laalɔɠɔma. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.› »<verse eid="EZK 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle unmɔɔ fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 28:24"/>«Ɠain ge la mɔ ɠɛa Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti daalɔɠɔma, é ʋa ɠɛ ti laɓazu, ɓaa é ʋa ɗa ti maawana, ti-zeiɲɔɠɔ la mɔ ɠɛa ná, a ti wɔinzeɠe. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI. <verse eid="EZK 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 28:25"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Nà Izilayɛle nuiti gaalɛ ba, gè ti ɠula nuɓusɛiti saama, ʋɛti gè ti vazani náti, gè dɛɛ ɠana ga zii ɠiligiti ga nà ga GALA ɲadegai. Ta zei ti ɓɔɠɔ yooi zu, nii gè feeni nà-botiɠɛ nui Zakɔɓe ʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 28:26"/>Ta zei ná ziilɛigi zu, ti pɛlɛiti to, ti leezɛn ɓeleiti da. Ta eteai ziɛ ziilɛigi zu, mazɔlɔɔ nà ti-maaɠoolii zu nuiti sala, tɛiti ta ti zopele ɲɔu. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ta-ƓALAGI.› »<verse eid="EZK 28:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EZK 29"/>
  <para style="s">Ezipete yooi laalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 29:1"/>Konagi ʋuusiɛi ma alu puugɔi ma volo puugɔ maazu velesiɛi (12) ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 29:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɠaaʋote Ezipete masagi Falaɠɔn ʋɔ pelei, GALA gooi wo daalɔɠɔma, ta Ezipete pɛ daalɔɠɔma, <verse eid="EZK 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 29:3"/>ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà ʋaazu è laalɔɠɔma, ɗa ʋe, Falaɠɔn, Ezipete masagi, fali wolai é ga sua ɲɔi, è laazu ɗa-ɗɛ wolaiti saama. È ɠɛɛzu ma: Ziɛ wolai Nile ɠa ga nɔ̀nɔ, tɔɔzei nà ɓɔɠɔ ɠa gè kpɛtɛni. <verse eid="EZK 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 29:4"/>Nà kɔlui ʋilisu è-lakulugi zu, gè ɗa-ɗɛ wolai wu ɠaleiti kpata è-maaɠalaiti ba. Nà wo ɠula ziɛ wolai Nile wu ʋɔɔma, wa kalei naati pɛ ti ɠatagai è-maaɠalaiti ba. <verse eid="EZK 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 29:5"/>Nà è ʋili ya teʋebai zu, wa ɗa-ɗɛ wolai wu ɠaleiti pɛ. Ɗa loo zooi ma dɔɓɔi zu, nu la è zeɠea, nu la è maaɠulua. Nà è ɠɛ ga daamianigi dɔɓɔ zuaiti bɛ ta wɔniiti. <verse eid="EZK 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 29:6"/>Ezipete nuiti pɛ ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 29:6">« ‹Mazɔlɔɔ kpɔbai Izilayɛle nuiti ti sɔlɔɔni ti ya, é ɠɛni eɠɛ seeli kpakui nɔ é yɔɔɠɛ. <verse eid="EZK 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 29:7"/>Siɛgi zu ti è zoni la ga yeei, è ɠaleni ga, è ti-ɠɔmaʋɛ pɛ kpolo. Siɛgi zu ti ʋoluzeini la è ʋa, è ɠaleni ga, è ti-zaamaʋɛ ɠulani ga.›<verse eid="EZK 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 29:8"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Nà ʋaazu ga kɔɔɓɔgi è laalɔɠɔma, nà nuɓusɛiti ta suaiti pɛ suwuɠaaleʋe wo zaama. <verse eid="EZK 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 29:9"/>Ezipete yooi zu ɠa wo eɠɛ teʋebai. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 29:9">« ‹Tɔɔzei è ɠɛni: Ziɛ wolai Nile ɠa ga nɔ̀nɔ, nà ɠa gè kpɛtɛni, <verse eid="EZK 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 29:10"/>naa ma, nà wuzeɠezu è laalɔɠɔma wa ɗa-ɗɛ wolaiti, nà Ezipete yooi ɠoloɠolosu, gè kɛ ga teʋebai zu, é zo Migedɔle eyɛsu é zeeli Siyɛne, é zei Etiyopi ɠwɛpelemaʋɛ ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 29:11"/>Nu ʋɛɛ sua ʋa, tanɔpɛ ge la ziɛziɛga ná. Eyɛsu kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40), nu la fuluani nɔpɛ kaa ná. <verse eid="EZK 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 29:12"/>Nà Ezipete yooi zuwo, é leʋe zooiti pɛ ba ti zuwogai. Ná-taaiti ta ɠoloɠolo é leʋe taaiti pɛ ba ti ɠoloɠologai, eyɛsu kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40). Nà Ezipete nuiti faza ziiti saama, nà ti vaza zou mɔinmɔin su.›<verse eid="EZK 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 29:13"/>«Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Kona ʋuunaanigɔi (40) ʋoluma, nà Ezipete nuiti gaalɛ ba, ti ɠula nuɓusɛiti saama, ʋɛti ti vazani náti. <verse eid="EZK 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 29:14"/>Nà ʋa ʋolu ga Ezipete nuiti ti ti ɠulani zou ʋa. Nà ʋaazu ga tiye zooi zu lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ, ti ʋu zooi zu ti zɔlɔɔsuʋɛ, ti masada goi lɔɔzei ná. <verse eid="EZK 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 29:15"/>Ezipete yooi zɛbɛi ɠa lɔi zɔɔma masadaiti tɔnɔi ʋa, é la mɔ wuzeɠea, é ʋa zei zɔɔma you ɠiligiti unda. Nà ta-zobogi maalɔi, naa ɠa a kɛ ti mina zei zɔɔma yooiti unda. <verse eid="EZK 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 29:16"/>Ezipete la mɔ ɠɛa ga Izilayɛle ná-kito ga é ʋa ɓaa maazu. Ezipete ɠa ɠɛ ná nɔ ga nà-nuɓusɛiti ti ɗa ɠitoo kotoi zu ti kɛɛni kpɔbai ɠaiziɛ vai zu zea. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.› »<verse eid="EZK 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masagi Neɓukadenɛzaal Ezipete yooi zo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 29:17"/>Kona ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔfelasiɛi (27), alu mɔungi ma volo mɔungi ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 29:18"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, è kaa, Ɓaɓilɔne masagi Neɓukadenɛzaal ná-kɔɔɓɔgi botii ɠɛɛni gola Tiil laalɔɠɔma, kpaanagi laa ti unma, ti-ɓakigiti maaɓolo, kɛlɛ botii é kɛɛni taai laalɔɠɔma, é la ma zala nɔpɛ sɔlɔɔni, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi, ɓaa ná-salaʋusuiti. <verse eid="EZK 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 29:19"/>Naa ma, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Nà Ezipete yooi lɔɔzu Ɓaɓilɔne masagi Neɓukadenɛzaal yeezu. Toɠa li ga ná-naavoloiti pɛ, é loo ná zu, é kɔɔzoganiiti seɠe. Naa ɠa a fe ná-salaʋusuiti zea ga ti-zalai. <verse eid="EZK 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 29:20"/>Nà Ezipete yooi ve zea ga salai, tɔɔzei botiiti ba ti kɛɛni bɛ̀, mazɔlɔɔ nà ɠa ná-kɔɔɓɔgi botii ɠɛɛni bɛ̀,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 29:21"/>«Naama volo ná, nà Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠei ná-zobogi wɔɔlɔ. Ɗa ma, ɗa zoo è ɓɔɛ ti zaama ga yiima. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.»<verse eid="EZK 29:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EZK 30"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-tukpɔi zɛlɛ fai <optbreak/> Ezipete yooi maazu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 30:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà:<verse eid="EZK 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 30:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, GALA gooi wo, è ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:2">‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:2">À kpeei loo, wo ɠɛ ma: Ee! Foloi ma ɓɛgele ɠaa!<verse eid="EZK 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 30:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ foloi maa ɠa na ɓuɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:3">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-foloi maaɓuɠaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:3">folo ʋe é ɠɛɛzu ga tonaɓiin tetelegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:3">toɠa ga yeeɠɛɠalai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:3">nii zɔɔma nuɓusɛiti ta-lukpɔi ɠaa ʋaazu leʋezu ma.<verse eid="EZK 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 30:4"/>Kɔɔi ɠa ɓɔi Ezipete yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:4">nuiti ta ɠɛ luazu, ti zasu ɗa ɓali Etiyopi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:4">siɛgi zu nu ʋoomaiti ti ʋuuzu la Ezipete,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:4">ta ɠɛna loa ti-ɠɔligiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:4">ti ɗa ta-yooi ɠoloɠolo.<verse eid="EZK 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 30:5"/>Etiyopi, ta Pute, ta Lude, naa ʋɛɛ nuɓusɛ zupui naati pɛ ba, Liɓi ɓalaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:5">ta nuɓusɛiti ti zooiti su ti yeezogai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:5">ta za ga boɠa zɔkpɔi ʋɔɔma ta Ezipete nuiti.<verse eid="EZK 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 30:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:6">Ezipete maalobo nuiti ta za kɔɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:6">Ezipete ná-zobogi é wasosu da, gaa ɠa ʋala ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:6">é zo Migedɔle, é li Siyɛne, ta loo bu ga boɠa zɔkpɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:6">Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 30:7"/>Ezipete ɠa ɠɛ ga teʋebai zu, é leʋe teʋebai zu yooiti pɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:7">ná-taaiti gaa ɠa luu taaiti saama ti ɠoloɠologai.<verse eid="EZK 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 30:8"/>Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:8">siɛgi zu gè abui losu da Ezipete ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:8">ná-kpɔba nuiti pɛ ti zuɠoloɠolo.<verse eid="EZK 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 30:9"/>Naama voloi, keelaiti nà ti leʋe, ta li ɓatoi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:9">ti Etiyopi ɲiikpi, ná-ziilɛigi ɠula zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:9">ti zasu ɠa ɓali, ta ɓɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:9">voloi gè ʋaazu Ezipete ɠoloɠolosu da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:9">Mazɔlɔɔ wɛlɛ, toɠa na ʋa!<verse eid="EZK 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 30:10"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:10">Nà Ɓaɓilɔne masagi Neɓukadenɛzaal zeɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:10">gè Ezipete ʋɛbɛi ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe la.<verse eid="EZK 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 30:11"/>Tɔ-o, ná-nuɓusɛiti-yo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:11">zunuiti ti ga nu ʋaa nu wolaiti ziiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:11">ta ʋa, ti zooi ɠoloɠolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:11">Ta ta-woɠa zɔkpɔi ʋili Ezipete laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:11">ti zooi zulaave ga nu ʋoomai.<verse eid="EZK 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 30:12"/>Nà ziɛ wolai Nile ma ɓekegiti fɔ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:12">nà Ezipete yooi ʋɔdi nu ɲɔiti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:12">Nà zobo fe wɛɛinti bɛ, ti zooi ɠoloɠolo ta gaa aniiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:12">Nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa kpɔ̀ɛai.<verse eid="EZK 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 30:13"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:13">Nà kɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti koloɠolo mɛtu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:13">gè zɛɛ ɠalagiti ta-vai zeɠe ga Mɛmefise.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:13">Kundiɠi la mɔ ɠɛa Ezipete yooi zu eyɛsu pɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:13">Nà dualuagi lɔ ɛsɛ pɛ su Ezipete yooi zu.<verse eid="EZK 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 30:14"/>Nà Ezipete yooi ɠoloɠolo lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:14">gè abui lo Soan taa wolai ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:14">gè tukpɔi laalɛ No taa wolai wu.<verse eid="EZK 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 30:15"/>Nà yiiɠula Sin laalɔɠɔma, Ezipete ná-poluzeigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:15">gè No nu mɔinmɔingi ɠaaleʋe.<verse eid="EZK 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 30:16"/>Nà abui lo Ezipete yooi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:16">Sin nuiti sasu ɠa ɓali ga taɓai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:16">Zeɠei ɠa wɔ No siɠigi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:16">Mɛmefise taa wolai ɠa zo kɛlɛmaʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 30:17"/>Won nu niinɛiti ta Pi-Bezɛte geleiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:17">ta za kɔɔmaʋɛ ga boɠa zɔkpɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:17">ma laaiti ta li duɔlai zu.<verse eid="EZK 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 30:18"/>Foloi la toa Taapanɛse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:18">siɛgi zu gè Ezipete ná-zobogi zuɠoloɠolosu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:18">gè ná-wasogi ɠula ba é ɠɛni su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:18">Tonaɓiingi ɠa ʋɛɛ Taapanɛse maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:18">ná-taaʋeaiti ta li duɔlai zu.<verse eid="EZK 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 30:19"/>Nà Ezipete lukpɔɠaaleʋezu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:19">Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.› »<verse eid="EZK 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓaɓilɔne masagi ɠa ga <optbreak/> GALA nà-botiɠɛ aniɲakai ta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 30:20"/>Kona puugɔ maazu ɠilasiɛi (11) ma alu mɔungi ma volo lɔfelasiɛi ma, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 30:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 30:21"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, gè Ezipete masagi Falaɠɔn yeei ɠaleni, gaa la ɠilini é ʋa ʋalo, é la laani kpazavɛlɛa zu, nii a kɛ é zɛbɛ zɔlɔɔ, é zoo é boɠa zɔkpɔi ʋili. <verse eid="EZK 30:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 30:22"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Nà wuzeɠezu Ezipete masagi Falaɠɔn laalɔɠɔma. Nà zee felegɔiti galeɠalezu, é la nɔ ga zɔi galeai, kɛlɛ ma ʋagɔi ɓalaa, gè ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠula zea, é loo. <verse eid="EZK 30:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 30:23"/>Naazu nà Ezipete nuiti faza zii ɠiligiti saama, nà ti zuvaza zou mɔinmɔin kiligaa zu. <verse eid="EZK 30:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 30:24"/>Nà ta ɓɔ Ɓaɓilɔne masagi ná-zobogi ʋa, nà, nà ɓɔɠɔi nà-boɠa zɔkpɔi la zea. Falaɠɔn nii gè zeei zuɠaleɠalezu, toɠa yɛ ɓalasu zili nui ya, eyɛsu é za. <verse eid="EZK 30:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 30:25"/>Ungo, nà zobogi ve Ɓaɓilɔne masagi ya, kɛlɛ Falaɠɔn yeei zu ɠa ɓɔlɔ. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, siɛgi zu gè nà-boɠa zɔkpɔi laazu la Ɓaɓilɔne masagi ya, é ɗa pili Ezipete yooi laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="EZK 30:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 30:26"/>Nà Ezipete nuiti faza zii ɠiligiti saama, nà ti zuvaza zou mɔinmɔin kiligaa zu. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.› »<verse eid="EZK 30:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EZK 31"/>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> sɛdele gulu wolai ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 31:1"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai gi ɠɛni la Ɓaɓilɔne, naama ɠona puugɔ maazu ɠilasiɛi (11) ma, alugi zaʋasiɛi ma volo mɔungi ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 31:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, bo Ezipete masagi Falaɠɔn ma ta ná-nuɓusɛiti:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:2">‹Nu ɠa è ʋokɔɠɔ leeni ma, ɗɛi ɗa-zobogi wɔɔlɔai ɠani?<verse eid="EZK 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 31:3"/>Asiili ɠulaʋɛ ga Liɓan sɛdele gului,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:3">nii ma ɓekegiti maanɛai ga pagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:3">é ga dɔɓɔ wolai niinigi zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:3">gaaɠoozaai gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:3">nɔungi zeiɗai tonaɓiingiti ba.<verse eid="EZK 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 31:4"/>Tona ɗɛi ɠa é bɔɔlɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:4">zou wu ɗɛ wolai kpɛtɛni, é ɠooza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:4">ziɛiti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba ma zapeiti maaɠoolii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:4">naa ʋolu ti ɗa yei guluiti pɛ ma ti dɔɓɔi zu.<verse eid="EZK 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 31:5"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛni gaaɠoozani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:5">é leʋe guluiti pɛ ba dɔɓɔi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:5">Ma ɓekegiti ti mɔinni, ti ɠoozakooza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:5">ziɛi zaɓu zu é ɠɛni kɔɔzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:5">siɛgi zu é ɠɛni wuzeɠezu la.<verse eid="EZK 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 31:6"/>Wɔni ma zii pɛ ge ɠɛni laɠagi losu su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:6">dɔɓɔ zuaiti ti ɠɛni yiʋoi ʋuuzu bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:6">nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛni ná-eteai ziɛzu ná-niinigi wu.<verse eid="EZK 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 31:7"/>É ʋani ná-maayikii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:7">gaaɠoozani, ma ɓekegiti suvie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:7">ma zapeiti ti yeini zooi wu, ziɛi zɛɓɛzu.<verse eid="EZK 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 31:8"/>GALA ná-kpelei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:8">sɛdele gulu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ná a ʋokɔɠɔ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:8">sipɛlɛ gulu nɔpɛ ma ɓeke ge la ɠɛni ga nɔnɔiti kɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:8">ɗalagi tanɔpɛ ma ɓeke ge la ɠɛni ɠulani ga ma ɓekegiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:8">GALA ná-kpelei zu, gulu wola ɠila kpalaa la ɠɛni ʋani ga kɛʋele.<verse eid="EZK 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 31:9"/>Gè kpɛtɛni ga ma ɓeke pagɔiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:9">Edɛn wulu wolaiti kpein GALA ná-kpelei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:9">ti pɛ ti ɠɛni toloi ɠulazu la.› »<verse eid="EZK 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 31:10"/>« ‹Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Tɔɔzei é ɓɔɠɔ ɠaaɠooza, é nɔungi wuzeɠea é zeeli tonaɓiingiti saama, é waso ziimaʋɛ ga ná-koozai. <verse eid="EZK 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 31:11"/>Naa ɠa é ba, gè dɔa ziiti ta-masagi naa ná-zobogi wu, nii sɛbɛi wola wɔɔlɔai, ga naa so é zoloo ná-topele ɲɔi ma. Gè kpɛɛni. <verse eid="EZK 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 31:12"/>Wɛɛinti ti wola zuɲɔuɗai ziiti saama, naati ti pɔni, ti zɛ ná. Ma ɓekegiti ti looni gizeiti ma ta nɛmɛiti pɛ su. Ma ɓekegiti suɠaleɠaleni eteai zu ʋɛtugiti pɛ su. Etea nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti ɠulani ná-niinigi wu, ti ɠɛlɛni ba. <verse eid="EZK 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 31:13"/>Wɔniiti ta ʋa, ti zei ma unkpulugi ɠa pɔgai, dɔɓɔ zuaiti pɛ ti ʋa, ti ɗa lɔɔɠu ma ɓekegiti bu. <verse eid="EZK 31:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 31:14"/>Naa pɛ ka ɠɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ gului nɔpɛ é ɓɛtɛzu ziɛlaʋɛ, é mina waso ná-gaaɠoozai maaʋele ma, é mina nɔungi wuzeɠe é ʋa zei tonaɓiingi ʋa, nii a kɛ gulu wola nɔpɛ ziɛi zɛɓɛzu gaa mina ɠooza ná-wasogi zu. Tɔɔzei gulu wolaiti ta nuɓusɛiti, saai leʋeʋɛ ti pɛ ma, ga ti yei gɔvɛalaazu zooi wu, naati pɔ bɛ ti yeizu kabai zu.<verse eid="EZK 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 31:15"/>« ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Voloi sɛdele gului yeini la gɔvɛalaazu, gè gɔlɔɗɛi lɔɔni ɛsɛ pɛ gaazu. Ná-faa zu, gè zou ɗɛiti soni, ti la yeiɗa, ti loni ti yei ʋeleiti su. Ná-faa zu, gè kpidii ʋɛɛni Liɓan ɠizeiti ma, gè guluiti pɛ fɔɔni dɔɓɔiti su. <verse eid="EZK 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 31:16"/>Gè nuɓusɛiti sasuɓalini ga gului tɛi too lugi, siɛgi zu gè zeini la gɔvɛalaazu, naati pɔ bɛ ti kabaiti su. Zooi wu, Edɛn wulu wolaiti kpein, gulu maanɛɛgiti, ti ʋagai ti pɛ ba Liɓan ɠizei ma, ti wola vizɔgai, ti ziɛi zɔlɔɔsu ga pagɔ, ti ɠoozunɛɛni. <verse eid="EZK 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 31:17"/>Tiya ɓalaagi, ti ɓɔ tɔun ba, ti yeini gɔvɛalaazu, naati pɔ bɛ niiti ti zaani ga boɠa zɔkpɔi, tiya ɠa ti ɠɛni ga poluzeigiti, ti zeini ná-niinigiti bu ziiti saama. <verse eid="EZK 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 31:18"/>Edɛn wulu gila kpalaa la ɠɛni ʋokɔɠɔga è ma pagi zu, bɔɔlɔi zu. Anɛɛ naa ʋe, ɗa ɓɔsu ti ʋa, wo ʋili ya zooi wu, è la tatipɛlɛʋolulala nuiti saama ti undaaʋilini ga boɠa zɔkpɔi. Naa ɠa é ga Falaɠɔn ná-kulanumai ta ná-nuɓusɛiti, Ezipete nuiti,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 31:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EZK 32"/>
  <para style="s">Maawɔin wuyei <optbreak/> é looni masagi Falaɠɔn ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 32:1"/>Kona puugɔ maazu velesiɛi (12), ma alu puugɔ maazu velesiɛi (12), ma volo mɔungi ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 32:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, maawɔin wuyei loo Ezipete masagi Falaɠɔn ma, è ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:2">‹Ɗa ziiti saama eɠɛ zala ɓokpagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:2">Kɛlɛ ɗa faiti kɛɛzu eɠɛ falii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:2">è ɗa maaɠɔɔ ɗa-ɗɛiti bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:2">è ɗa ziɛiti kpɔlɔ ga è-zapalagiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:2">è ɗa ma veinfeingiti kpɔlɔ.<verse eid="EZK 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 32:3"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:3">Nà nà-tumɔi lɔɔzu è unga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:3">siɛgi zu nuɓusɛiti ti mɔinzu la ti ɠaalɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:3">ta è mɛɛn nà-seemai zu.<verse eid="EZK 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 32:4"/>Nà è ʋili ya zooi ma, gè è la dɔɓɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:4">wɔniiti pɛ ti ɗa ʋu è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:4">dɔɓɔ zuaiti pɛ ti ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:4">ti è ma zuai ɠɛ ga laamianigi.<verse eid="EZK 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 32:5"/>Nà è ma zuai vaza gizeiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:5">gè nɛmɛiti sulaave ga è ma ɓulukpulugiti.<verse eid="EZK 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 32:6"/>Nà zooi maayɛɓɛ ga è ma ɲamai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:6">é ɗa yei gizeiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:6">kɔtuɗɛi laazuʋɛti sulaa ɠa ve da.<verse eid="EZK 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 32:7"/>Siɛgi zu è ɓesu la zɛnvui wo fai ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:7">nà geeɠɔlɔgi ɠaazulɔɔɠu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:7">gè somideɠaiti gaazulɔɔɠu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:7">gè foloi ɠaazulɔɔɠu ga tonaɓiingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:7">alugi la mɔ voloa.<verse eid="EZK 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 32:8"/>Ɗɔun è maaʋele ma, anii kpein é geezuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:8">nà ti ma voloiti gaaʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:8">gè kpidii ʋɛɛ ɗa-yooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:8">Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 32:9"/>Nà nuɓusɛi ma mɔinmɔin kɛ unga wuulee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:9">siɛgi zu gè ʋaazu la ga è ɠoloɠolo fai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:9">ma wooi zeeli zooiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:9">ʋɛti è la náti kwɛɛ.<verse eid="EZK 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 32:10"/>Ti lɔtɔzu ɠa leʋe ɗa-vaa zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:10">Ta-masagiti sasu ɠa ɓali ɗa-vaa zu ga duai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:10">nà ɠɛna nà-boɠa zɔkpɔi leʋeteʋe ti ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:10">è loobu voloi, ti zasu ɠa yɛ nɔ ɓalizu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:10">ɛsɛ ge ɗa lua ga zɛnvui vaa.<verse eid="EZK 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 32:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:11">Ɓaɓilɔne masagi ná-boɠa zɔkpɔ ɠɔɔi ɠa loo è ma.<verse eid="EZK 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 32:12"/>Nà zunu ɠɛzɛiti teʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:12">ti ɗa-nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔingiti paa ga boɠa zɔkpɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:12">tɛiti ti ziiti saama ga nu ɲɔu wolaiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:12">Nii kpein é ga Ezipete yooi ná-waso fai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:12">ta naa pɛ suɠoloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:12">ta ná-nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔingiti gaaleʋe.<verse eid="EZK 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 32:13"/>Nà ɗa-loganiiti pɛ suɠoloɠolo ziɛ wolaiti kobaʋɛti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:13">Nuɓusɛiti kɔɠɔi la mɔ ziɛi ɓɔlɔa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:13">suaiti polokagi la mɔ kpɔlɔa ɓalaa pɛ.<verse eid="EZK 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 32:14"/>Naazu ɠa nà ta-ɗɛiti da su la ga pagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:14">gè ɗa ta-ɗɛ wolaiti zei eɠɛ gulɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:14">Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 32:15"/>Nà Ezipete yooi zu ɠɛ ga teʋebai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:15">gè ná-sɔlɔɔ bosuʋɛti pɛ kula zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:15">gè ná-nuɓusɛiti suwuɠaaleʋe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:15">Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.›<verse eid="EZK 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 32:16"/>«Maawɔin wuyei ɠaa, ta too, zii ɠiligiti ti-loun anzanuiti ta too Ezipete yooi ta ná-nuɓusɛiti faa zu,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gɔlɔi é woni nuɓusɛiti faa zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 32:17"/>Kona puugɔ maazu velesiɛi (12), ma alu puugɔ maazu velesiɛi (12) ma volo puugɔ maazu lɔɔlusiɛi (15) ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 32:18"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, wɔlɔ Ezipete nuɓusɛiti ta-vaa zu, ɗa wɔlɔ wooi yei ga tiye ta zobobɛ zii ɠiligi zɔiti zooi wu, naati pɔ bɛ, ti yeiɗai gɔvɛalaazu, <verse eid="EZK 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 32:19"/>è ɠɛ ma: ‹È vizɔ ka bogai zɔiti ba ɓaa? Yei, ti è la tatipɛlɛʋolulala nuiti saama, ti zaani kɔɔi zu.› <verse eid="EZK 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 32:20"/>Ezipete nuiti ta za ga boɠa zɔkpɔi kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ. Boɠa zɔkpɔiti kɛʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ niina ga ti paai wo. Ti li ga Ezipete ta su nuɓusɛiti pɛ saai ʋɔ! <verse eid="EZK 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 32:21"/>Kɔɔɠɔ nu wolaiti ta zɔiti ti ɠɛni ɓɔsu ba, naati ta yɛ gɔvɛalaazu, ti ɠɛ ma: ‹Wɛlɛ lɛɛ tatipɛlɛʋolulala nuiti ba, ti zaai ga boɠa zɔkpɔi kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ, tiya ɠa ti yeizu, ti la gi zaama gɔvɛalaazu!›<verse eid="EZK 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 32:22"/>«Asiili ɠa ná, maaɠooliʋɛ ga ná-salaʋusuiti ta-ɠabaiti, ti pɛ ka ti zaani kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 32:23"/>Ti ta-ɠabayeɠeiti bɔɔni zeɠei ɓogi wu, toɠa na maaɠooliai ga ná-salaʋusuiti. Ti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga zɛkɔɔzuiti, tɛiti mɔungi ti ɠɛni maalua vai ɠɛɛzu fulu nuiti ta-eteai zu.<verse eid="EZK 32:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 32:24"/>«Elame ɠa ná, ná-kabai maaɠooliai ga ná-salaʋusuiti tɔnɔ ma ɠabaiti, ti pɛ ti zaani kɔɔi zu. Ti la ɠɛni latini pɛlɛʋolu, ti yei zooi wu, tɛiti ti ɠɛni maalua vai ɠɛɛzu fulu nuiti ta-eteai zu. Ta-ɓaaɠulamai yɛni ti ʋa ta naati pɛ, ti yeini gɔvɛiti pɔ pelei. <verse eid="EZK 32:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 32:25"/>Ti Elame laani naati saama, niiti ti ti ʋaani. Ná-kabai maaɠoolini ga ná-salaʋusuiti ta-ɠabaiti, tatipɛlɛʋolulala nui naati pɛ ti zaani kɔɔi zu, tɛiti ti ɠɛni maalua vai ɠɛɛzu fulu nuiti ta-eteai zu. Ta-ɓaaɠulamai ɠɛni ti ʋa ta naati, niiti ti yeini zeɠei zu. Ti-laazuʋɛ ɠa gɔvɛiti saama, niiti ti zaani kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 32:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 32:26"/>«Mesɛke ta Tuɓale ta ná, ta ta-ɠɔɔɓɔgiti, ti ta-ɠabaiti maaɠoolii zu. Tatipɛlɛʋolulala nui niiti pɛ ti zaani kɔɔi zu, tɛiti ti ɠɛni maalua vai ɠɛɛzu fulu nuiti ta-eteai zu. <verse eid="EZK 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 32:27"/>Ti la ɠɛni ti maaɠuluni wɔlɔwɔlɔ ɠɔɔɠuluɓaiti saama, niiti fulu nuiti ti ɠɛni luazu ti ʋa eteai zu, ti ɠɛni yeizu gɔvɛalaazu ga ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti pɛ, ti boɠa zɔkpɔi la nɔungi wu, ti kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi ʋɛɛ ma. <verse eid="EZK 32:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 32:28"/>Ɗa ʋe, Falaɠɔn, ɗa ɠana è zuɠaleɠaleai tatipɛlɛʋolulala nuiti saama. Ungo, ɗa ɠana wo laani, wa niiti ti zaani kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 32:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 32:29"/>«Edɔme nuiti ta ná, ta ta-masagiti, ta ta-ɠundiɠiiti pɛ. Anɛɛ ta-zulogi pɛ, ti ti zoni ga zɛkɔɔzui zɔiti kɛʋele. Ti ti laani zooi wu ta tatipɛlɛʋolulala nuiti pɛ ti yeini zeɠei zu.<verse eid="EZK 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 32:30"/>«Kundiɠiiti kpein ti lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, naati pɛ ta ná, ta Sidɔn nuiti pɛ, ti yeini, ti la gɔvɛiti ma. Ta-yeeɠaaɓaai dualuagi lɔɔni nuiti pɛ su, kɛlɛ niizu, tatipɛlɛʋolulala nui tɛiti ti laa ada ɠila ta gɔvɛiti, ɓaaɠula ti ma ga unfegi, ta zɔiti ti ɠɛni ga zɛkɔɔzuiti. Ta-ɓaaɠulamai ɠɛni ti ʋa ta naati, niiti ti yeini gɔvɛiti pɔ pelei.<verse eid="EZK 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 32:31"/>«Falaɠɔn a naama ɠɔɔɠuluɓaiti pɛ kaana, zii lago ɠa la, tɔɔzei naama nu ɓulugi vaa ʋa, ta ná-salaʋusuiti ti zaani ga boɠa zɔkpɔi, ta tɔ ɓɔɠɔi é zaani kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 32:32"/>«Mazɔlɔɔ gè Falaɠɔn yɛni ná, é ɠɛ ga fulu nuiti maalua ani eteai zu, kɛlɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi maa ɠa ɠulu tatipɛlɛʋolulala nuiti saama, ta niiti ti ɠɛni ga zɛkɔɔzuiti, ná-nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔingiti,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 32:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EZK 33"/>
  <para style="ms1">Izilayɛle Zei Vai Ʋolu Ga Niinɛ</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="EZK 33:1-39:29">33:1—39:29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">GALA goo wo nui é ga gwɛlɛma nui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 33:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 33:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɓɔɛ ɗa-nuɓusɛiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Ni nà kɔɔ ɓɛtɛna zooi ta laalɔɠɔma, náʋɛ ma nuiti ti ta-nui ta zeɠe, ti sei ga taa maaɓɛɛ nui. <verse eid="EZK 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 33:3"/>Siɛgi zu zunui naa ti zili nuiti ta-ɠɔɔɓɔgi ɠaazu la, é ɗa ʋa zooi zu, é puʋugi vɛ, é nuɓusɛiti too ɠisu. <verse eid="EZK 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 33:4"/>Ni nui ta a puʋugi wooi mɛnina, é la kaani ɠaazu ga faa, é ɓɔɠɔ yɛ ná, ti zili nuiti ti ʋa, ti paa, saa vai ma ungi ɠa la tɔ ɓɔɠɔ unma. <verse eid="EZK 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 33:5"/>Ná-faaɠaazagi ɠa a ma zaa wo, é puʋu gooi mɛnini, é la vaani bu, é ʋa ziɛ ga tɛnɛ gooi. Ná-saa vai ma ungi ɠa la unma. Ni a ziɛna ga tɛnɛ gooi, zɛnvui ɠa ɠula. <verse eid="EZK 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 33:6"/>Kɛlɛ ni taa maaɓɛɛ nui a ti zili nuiti kaana, ti ɗa ʋa, é la puʋugi vɛɛni, nuɓusɛiti ti la looni ɠisu, naazu ni ti zili nuiti ta ʋaana, ti nuɓusɛi taɠila paa, naama nui zaa ná-faaɠaazagi vaa zu, kɛlɛ nà ná-saa vai ma ungi la taa maaɓɛɛ nui unma.›<verse eid="EZK 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 33:7"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, gè è ɠɛa ga Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti maaɓɛɛ nui. Siɛgi zu wooi ta a ɠula la dà, è mɛni, ɗa Izilayɛle nuiti tɛnɛ da bɛ̀. <verse eid="EZK 33:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 33:8"/>Siɛgi zu gè ɠɛɛzu la faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ma: ‹Nu ɲɔi, ɗa ʋaazu zaazu,› ni è la ɓɔɛni è ʋa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui naa lɛnɛ, è ʋa bo ma ga é ɓe ná-tuʋa ʋele ɲɔi ʋa, naazu faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui naa ɠa za ná-faaɠaaza golai vaa zu, kɛlɛ nà ná-saa vai ma ungi maaɠaazaɠabo è ma. <verse eid="EZK 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 33:9"/>Kɛlɛ ni tama, ɗa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui lɛnɛna, è bo ma ga é ɓe ná-tuʋa ʋele ɲɔi ʋa, ni é la wɔinni é ʋa ɓe ba, toɠa za ná-faaɠaaza golaiti faa zu, kɛlɛ ɗɔun ɗa, ná-kasɔ la laa è unma, è-yɛnvui maazu ɠa ɓaa.<verse eid="EZK 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 33:10"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, nii ɠa è bosu Izilayɛle nuiti ma ga: ‹Wa bosu ga: Gá-lɔ koloɠologiti ta gá-ɠotoiti ta gi unma, ma ɠasɔi ɠana gi vɔ. Gá zoo ɠale gi zɛnvui wo?› <verse eid="EZK 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 33:11"/>Bo ti ma ga: ‹Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, zìima la ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui zaa vai, kɛlɛ é siɛ ʋelei maavalibo, é zɛnvui wo,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. « ‹À ʋoluave, à ʋoluave, wo zeɠe wo-ziɛ ʋele ɲɔiti polu. Leeni vaa zu, Izilayɛle nuiti, wɔin wo ma ga wo za?›<verse eid="EZK 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 33:12"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, bo ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ma ga: ‹Telebo nui ná-telebodai la maavaayɛga yeei a tɔ koloɠologi ɠɛ la. Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui undaa la ʋiliga, ná-tɔ koloɠologi vaa zu nii é kɛɛni, yeei a ɠɛlɛna ba la. Zenɔ ɠana é la, telebo nui la yɛga vulua ná-telebo faa ma, yeei a tɔ koloɠologi ɠɛɛna la. <verse eid="EZK 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 33:13"/>Siɛgi zu gè ɠɛɛzu la telebo nui ma, Ɗa zɛnvui wo nɔ ti!, ni a ɠitona sɔle fai ʋa, nii é kɛɛni, é ɠisiɛ ga naa kula ɠɛa su, é ɗa telebotala vai ɠɛ, gè la mɔ ɠizɛga ná-kɛɛwoti ʋagɔi tanɔpɛ su, toɠa za faa ɲɔi maaʋele ma, nii a kɛ. <verse eid="EZK 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 33:14"/>Siɛgi zu gè ɠɛɛzu la faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ma: Ɗa zaazu kpae, ni a zeɠena siɛ ʋele ɲɔi ʋolu, é ziɛ ga sɔledai ta telebodai, é la zaa. <verse eid="EZK 33:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 33:15"/>Ni a kpɔunmai ɠaaɠalena ma, nii é unmani, é naa ɠaaɠale ma, é mina mɔ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ, kɛlɛ é zɛnvui wo tɔgiti so, é la zaa, toɠa zɛnvui wo nɔ ti. <verse eid="EZK 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 33:16"/>Zeemai ɠa wo ná-faa ɲɔiti pɛ ma, toɠa zɛnvui wo nɔ ti, tɔɔzei toɠa ziɛzu ga sɔledai ta telebodai.›<verse eid="EZK 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 33:17"/>«Ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ta ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Maliɠii ziɛ ʋelei la zolooni,› kɛlɛ tiya ɠa ti-ziɛ ʋelei la zolooni. <verse eid="EZK 33:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 33:18"/>Siɛgi zu telebo nui zeɠezu la faa ʋagɔ ʋolu, é ɗa ziɛ ga faa ɲɔi, toɠa za naama vaa zu. <verse eid="EZK 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 33:19"/>Kɛlɛ ni faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui a ɠɛlɛna ná-faa ɲɔiti ba, é ɗa ziɛ ga sɔledai ta telebodai, toɠa zɛnvui wo naa maaʋele ma. <verse eid="EZK 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 33:20"/>Wa ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Maliɠii ziɛ ʋelei la zolooni!› Nà wo ɠilagilagi lukpɔɠaaleʋe, Izilayɛle nuiti, é zoloo wo-ziɛ ʋeleiti ma.»<verse eid="EZK 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme zo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 33:21"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai gi ɠɛni la Ɓaɓilɔne, naama ɠona puugɔ maazu velesiɛi (12) ma, ma alu puusiɛi ma volo lɔɔlusiɛi ma, zunui ta ʋaani pɔ̀ bɛ, ti-yee la ɠɛni zeelini ma Zeluzalɛme zosuʋɛ, é ɠɛni ma: «Zeluzalɛme loa bu!» <verse eid="EZK 33:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 33:22"/>Aisa é ʋa ʋa kpɔkɔi, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI sɛbɛi lɛɛni ga ze, é dàavieni. Zunui ti-yee la ɠɛni zeelini ma kɔɔi zu, siɛgi zu é ʋaani la pɔ̀ bɛ, poluma zobui, gè la mɔ ɠɛni ga ɓoɓo, gè ɠɛni zoosu niina gè ɗa ɓɔɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛti: <char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 3:26">Ezk 3:26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 24:27">24:27</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="EZK 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 33:23"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 33:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 33:24"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, nii nuiti ti bosu, ti yɛgai Izilayɛle laaiti su ti ɠoloɠologai: ‹Abalaame ɠila nɔ ɠɛni de, é zooi nii pɛ so ga nɔnɔ. Ada ma, de mɔinɗai, zooi veeʋɛ ade ʋɛ ga adɔnɔ,› <verse eid="EZK 33:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 33:25"/>ti wooɠaaʋote, è ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Wa suai ma ɲamai yɛsu su, wo ɗa mi, wo ɗa nɔkɔ kɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti bu, wo ɗa nu ʋaa vai ɠɛ. Wa zoo ɠɛɛzu ma ɠale zooi ɠa ga wɔnɔ? <verse eid="EZK 33:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 33:26"/>Wo yeelaaʋɛ nɔ wa-ɠɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti ma, wa kɔzɔba vaiti kɛɛzu, wa wɛɛnziɛgi wosu ga wo-zeiɲɔɠɔiti ti-anzaiti. Wa zoo ɠɛɛzu ma ɠale zooi ɠa ga wɔnɔ?›<verse eid="EZK 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 33:27"/>«Wɛlɛ nii ɠa ɗa bo ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, gè wo loo ɠisu ga zɔiti ti yɛgai taaiti su ti ɠoloɠologai, ta ʋaazu zaazu kɔɔi zu, zɔiti ti ɓalaɠaiti su, dɔɓɔ zuaiti ta naati mi, zɔiti ti lɔɔɠuzu gizeiti ma, ta pugiti su, naati ta za ga ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi. <verse eid="EZK 33:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 33:28"/>Nà zooi zuwo, é ɠɛ ga teʋebai. Nà ná-zobogi ɠula zea nii é wasosu da. Izilayɛle ɠizeiti maaɲakai ɠa ɠɛ le, eyɛsu pɛ nu la mɔ ziaa ná. <verse eid="EZK 33:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 33:29"/>Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, siɛgi zu nà zooi ɠoloɠolona da, é ɠɛ ga teʋebai, tɔɔzei kɔzɔba ɠɛɛwoti ɲɔiti pɛ faa zu ti ti ɠɛɛni.›<verse eid="EZK 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 33:30"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, wa ɗa-nui niiti ti wo ɠulaai zooi ʋa, ta yɛpɛzu ga ɗe siɠigiti bu, ta ta-ʋɛlɛlaʋɛti, ɛsɛ ge ɗa ɠɛ bɔɔla ma: ‹À ʋa, de woilo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi ma!› <verse eid="EZK 33:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 33:31"/>Nà-nuɓusɛiti ma ʋɛbɛ wolai ɠa ɠaalɛɛzu ba è ʋɔ bɛ, ti è-wooi mɛni. Ta è-wooi mɛnisu, kɛlɛ ti la ziɛzu la. Mazɔlɔɔ ti-yiima vaiti nɔ ɠa ti ti zuɠulazu, ta ti-yiimaʋɛ, ta-lɔnɔgi nɔ ɠa ti gaiziɛzu. <verse eid="EZK 33:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 33:32"/>Tɔun, è ɠɛa ti ʋɛ ga guye loo nui, goo nɛai, tɔɠɔɠula gɛingɛin gani pagɔiti ti bu. Ta ɗa woilo è-laawooi ma, kɛlɛ nu nɔpɛ ge la ziɛzu la pa. <verse eid="EZK 33:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 33:33"/>Siɛgi zu naama vaiti ti ɠɛɛzu la, wɛlɛ tama ta niina ɠɛɛzu, ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga GALA goo wo nu ɠɛni ti zaama.»<verse eid="EZK 33:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EZK 34"/>
  <para style="s">Fai é woni Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti daalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 34:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 34:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, GALA gooi wo Izilayɛle makɛ nuiti daalɔɠɔma, ɠɛ baala makɛ nuiti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Maanɔɠɔi ɠa Izilayɛle makɛ nuiti tuɠɔ, wɔiti wo ɠaaɓaai nɔ ɓɔɠɔ nɔ ma! Baala kpulugi laade baala makɛ nuiti ta ɗa ɠaaɓaa ma ɓaa? <verse eid="EZK 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 34:3"/>Wa sua wulɔi miizu, wo ɓɔɠɔ maaɠili ga baala deɠa zeɠei. Baalagiti ti wulɔai, wo ɗa naati kɔdaaleʋe, wo la ɠaaɓaa baalagiti ma. <verse eid="EZK 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 34:4"/>Wo la ɓɔni baalagiti ba ti maalɛɠɛfɛgai, ti ʋa zɛbɛ zɔlɔɔ. Zɔi é ɠɛni zeeɓɛzu, wo la naa zaleni. Zɔi kɔɠɔi ɠaleni, wo la naa ɠɔɠɔi maaveleveleni. Zɔi é ɠakani, wo la ʋaani ga naa. Zɔi é looni ya, wo la naa ɠaiziɛni. Wo zeini ti ɠa ga wa-zobogi, toomai zu ta keɠaaɓaai. <verse eid="EZK 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 34:5"/>Nà-baalagi tɛiti ti vazani, ti makɛ nu ʋalagi ʋɔ, ti ɠɛ ga dɔɓɔ zuaiti pɛ daamianigi. <verse eid="EZK 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 34:6"/>Nà-baalagiti ti ɠakani gize wolaiti ma ta gize ɠaaɠooza golaiti ma. Ti vazani zooi zu ná pɛ, nu la ɠaaɓaani ti ma, ɓaa nu ʋa li ti ɠaiziɛzu.<verse eid="EZK 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 34:7"/>« ‹Naa ɠa é ba, baala makɛ nuiti, à woilo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi ma: <verse eid="EZK 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 34:8"/>Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, tɔɔzei nà-baalagiti ta niina nɔ toosui laawu, ti makɛ nu la ná, ti ɠɛa ga dɔɓɔ zuaiti daamianigi, tɔɔzei nà-baala makɛ nuiti ti la ɠaaɓaani nà-baalagi tanɔpɛ ma, kɛlɛ ti yiizoolɛni nɔ ga ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔnɔkula vai, ti la nà-baalagiti kɔnɔkulani,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana, <verse eid="EZK 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 34:9"/>« ‹naa maaʋele ma, baala makɛ nuiti, à woilo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi ma. <verse eid="EZK 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 34:10"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà wuzeɠezu baala makɛ nuiti daalɔɠɔma. Nà nà-baalagiti kulazu ti ya, gè la mɔ ti yɛga na, ti ʋa nà-baalagiti makɛ, ti la mɔ zooga ti ʋa ti ɠɛ ga ɓɔɠɔ laamiani. Nà nà-baalagiti kulazu ti-la, ti la mɔ ɠɛa ga ti-ɠɔnɔ.› »<verse eid="EZK 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minazeɠegi wo fai nuɓusɛiti bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 34:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: «É zo za ma niina, nà ɓɔɠɔ ɠa gè ɠaaɓaazu nà-baalagiti ma, gè ɗa ti maavai ɠɛ. <verse eid="EZK 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 34:12"/>Nà dama kpɛ, gè ti ɠaalɛ ba, eɠɛʋelei baala makɛ nui a ɗa ná-baala kpulugi ɠaalɛ ba la, ta vazana ɲɛgɛlɛin. Nà li, gè nà-baala kpulugi ɠaiziɛ adaʋɛ pɛ, ʋɛti ti vazani náti, ɓumugi ta kpidii ʋɛɛ yeei ti ma. <verse eid="EZK 34:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 34:13"/>Nà ti ɠula nuɓusɛiti saama, ta zou ɠiligiti su ʋɛti ti náti, gè ti ɠaalɛ ba, gè ʋa ga tiye ti ɓɔɠɔ zooi zu. Nà ti ɠɔnɔkula Izilayɛle ɠizeiti ma, ta ziɛ ɠobaʋɛti, ta ʋɛ nɔpɛ nu a zei ná zooi zu. <verse eid="EZK 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 34:14"/>Nà ti makɛ tufa lɛnu pagɔi zu, ta ta-lufai ɠa Izilayɛle ɠize ɠaaɠoozagiti ma. Ta dooɠogi wo tufa lɛnu pagɔi zu, ta ɠɛ laamiizu tufa lɛnu pagɔi zu Izilayɛle ɠizeiti ma. <verse eid="EZK 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 34:15"/>Nà ɓɔɠɔ ɠa nà nà-baala kpulugi makɛ, nà ɠa nà dooɠogi ve zea,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 34:16"/>«Zɔi é looni ya, nà naa ɠaiziɛ. Zɔi é ɠakani, nà ʋa ga naa. Zɔi kɔɠɔi ɠaleni, nà naa ɠɔɠɔi maavelevele. Zɔi é ɠɛni zeeɓɛzu, nà naa zale. Zɔi gola wulɔai, zɛbɛi ba, nà naati gaaleʋe. Nà ti makɛ ga telebodai.»<verse eid="EZK 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ka ɓɔ ná-nuɓusɛiti ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 34:17"/>«Wɔiti wo ga nà-baala kpulugi, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Nà ɠɛ ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui baalagiti ta baalagiti zɔɠɔzu, baala sinɛ wolaiti ta boli zinɛ wolaiti zɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="EZK 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 34:18"/>Naa la kula ɠɛɛni ga woye ɓaa, daami wo ɠɛni bosu tufa lɛnugi zu? Kɛni nii wo miizu, wa la ɠɔɠɔziɛ naa mɔtai zu? Ziɛ ɠaazeɠegi ɓɔle vai la wo yiilɛini ɓaa? Kɛni wa la ma ɗɛi mɔtai ɓɔlɔ ga wo-ɠɔɠɔiti? <verse eid="EZK 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 34:19"/>Nà-baalagiti ti yɛgai, kɛni ti tufai naa mi, nii wo ɠɔɠɔloni ma, ti ziɛi naa ɓɔle, nii wo kpɔlɔni.›<verse eid="EZK 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 34:20"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa wo ma: ‹Nà ɓɔɠɔi, nà ɠɛɛzu ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui nà-baalagiti saama, ma ɠaɲaiti ta dɔtɔ geleiti zɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="EZK 34:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 34:21"/>Tɔɔzei wo fikɛʋalasu ʋaalagiti siɠani ga ɲiibiiti ta ɠɔmaʋɛti, wo ti loɠa ga minɛiti, eyɛsu wo ti ɓɛ, ti ɠula ma ɓulugiti saama, <verse eid="EZK 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 34:22"/>naa ɠa é ba, nà ʋaazu gè ɓɔ nà-baala kpulugi ʋa, ti mina lɔ nua yeezu ta ɠɛ loozu ti ma. Nà tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe nà-baalagiti zɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="EZK 34:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 34:23"/>Baala makɛ nu ɠila kpe ka nà sei ti unda, é ɗa ɠaaɓa ti ma. Naa ɠa ɠɛ ga nà-botiɠɛ nui Davide. Tɔun ka a baalagiti pɛ kɔnɔkula, toɠa ɠɛ ga ti makɛ nu ɠitei. <verse eid="EZK 34:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 34:24"/>Nà Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠɛ ga ta-ƓALAGI, nà-botiɠɛ nui Davide ɠa ɠɛ ti zaama ga kundiɠii. Nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa kpɔ̀ɛai.<verse eid="EZK 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 34:25"/>« ‹Nà minazeɠe ti ʋɛ, gè ɓaa ta-yiilɛigi maazu, gè sua ɲɔiti kula zooi ʋa, ta zei ziilɛigi zu teʋebai zu, ti ɗa ɲiimɛnii wo dɔɓɔ zaamaʋɛti. <verse eid="EZK 34:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 34:26"/>Nà tuyai laazeeli niima yooi ta nà-gizei maaɠoolii ʋɛ. Nà tonai ʋu puu yeeɠɛɠalai ma, toɠa ɠɛ ga tona niiti ti ʋaazu ga tuyai wo ʋɔ. <verse eid="EZK 34:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 34:27"/>Guluiti ta gwaai wo wa-lɔɓɔi zu, zooi ɠa nɔnɔ ma lɔnɔgiti fe. Baalagiti ta zei gaanɛɛi zu ti ɓɔɠɔ yooi zu. Nà yɔlɔɠɔi vie nà-nuɓusɛiti ba, é ti ɠilizu, é ɗa ti lɔ duɔlai zu, gè ti ɠula naati zeezu, niiti ti zeini ti ɠa. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI. <verse eid="EZK 34:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 34:28"/>Zii ɠiligiti ti la mɔ loa ti ma, ti ʋa ti ɠɛ ga laamiani, dɔɓɔ zuaiti ti la mɔ ti ɠɛa ga laamiani. Ta ta-eteai ziɛ gaanɛɛi zu, nu nɔpɛ ge la ti maalua. <verse eid="EZK 34:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 34:29"/>Nà zou ve ti ʋɛ, maawoo ziɛ ani ɓɛtɛ vai zu, pului la mɔ ti ɓɔlɔa pɛ ta-zooi zu. Zii ɠiligiti ti la mɔ ɓaaɠulaa ma. <verse eid="EZK 34:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 34:30"/>Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ta-ƓALAGI, nà ti ʋa, ta Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ta ga nà-nuɓusɛ ɠiteɠitegiti,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 34:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 34:31"/>« ‹Wa ʋe, nà-baalagiti, nà ɠaaɓaazu wo ma, wa ga nuɓusɛiti, nɔ̀un nà, nà ga wa-ƓALAGI,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 34:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EZK 35"/>
  <para style="s">Edɔme laalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 35:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 35:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɠaaʋote Seyiil ɠizei ma, GALA gooi wo daalɔɠɔma, <verse eid="EZK 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 35:3"/>è ɠɛ ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà wuzeɠezu è laalɔɠɔma, Edɔme, gè è ɠoloɠolo, gè è ɠɛ ga teʋebai. <verse eid="EZK 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 35:4"/>Nà ɗa-laaiti koloɠolo, ɗa-yooi pɛ ka ɠoloɠolo mɛtu, ɗa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="EZK 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 35:5"/>« ‹È ɠɛni Izilayɛle nuiti wɔinzeɠezu yeenɔpɛ, ta-ɠidaaʋili foloi zu, siɛgi zu ta-nu ʋaa vai zala yeei zeelini la, è ti lɔɔni kɔɔi ná-faa zuɠoloɠologi zu. <verse eid="EZK 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 35:6"/>Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, nà è zei ɲamai zu, ɲama ʋui ɠa ʋilɛ è ʋolu. Tɔɔzei è la ɠɛni inɛinɛni nu ʋaa vai ʋa, saai ɠa ʋilɛ è ʋolu,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 35:7"/>« ‹Nà Edɔme yooi ɠoloɠolo, gè falibo, é ɠɛ ga teʋebai, gè naati suwuɠaaleʋe, zɔiti ta ɠɛ ziɛzu ná. <verse eid="EZK 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 35:8"/>Nà ɗa-ɠizeiti maalaave ga nu ʋoomai, zɔiti boɠa zɔkpɔi ti ʋaazu, naati ta loo ɗa-ɠize goiti ma, ɗa-nɛmɛiti su, ɗa-ʋɛtugiti su. <verse eid="EZK 35:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 35:9"/>Nà ɗa-yooi ɠɛ ga teʋebai eyɛsu ɠɔ, nu nɔpɛ ge la zeiɗa ɗa-laaiti su mɔnɔ. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="EZK 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 35:10"/>« ‹Tɔɔzei è ɠɛni ma: Zii felegɔi tɛiti, Izilayɛle ta Zuda, ta ma you felegɔiti ɓalaa ta ɠɛ ga nɔ̀nɔ, nà ti zeɠezu ga nɔ̀nɔ, anɛɛ ni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa zeini ná, <verse eid="EZK 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 35:11"/>naa ɠa é ba, eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, nà è zosu ga ɗa-yiiɠaawanai ta ɗa-loloi ɠɛʋelei, nii è loni ma, è wuzeɠe ti laalɔɠɔma. Nà ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga tiye ɗa-lukpɔɠaaleʋe ʋelei zu,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 35:12"/>« ‹Ɗa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gè poomu gooiti pɛ mɛnini, niiti è ti woni Izilayɛle ɠizeiti ma, è ɗa ɠɛ ma: Ti ɠoloɠologa! Ti vea gi ya ga gi laamiizu. <verse eid="EZK 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 35:13"/>Wo wuzeɠeni ga waso kpɔɛiti dàalɔɠɔma, wo gaazumaanɛɛ ɓɔɛiti boni dàalɔɠɔma, nà ɓɔɠɔ ɠa gè ti mɛnini.<verse eid="EZK 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 35:14"/>« ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Siɛgi zu zooi pɛ ge ɠɛɛzu la koozunɛɛi zu, nà è ɠoloɠolo niina. <verse eid="EZK 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 35:15"/>Tɔɔzei è ɠoozunɛɛni Izilayɛle ná-zooi ɠoloɠolo fai zu, nà è ɠɛɛzu ɠana nɔ. Ɗa ɠoloɠolo, Seyiil ɠizei, ta Edɔme ná pɛ. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.› »<verse eid="EZK 35:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EZK 36"/>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle ʋuu vai su ʋolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 36:1"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, GALA gooi wo Izilayɛle ɠizeiti ma, è ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Izilayɛle ɠizeiti, à woilo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi ma. <verse eid="EZK 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 36:2"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Wo zili nui ɠa ɠɛɛzu wo ma, Kpukɛ! Wɔlɔwɔlɔ ɠizei tɛiti ti ɠɛa ga gɔnɔ. <verse eid="EZK 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 36:3"/>Naa maaʋele ma, Ezekiyɛle, GALA gooi woni, è ɠɛ ma: Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Gè pɛtɛgɛ ga adaʋɛ pɛ, ti wo ɠoloɠologa, ti wo maaɓɔle, wo ʋa ɠɛ ga zou ɠiligiti tɔnɔ, wo ɠɛɛni ga ɲɛɛɠulasu anii, ti ɗa wo ʋoomu. <verse eid="EZK 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 36:4"/>Tama, Izilayɛle ɠizeiti, à woilo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi ma: Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa gizeiti faa zu, ta gize goiti, ta ziɛiti ti yeizu, naa ʋɛɛ nɛmɛiti ta adaʋɛti ba ti ɠoloɠologai, ta taaiti ti zuwogai, ti-maaɠoolii zu yooiti ti looni ti ma, ti ti ʋoomu, <verse eid="EZK 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 36:5"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Gaamazu nà ɓɔɛzu nà-ziiɠaawana wolai zu zii ɠiligiti daalɔɠɔma, ta Edɔme ɓɔɔɓɔ daalɔɠɔma. Ti kɛɛni ga ti ɠoozunɛ vai, ti nà-zooi zeɠe ga tɔnɔ, wɔinzeɠemai zu ti yiimaʋɛ, ti loo ma, ti kɛ ga laamiizuʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 36:6"/>Naa ɠa é ba, GALA gooi wo é ʋilɛ Izilayɛle yooi ʋa. Bo gizeiti ma, ta gize goiti, ta ziɛiti ti yeizu, ta pɛtugiti ga: Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà ɓɔɛzu nà-ziiɠaawanai zu ga toloi, mazɔlɔɔ zii ɠiligiti ti ɓaaɠulani wo ma. <verse eid="EZK 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 36:7"/>Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Gè yeelɛa geezu, gè minazeɠe, zii ɠiligi tɛiti ti wo-maaɠoolii zu, ɓaa ɠa ɠula ti ma, tɔungi maayei.<verse eid="EZK 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 36:8"/>« ‹Tama wa ʋe, Izilayɛle ɠizeiti, guluiti ti wo ma, ti-ɠaalaa niinɛi ɠa lɛ ga ʋolu, ti gwaai wo nà-nuɓusɛiti bɛ ti ga Izilayɛle, mazɔlɔɔ nágo ʋe na, ti ɠale ma. <verse eid="EZK 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 36:9"/>Nà ɠaaɓaazu wo ma, gè ɠaaʋote wo ma, tii ɠa ɠɛ wo ma ʋolu, ani zuwui vaza wo ma. <verse eid="EZK 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 36:10"/>Nuɓusɛi ɠa mɔin wa-yooi ɠa, Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti pɛ. Nuiti ta zei taaiti pɛ su, mazɔlɔɔ ʋɛti náti ti woloni, ta lo ʋolu. <verse eid="EZK 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 36:11"/>Nuɓusɛiti ta toganiiti ta mɔin adaʋɛ pɛ. Ta mɔin gola, ti ɓuɠu, nà wo wola mɔin, eɠɛʋelei é ɠɛni la mɔungi, nà faanɛɛiti kɛ wo ʋɛ, é leʋe naa ʋa nii gè ɠɛni kɛɛzu kaite. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI. <verse eid="EZK 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 36:12"/>Nà va bu, nà-nuɓusɛiti, Izilayɛle nuiti, ti ziɛ wo ma, ti wo zeɠe ga tɔnɔ, wo la mɔ zooga wo ʋa ti-lointi kula ti ya.<verse eid="EZK 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 36:13"/>« ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nuiti ta ɠɛɛzu ma: Izilayɛle yooi ɠa ná-nuɓusɛiti undaaʋilisu, é ná-nuɓusɛiti bala ti-lointi ma, <verse eid="EZK 36:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 36:14"/>Tama, é zo niizu ma, zooi la mɔ nuɓusɛi undaaʋiliga, é la mɔ nuɓusɛiti balaga ti-lointi ma,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 36:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 36:15"/>« ‹Gè la vaa bu, è ʋa zii ɠiligiti ta-ʋoomu goomɛni mɔnɔ, nuɓusɛ ɠiligaa ti la mɔ ɓaaɠulaa è ma, è la mɔ ɗa-you ɠaa nuiti kɔɠɔi ziɠaa,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 36:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 36:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 36:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 36:17"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, siɛgi zu Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠɛni zeini la ta-yooi zu, ti kɔzɔni ga ti luʋa ʋeleiti, ta ti-ziɛ ʋeleiti. Ti luʋa ʋelei ɠɔzɔni gàazu eɠɛ anzanui ná-alu kaa ɠɔzɔi. <verse eid="EZK 36:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 36:18"/>Ti zooi ɠɔzɔni ga nu ʋaa vaiti ti ti ɠɛɛni, ta kɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti kɔɔ vai. Naa ɠa é kɛɛni gè yiiɠaawanani ti ma. <verse eid="EZK 36:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 36:19"/>Gè ti zuvazani nuɓusɛiti saama, zou ɠiligiti su. Gè ti lukpɔɠaaleʋeni, é zoloo ti luʋa ʋeleiti ma, ta ta-ɠɛɛwotiiti. <verse eid="EZK 36:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 36:20"/>Tama, zou ɠiligi kpein ti zeelini su, dàasei ɲadegai ɠa ɓaa ɠɛni ɠulazu ma, ta-vaaɠaazagi maaʋele ma. Ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ti ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-nuɓusɛiti be, ná-zooi ɠa ti zeɠeai su.› <verse eid="EZK 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 36:21"/>Naa ɠa é wanani mà, dàasei ɲadegai Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɓaaɠulani ma ga ta-vaaɠaazagiti zii ɠiligiti saama, ʋɛti ti liini naati.<verse eid="EZK 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 36:22"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, ɠɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Ni nà pɔ gè losu ɠɛ, wo maaʋele laade, ee, Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti, kɛlɛ dàasei ɲadegai maaʋele ʋe, nii wo ɓaaɠulaai ma zii ɠiligiti saama, ʋɛti wo liini náti. <verse eid="EZK 36:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 36:23"/>Dàasei golai ɓaaɠulaai ma zii ɠiligiti saama, nà ná-ɲadedai ɠula kɛlɛma, dàaseigi nii wo ɓaaɠulaai ma ti zaama. Zii ɠiligi naati ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, siɛgi zu nà nà-ɲadedai lɛɛna la ga tiye, ga nà-kɛɛwotiiti maaʋele wo letemazu,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 36:24"/>« ‹Nà wo ɠula zii ɠiligiti saama, gè wo ɠaalɛ ba, wo ɠula zooiti pɛ su, gè ʋa ga woye ʋolu wa-yooi zu. <verse eid="EZK 36:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 36:25"/>Nà ziɛ ɲadegai vaza wo ma, wa ɠole, nà wa-ɲadetalai ɠula wo zaama, ta wa-zale ɠɔɔ vaiti. <verse eid="EZK 36:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 36:26"/>Nà zii niinɛ ve wo ʋɛ, gè zɛnvu niinɛ ʋu wo-yiimaʋɛ. Wo-yii nii kpaai eɠɛ kɔtu, gè naa ɠula wo-ɓusɛi zu, gè maavalibo ga faaɠaaɠaa yii. <verse eid="EZK 36:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 36:27"/>Nà nà-Zɛnvui ʋu wo-yiimaʋɛ, gè zobo fe wo ʋɛ, wo zoo wo ɠolo nà-tɔgiti bɛ, wo nà-deveiti so gè ti veeni wo ya, wo ziɛ ga tiye. <verse eid="EZK 36:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 36:28"/>Wa zei zooi naa zu, gè feeni wo-mɛmɛwolani bɛ. Wa ɠɛ ga nà-nuɓusɛiti, gè ɠɛ ga wa-ƓALAGI. <verse eid="EZK 36:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 36:29"/>Nà wo ɠula wa-vaa ɲɔiti pɛ su. Gè la mɔ pului loa wo ma, kɛlɛ nà moloi ɓɛtɛ, wo ɗa kula gola molo leʋei zu. <verse eid="EZK 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 36:30"/>Nà gwaa wuluiti gaawaaiti mɔin gola, ta kpalaga aniiti, eyɛsu pɛ zii ɠiligiti ti la mɔ ɲɛɛɠulaa wo zu, ti ʋa ɠɛ ma wa ɓɔlɔzu ga pului. <verse eid="EZK 36:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 36:31"/>Naazu wo-ɠi ka loo wo-ziɛ ʋele ɲɔiti su, ta wo luʋa ʋele ɲɔiti, wo yiiɠaawana ɓɔɠɔ ma ga wa-vaaɠaaza golaiti ta wa-ɠɔzɔba vaiti wo ti ɠɛɛni. <verse eid="EZK 36:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 36:32"/>Gè la naa ɠɛɛzu wo maaʋele ma,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. « ‹Kɛni wo ɠɛ naa zuɠwɛɛ! À unfe gaamazu ga wo luʋa ʋelei, Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti!<verse eid="EZK 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 36:33"/>« ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Siɛgi zu gè wa-vaaɠaaza golaiti gbazu la wo ʋa, nà taaiti sulaave ʋolu ga nuɓusɛiti. Ʋɛti náti goloai, mináti ta lo ʋolu. <verse eid="EZK 36:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 36:34"/>Zooi ti yeeɓeni ba, tii ɠa ɠɛ miná, teʋe nuiti ti la mɔ zou ɠaa kɛlɛi wogai ba. <verse eid="EZK 36:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 36:35"/>Nuiti ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: Zooi tɛi ge ɠoloɠoloni, kɛlɛ é ʋaga eɠɛ Edɛn kpelei. Taai tɛiti ti ɠoloɠoloni, ti zuwo, ti ɠɛlɛ ti ʋa, ti loga ʋolu, ti zulaave ʋolu. <verse eid="EZK 36:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 36:36"/>Zooiti ti yɛsu ná wo-maaɠoolii zu, ta suɠwɛɛ ga nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gè taaiti toga ʋolu, niiti ti ɠoloɠoloni, gè kpeleiti suziin, ʋɛti kɛlɛi woni naati ba. Nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa kpɔ̀ɛai, nà kɛ nɔ.<verse eid="EZK 36:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 36:37"/>« ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Wɛlɛ, nà va bu Izilayɛle nuiti ti kpɔbai ɠaiziɛ zèa. Nà ti wooɠaaʋote, ti mɔin gola, eɠɛ nuɓusɛ ɓulugiti. <verse eid="EZK 36:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 36:38"/>Taaiti ti ɠoloɠologai za, ti zulaa ɠa ve ga nuɓusɛ ɓulugiti, eɠɛʋelei Zeluzalɛme a ɗa ɠɛ la, ta-zalaɠa ɠula yeeiti, zalaɠa loganiiti ta ɗa ziɛ eɠɛ kooɠoa. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.› »<verse eid="EZK 36:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EZK 37"/>
  <para style="s">Nu ɠae vɔɔiti ma ɠulakɛlɛmai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 37:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zɛbɛi ɠɛni bà, ná-Zɛnvui liini ga ze, é pìlɛ nɛmɛ wolai zu, ʋɛ zooi maalaaveni ná ga nu ɠaei. <verse eid="EZK 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 37:2"/>É pìlɛni teʋeteʋegi zu ti-maaɠoolii pɛ su, tama, ti mɔinni gola, ti vɔa ɠɛni de kpaan.<verse eid="EZK 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 37:3"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, kaei niiti ta zoo nɛi ti yɛnvu ʋolu ɓaa?» Gè gooɠaaʋoteni, gè ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠila kpe nɔ ɠa è kwɛɛ.» <verse eid="EZK 37:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 37:4"/>É ɠɛni mà: «GALA gooi wo dɛɛ niima ɠae vɔɔiti ma, è ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Kae vɔɔiti, à woilo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi ma! <verse eid="EZK 37:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 37:5"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà fiilɛi ʋuuzu wo zu ʋolu, wo zɛnvui wo. <verse eid="EZK 37:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 37:6"/>Nà wo ma ɲataiti tɛɛzu wo ma, gè wo ma zuai lɛ wo ma, gè wo-ɠɔlɔgi lɛ wo ma, gè zɛnvu viilɛi ʋu wo zu, wa yɛnvu. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.› »<verse eid="EZK 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 37:7"/>Gè GALA gooi woni eɠɛʋelei gè devei zɔlɔɔni la. Kɛ̀ai ma ɓɔɛzu, gè ani ɲiikpi tu golai mɛnini, kaeiti kɛni de, ti ɗa maaɓuɠa ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, ti ɠilagilagiti, é zoloo ti lobazuʋɛti ma. <verse eid="EZK 37:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 37:8"/>Gè kaani ga ti-ɲataiti ta ti ma, ma zuai ɗa ɓɛtɛ ti ma, ma ɠɔlɔgi ɗa lɛ ti ma, kɛlɛ zɛnvu la ɠɛni dɛ ti zu.<verse eid="EZK 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 37:9"/>Maliɠii ɠɛni mà naazu: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɓɔɛ zɛnvu viilɛi ʋɔ, è ɠɛ ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Ʋa, è zeɠe zooi ma zoko naanigɔiti su, è ʋu poomai tɛiti ma, ti vulu su.› » <verse eid="EZK 37:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 37:10"/>Gè GALA gooi woni eɠɛʋelei é dèveni la. Zɛnvu viilɛi lɔɔni poomaiti su, ti vulu su. Ti ɠaalɔni, ti lo ɠɔɠɔiti ga. É ɠɛni ga bɛbɛ wolai, daawɔɔlɔ gola.<verse eid="EZK 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 37:11"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, kaei tɛiti ta ga Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ma ʋoogi. Izilayɛle nuiti ta ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Gá ga kae vɔɔiti, gi ɠitosu la ná, gi loa ya.› <verse eid="EZK 37:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 37:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, GALA gooi wo, è ɠɛ ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà ʋaazu wa-ɠabaiti daalaosu, ee, nà-nuɓusɛiti, gè wo ɠula ti zu, gè li ʋolu ga woye wa-yooi zu Izilayɛle. <verse eid="EZK 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 37:13"/>Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, siɛgi zu gè wa-ɠabaiti daalaosu da, gè wo ɠula ti zu, ee, nà-nuɓusɛiti! <verse eid="EZK 37:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 37:14"/>Nà nà-Zɛnvui ʋuuna wo zu, wo zɛnvui wo ʋolu, ta siɛgi zu gè wo zeizu la ʋolu wa-yooi zu, názu wa suɠwɛɛ ga nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa kpɔ̀ɛai, tama nii gè bogai, nà kɛ nɔ,› » Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maliɠii ɠa gilibalai ɓɛtɛ <optbreak/> ná-nuɓusɛiti zɔɠɔzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 37:15"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 37:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 37:16"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, gulu ɓuɠai zeɠe, è niima wooiti sɛʋɛ ma: ‹Zuda ta Izilayɛle tɛiti ti ɓɔgai masadai ma, tɔnɔi ɠaa›. È gulu ɓuɠai taɠili seɠe, è sɛʋɛ ma ga: ‹Zozɛfe (ɓaa Efelayime) ná-gului ɠaa, ta Izilayɛle tɛiti ti ɓɔgai masadai ma›. <verse eid="EZK 37:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 37:17"/>Ti zei ɓɔɠɔ la, é ɠɛ è ya ga gulu ɓuɠa ɠila kpe nɔ, ti ɠili ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 37:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 37:18"/>Siɛgi zu ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ta è ɠaazaɠana da ga: ‹È la naa ʋolu lɛɛzu ga giye mu ɓaa?› <verse eid="EZK 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 37:19"/>ɗa ti wooɠaaʋote, è ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà Zozɛfe ná-gulu ɓuɠai zeɠezu, é zoni Efelayime ya, ta Izilayɛle wolodaiti ti ɓɔgai su, gè sei Zuda ná-gulu ɓuɠai la, gè kpɛtɛ ga gulu ɠila, ti ɠɛ ga ani ɠila kpe zèa.›<verse eid="EZK 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 37:20"/>«Gulu ɓuɠaiti è sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛzu ti ma, ta ɠɛ zoni è ya ti ɠaazu, <verse eid="EZK 37:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 37:21"/>ɗa ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà Izilayɛle nuiti kulazu zii ɠiligiti saama. Ʋɛti ti liini náti, gè ti ɠaalɛ ba, ti zeɠe adaʋɛ pɛ, gè ʋa ga tiye ʋolu ta-yooi zu. <verse eid="EZK 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 37:22"/>Miná ɠa nà ti ɠaalɛ ba ná, ti ɠɛ ga zii ɠila kpe Izilayɛle ɠizeiti ma. Masa gila kpegi ɠa a zei ti pɛ unda. Zeeɠaaɠwɛɛzu la mɔ ɠɛa nuɓusɛ zeizu felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, ɓaa masada zeizu felegɔiti. <verse eid="EZK 37:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 37:23"/>Ti la mɔ ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔa ʋolu, ti ʋa ɗa nɔkɔ kɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti bu, ti ʋa ɗa kɔzɔba vaiti kɛ, ta tɔ koloɠologi ma zii pɛ. Nà ti ɠula wooʋalada vaiti pɛ su, niiti ti ti ɠɛɛni nɔ̀un daalɔɠɔma. Nà ti gba, ti ɲade, ti ɠɛ ga nà-nuɓusɛiti, gè ɠɛ ga ta-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="EZK 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 37:24"/>« ‹Nà-botiɠɛ nui Davide ɠa ɠɛ ga ta-masagi, tɔ ɠila kpe ka a ɠɛ ga ti makɛ nui. Ta ziɛ ga nà-tɔ gooiti, ta nà-deveiti so, ti ziɛ ga tiye, niiti gè ti zɛʋɛni ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 37:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 37:25"/>Ta eteai ziɛ zooi naa zu gè feeni nà-botiɠɛ nui Zakɔɓe ʋɛ, ʋɛ ti-mɛmɛwolani ti ɠɛni ná. Ta zei ná eyɛsu ɠɔ, tiya-o, ti-lointi-yo, ta ti-mavofodaiti pɛ. Nà-botiɠɛ nui Davide ɠa zei ti unda eyɛsu ɠɔ. <verse eid="EZK 37:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 37:26"/>Nà minazeɠezu ti ʋɛ, ga ziilɛigi ɠa yɛ ti ya eyɛsu ɠɔ. Nà ti zei ʋele ɓɛtɛ, gè ti ɠaawɔɔlɔ. Nà sèizu ɲadegai lo ti zaama, é yɛ ná ɠɔ. <verse eid="EZK 37:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 37:27"/>Sèizuʋɛ ɠa ɠɛ ti zaama. Nà ɠɛ ga ta-ƓALAGI, ti ɠɛ ga nà-nuɓusɛiti. <verse eid="EZK 37:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 37:28"/>Zɔɔma you ɠiligiti ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ta nà Izilayɛle lo nà-botii laawu, siɛgi zu sèizu ɲadegai losu la ti zaama, é yɛ ná ɠɔ.› »<verse eid="EZK 37:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EZK 38"/>
  <para style="s">Gɔge laalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 38:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="EZK 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 38:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɠaaʋote Gɔge ma, Mesɛke ta Tuɓale nuiti ta-ɠundiɠi wolai, é Magɔge yooi zu, GALA gooi wo daalɔɠɔma, <verse eid="EZK 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 38:3"/>è ɠɛ ma: Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Wɛlɛ, nà è laalɔɠɔma, Gɔge, Mesɛke ta Tuɓale nuiti ta-ɠundiɠi wolai. <verse eid="EZK 38:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 38:4"/>Nà kɔlu ɠalagiti pilisu è-ɓaalɔɠaeiti ba, gè è zeɠe è-zeizuʋɛ ga maaɓaai. Nà ɓɔi è la, è ɠula ɗa-yooi ʋa, ɗa-o, ɗa-ɠɔɔɓɔgiti-yo, sooiti ta soo ɠɔma nuiti ti maaɠiliai ga pagɔ, salaʋusu ɓulu golaiti, kɔɔɠɔ ɠɔlu zɛpɛgiti ti ti ya ta boɠa zɔkpɔiti. <verse eid="EZK 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 38:5"/>Pɛɛlese zalaʋusuiti ta Etiyopi, ta Pute, ti pɛ ta kɔɔɠɔ ɠɔlu zɛpɛgiti seɠe ta kɔlu wɔɔlɔgiti, ti li è ʋolu. <verse eid="EZK 38:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 38:6"/>Gomɛɛl yooi zu zalaʋusuiti, ta Ɓɛte-Togaalema geleiti, zooi ɠaaɓelazuʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, naati ma ɓulugiti ta ʋilɛ è ʋolu, wo li, nuɓusɛ ɠiligiti ta zunu mɔinmɔingaa.<verse eid="EZK 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 38:7"/>« ‹Kɛʋele ɓɛtɛi wo mɛtu, è ɗa maaɓɔungi wo, ɗa-o, bɛbɛi kulaai-yo, è ga ti leʋe nui. <verse eid="EZK 38:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 38:8"/>Su a ɠoozana, kona mɔinmɔin teʋega ʋoluma, nà bo è ma niina ga è li è laalɛ Izilayɛle yooi wu. Su nuɓusɛiti ti yɛga vulua kɔɔi ʋoluma, ta zeɠe zou mɔinmɔin su, ʋɛti ti ɠɛni náti, ti ɠaalɛ ba Izilayɛle ɠizeiti ma, ti yɛgai kɛlɛbalai zu eyɛsu suɠooza. É zo ti ɠula folo ma zɔɔma nuɓusɛ ɠiligiti saama, ta zei niina ziilɛigi zu ti-zeizuʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 38:9"/>Ɗa-o, ɗa-ɠɔɔɓɔgiti-yo, ta bɛbɛi wo yeezogai, wa laalɛ ti wu, wo yei ti unga eɠɛ fiilɛ wolai, wo ʋu ta-yooi zu eɠɛ tonaɓiingi é zooi maaɓidizu.<verse eid="EZK 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 38:10"/>« ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛ: Niima yeeɠɛɠalai a zeelina, kisiɛ mɔinmɔin ka ɠɛ è-ɠi su, ɗa ɠɛ kigaiziɛ ɲɔiti bosu. <verse eid="EZK 38:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 38:11"/>Ɗa deve ga è laalɛ ziilɛi nuiti bu, ti zeini ziilɛigi zu ta-yooi zu, siɠi ge la ta-laaiti ma, kpo ge la náti, sɔɠɔ ge ʋa ɠɛ ti ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 38:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 38:12"/>Ɗa ʋaazu devezu ga è toomai wo, è kɔɔzoganiiti seɠe. È laalɛ nuɓusɛiti bu ti zeiɗai ʋolu taa wɔlɔmaiti su niiti ti ɠoloɠoloni kaite, ti ɠaalɛai ba, ti ɠula zou ɠiligiti su, ti toganiiti ta ani ʋagɔiti sɔlɔɔgai, ti zeini zou zaamaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 38:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 38:13"/>Saɓa ta Dedan nuiti, ta Taalasise yaaɠoiti, ta ta-ɠundiɠiiti ta ɠɛ è ma: Kɔɔzogani zo fai ɠa è niima ɠɔɔɓɔgi pɛ gaalɛai ba ma ɓaa? Walii ta zanugi zeɠe vai ɠa è ʋaai ma, è toganiiti seɠe, ta ani ʋagɔiti, è kɔɔzogani mɔinmɔin golaiti gaalɛ ba?›<verse eid="EZK 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 38:14"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, GALA gooi wo, è ɠɛ Gɔge ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Koleʋɛ ga foloi nà-nuɓusɛiti, Izilayɛle nuiti ta zei la ziilɛigi zu, ɗa naa zuɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="EZK 38:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 38:15"/>Ɗa ʋa, è zeɠe ɗa-yooi ɠwɛmaʋɛ, lɛkpɛma nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, ɗa ɠɛ salaʋusuiti untuɠɔ, ti ɠulaai zooi pɛ su, ti pɛ ti zeini sooiti kɔma, wa ɠɛ ga kɔɔɓɔ golai nii gaalɛai ba. <verse eid="EZK 38:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 38:16"/>Ɗa ʋaazu è laalɛ Izilayɛle wu, nà-nuɓusɛiti, eɠɛ tonaɓiingi a ɗa zooi maaɓidi. Eteai ɠaaɓelazuʋɛ ɠa naa a ɠɛɛ la. Nà ʋa ga ɗe nà-zooi laalɔɠɔma, gè dɛɛ ga zii ɠiligiti ga nà ga GALA. Ee Gɔge! Nii da ziɛ su da ɗe, nà nà-ɲadedai lɛ ga tiye naa zu.<verse eid="EZK 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 38:17"/>« ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Ɗa ɠa gè ɗa-vai woni, kaite suɠooza, siɛgi zu gè boni la nà-botiɠɛ nuiti ma, Izilayɛle ná-GALA goo wo nuiti, ga ti daazeeli kona mɔinmɔin daawu, ga nà nui ta leʋe, é laalɛ nà-nuɓusɛiti bu. <verse eid="EZK 38:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 38:18"/>Naama voloi, yeei Gɔge ʋaazu la Izilayɛle yooi laalɔɠɔma, nà-ziiɠaawanai loko ɠa leʋe,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 38:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 38:19"/>« ‹Nà-ziiɠaawana wolai zu, nà ɠonazu ga naama volo ná, zou ɓali wolai ɠa Izilayɛle yooi ɲiikpi. <verse eid="EZK 38:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 38:20"/>Kaleiti ti kpoloɗɛi wu, ta wɔniiti ti geezuʋɛ, naa ʋɛɛ suaiti ba ti dɔɓɔi zu, ta kpokpo ganiiti ti zooi ɠa, ta nuɓusɛiti ti eteai zu, ti pɛ ta ɓali gàazu ga duai. Gizeiti ta ɓusɛ, fasaiti ti ʋaliʋali, siɠigiti pɛ ti ʋu ya zooi ma. <verse eid="EZK 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 38:21"/>Nà kɔɔi maaloli Gɔge laalɔɠɔma nà-gizeiti pɛ ma, ná-salaʋusuiti ta ɓɔɠɔ ʋaa, ɛsɛ ge ɗa boɠa zɔkpɔi ʋu bɔɔla ʋa,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 38:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 38:22"/>« ‹Nà tukpɔ ga gè ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi ʋɛɛ ba, ta zuwuɠaaleʋei. Nà sabala tona wolai yei ma, sakɔtui bu, gè abu zei ma, é ɠalazu ga timinigi, naa ɠa zeeli ná-salaʋusuiti ma, ta nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔingiti ma ti polu. <verse eid="EZK 38:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 38:23"/>Ʋele ɠana nà dɛɛ la ga zii ɠiligiti pɛ ga nà ga GALAGI bɔɔlɔai ta ɲadegai. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.› »<verse eid="EZK 38:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EZK 39"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 39:1"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, GALA gooi wo Gɔge laalɔɠɔma, è ɠɛ ma: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Wɛlɛ, nà è laalɔɠɔma, Gɔge, Mesɛke ta Tuɓale nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠi wolai. <verse eid="EZK 39:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 39:2"/>Nà è ɠula ɗa-yooi zu, gè li ga ɗe, nà è ɠula nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ yooi ɠaaɓelazuʋɛ ga è li, è laalɛ Izilayɛle ɠizeiti bu. <verse eid="EZK 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 39:3"/>Nà è zuloɠa, nii a kɛ è-ɠɔʋɛi ɓe ɗa-mɛɛin ʋa, é loo, ɗa-mɛɛinti ti ɠula è-yeezai ɠa, ti loo. <verse eid="EZK 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 39:4"/>Wa za Izilayɛle ɠizeiti ma, ɗa-o, ɗa-ɠɔɔɓɔgiti-yo, ta nuɓusɛiti kpein ti è ʋolu. Nà ɓe wɔniiti ba ta dɔɓɔ zuaiti, ti wo-ma ʋoomaiti kɛ ga laamianigi. <verse eid="EZK 39:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 39:5"/>Ɗa za dɔɓɔ zaamaʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ nà ɠa kpɔ̀ɛai,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 39:6"/>« ‹Nà abui lo Magɔge yooi ʋa, ta ziɛ zaama yooiti ba, ti kaazu ga ta zeini ziilɛigi zu. Ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="EZK 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 39:7"/>« ‹Nà kɛ ʋele-o-ʋele, nà-nuɓusɛiti, Izilayɛle nuiti, ti kwɛɛ ʋelei ɲàdegai la, gè la mɔ ti yɛga ná, ti ʋa ɓaaɠula dàasei ɲadegai ma. Zii ɠiligiti ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALA Ɲadegai. <verse eid="EZK 39:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 39:8"/>Nii pɛ ka ɠɛ, ti laa ɠa zeeli,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. « ‹Foloi gè ná-fai woni, naa ɠa zeeli. <verse eid="EZK 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 39:9"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ta ɠula ta-laaiti su, ta abui ɠaazo, ti ti zili nuiti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti gala. Kɔɔɠɔ ɠɔlu zɛpɛ koiti, ta ma wolaiti, naa ʋɛɛ mɛɛinti ta mɛɛn ɠaeiti ba, tukpɔiti ta kpɛɛinti, ta yɛ abui laazu ga tiye eyɛsu kona dɔfela. <verse eid="EZK 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 39:10"/>Nuiti kpɛdɛ la mɔ ɠɛa ba ga ti li koʋii ɠalezu dɔɓɔ zu, ti la mɔ gulua ʋɔga dɔɓɔ zu, mazɔlɔɔ niima ɠɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti ka ta ɠɛ abui laazu ga tiye. Ta loo naati ma, niiti ti looni ti ma, ti naati kɔligiti kula ti ya, niiti ti ti-ɠɔligiti kulani ti ya.› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 39:11"/>« ‹Naama volo ná, nà maaɠulu bosuʋɛ ve Gɔge ʋɛ, Izilayɛle yooi zu, siɛʋeaiti ta-nɛmɛi zu, Kpoloɗɛ Wanai letemaʋɛ, folo ɠulazu ʋelei. Maaɠulu bosuʋɛ naa ɠa pelei leʋe siɛʋeaiti tuɠɔ. Ná ɠa ta Gɔge maaɠulu ná, ta ná-bɛbɛ wolai, ta ná loli ga: Gɔge Ná-Bɛbɛi Ná-Nɛmɛi. <verse eid="EZK 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 39:12"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ta alu dɔfela ɠɛ ti ʋa niima nuɓusɛiti kpein maaɠulu, nii a kɛ ti zooi ɲade. <verse eid="EZK 39:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 39:13"/>Ná yɔɠɔzuʋɛ nuɓusɛiti pɛ ta ʋɛɛ ti ʋa maaɠulu vai zu. Toɠa ɠɛ ga tɔɠɔɠula faa, voloi nà ɓɔɠɔ wɔɔlɔna la ti ɠaazu,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 39:14"/>« ‹Alu dɔfelai naati poluma, ta zunuiti kula, ti ta-yeeɠɛɠalai pɛ seɠe, ti ɗa leʋe zooi zu ná pɛ, ga ti ɗa nu ʋoomaiti maaɠulu, zɔiti ti yɛgai laani zooi ma, nii a kɛ zooi ɠaa ɲade. <verse eid="EZK 39:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 39:15"/>Ta ziɛ zooi zu ná pɛ. Siɛgi zu ti taɠila ge nu ɠaeiti kaazu la, toɠa kɔtui ziɠi to ná ga poogi, zeɠe wɔ nuiti ta ʋaana, ti ʋa ti zeɠe, ti ti maaɠulu Gɔge Ná-bɛbɛi Ná-nɛmɛi Zu. <verse eid="EZK 39:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 39:16"/>Taai ta ɠa ɠɛ ná vɔlɔ, ta daasei pɛɛ ga: Ɠamona, nii poluʋɛ ga: Bɛbɛi. Ʋele ɠana ta zooi gba la.›<verse eid="EZK 39:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 39:17"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Wɔniiti toli, ta dɔɓɔ zuaiti, è ɠɛ ma: ‹À ʋa, wo zeɠe mini-o-mini, wo ɠaalɛ ba zalaɠai ma gè kulazu wo ʋɛ. Toɠa ɠɛɛzu ga zalaɠa wolai Izilayɛle ɠizeiti ma. Wa suai mi, wo ɓɔɔle ga ɲamai. <verse eid="EZK 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 39:18"/>Wa kɔɔɠɔ ɠuluɓaiti ma zuai mi, wo etea ɠundiɠiiti ma ɲamai ɓɔle, ti ɠulaai ga zalaɠai baala sinɛiti potogi zu, ta baala ziʋoiti, naa ʋɛɛ boli zinɛiti, ta nikɛ zinɛiti ba ti wola lɔtɔai ga daamii Ɓasan ɠizei ma. <verse eid="EZK 39:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 39:19"/>Zalaɠai gè wo lolisu ma, wa gulɔi mi, é kula ɠɛ ga woye, wo ɓɔɔle ga ɲamai, é wo zo eɠɛ dɔɔi. <verse eid="EZK 39:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 39:20"/>Nà-fɛtii naa zu, wa daami wo, é kula ɠɛ, ga soo zuaiti, ta soo ɓizɛ zalaʋusuiti, ta salaʋusuiti, ta kɔɔɠɔ nui ma ziiti pɛ,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 39:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 39:21"/>«Nà nà-lɛbiyai ɠula kɛlɛma zii ɠiligiti gaazu ɠana. Ti pɛ ta pɛtɛ ʋelei nà ɗa nà-tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe la ga zobogi, é ʋilɛ ti ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 39:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 39:22"/>É zo naama voloi ma, eyɛsu ɠɔ, Izilayɛle nuiti ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ta-ƓALAGI.»<verse eid="EZK 39:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ezekiyɛle ná-kpɔɛiti unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 39:23"/>«Zii ɠiligi zɔiti ta suɠwɛɛ ga Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠei ná-kotoi maaʋele ɠa ti ti ɠulani la zooi ʋa, ta-wooʋaladai nii ti kɛɛni dàalɔɠɔma. Gè ʋoluaveni ti ʋa, gè ti yɛ ná, ti lɔ ti zili nuiti zeezu, ga ti za kɔɔi zu ga boɠa zɔkpɔi. <verse eid="EZK 39:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 39:24"/>Gè ɠaazulɔɔɠuni ti ʋa, gè ti zo é zoloo ta-ɠɔzɔba vai ma ta ta-lɔ koloɠologiti.<verse eid="EZK 39:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 39:25"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Nà ʋaazu niina ga Zakɔɓe ná-nuiti ti ti ɠulani zooi ʋa, nà Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ maawɔinɠa, nà-ziizoolɛi ɠa ɠɛ ga unfemai ve nà-ɲadedai ʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 39:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 39:26"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠi ge loozu la ta-wooʋaladai kpein su, niiti ti ti ɠɛɛni dàalɔɠɔma, nɛi gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ta unfe naazu, ta ɠɛna zeini ti-ɓɔɠɔ yooi zu, ziilɛigi zu. <verse eid="EZK 39:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 39:27"/>Nà ʋaana ga tiye ta-yooi zu, gè ti ɠula ti zili nuiti ta-yooiti su, ti maaʋele ɠa nà dɛɛ la ga zii mɔinmɔin ga nà ga GALA ɲadegai. <verse eid="EZK 39:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 39:28"/>Tiya ɓɔɠɔi ta suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ta-ƓALAGI, nà ɠa gè ɠɛɛni ga kɔɔʋelai zii ɠiligiti saama, naa ʋolu gè ti ɠaalɛa ba, gè ʋa ga tiye ta-yooi zu, gè la tanɔpɛ zɛga ná. <verse eid="EZK 39:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 39:29"/>Eyɛsu pɛ gè la mɔ ʋoluavega Izilayɛle nuiti ba, siɛgi zu gè nà-zɛnvui veezu la ti ʋɛ,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 39:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EZK 40"/>
  <para style="ms">GALA Sei Ʋɛlɛ Niinɛi Ma Ɠulakɛlɛmai</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="EZK 40:14-48:35">40:14—48:35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 40:1"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai gi ɠɛni la Ɓaɓilɔne, naama ɠona ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlusiɛi (25), alu mɔungi ma volo puugɔi ma, kona puugɔ maazu naanigɔi (14) laaɓaai ma Zeluzalɛme taai zoga ʋoluma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zɛbɛi yeini mà, é li ga ze munu. <verse eid="EZK 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 40:2"/>Kulakɛlɛmai zu nii gè sɔlɔɔni GALA zea, é liini ga ze Izilayɛle yooi zu, é tò gize ɠaaɠooza golai maazuʋɛ, nu yeezazu ʋelei pɛlɛiti ti ɠɛni ná, eɠɛ taai. <verse eid="EZK 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 40:3"/>É liini ga ze náʋɛ, gè zunui ta ɠaani, kɛʋelei ɠɛai eɠɛ kɔlu ɓɔigi ɠɛʋelei. Geze ɠalui ta seeli kpakui ɠɛni zoni zea, kɔɠɔ bo fai ma. É ɠɛni loni siɠidaʋɛ ɠobaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 40:4"/>Zunui naa ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɠaazuzeɠe ma, è wɛlɛ, è woilo! Ɠida nii wu ga pagɔ, nii gè ʋaazu dɛɛzu ga ɗe, mazɔlɔɔ GALA paaʋe ga ɗe ʋɛ nii a kɛ è naama vaiti ka. Nii kpein è ka, ɗa ti zuɠulazu Izilayɛle nuiti ma.»<verse eid="EZK 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Koizuʋɛ ta ma ziɠidaʋɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 40:5"/>Nii gè pɛtɛni ná ɠɛni ga, siɠigi ɠakuni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma lɛkpɛmaʋɛti pɛ. Seeli kpakui ɠɛni zoni zea, nii sɔligi ɠɛni ga zeezakpa lɔzita. Zeezakpai ɠilagilagi ɠoozani ga zeelo gila é leʋe zeezakpa wɔlɔmai ʋa. É pɛlɛi ɠogi ɠɔɠɔni, naa ɠɛ ga seeli kpaku ɠila, ta sɔligi ɠɛ ga seeli kpaku ɠila.<verse eid="EZK 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 40:6"/>É liini siɠidaʋɛ é folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é lɛɛni nu lɛɛzuʋɛ, é nu ɠɔɠɔ losuʋɛ ɠɔɠɔni siɠidaʋɛ, naa ɓomaʋɛ ɠɛni ga seeli kpaku ɠilagi zɔligi. <verse eid="EZK 40:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 40:7"/>Pɛlɛ goi ɠilagilagi ɠɛni ga seeli kpaku ɠilagi zɔligi, kogi ta sakpai. Zeelo dɔɔlugɔ naa ɠa é ɠɛni ga siɠigi ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ. Siɠidaʋɛ, é zo tɛɛ wosuʋɛ é li koozuʋɛ, naa ɠɛni ga seeli kpaku ɠilagi zɔligi. <verse eid="EZK 40:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 40:8"/>Zunui tɛɛ wosuʋɛ ɠɔɠɔni. <verse eid="EZK 40:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 40:9"/>É ɠɛni ga zeezakpa lɔsaʋa. Kpɛdɛ felegɔiti gaaɠilini ga zeezakpa felegɔ, ti ɠilagilagiti. Tɛɛ wosuʋɛ naa maaɓuɠani GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 40:10"/>Pɛlɛ go lɔzitai naati ti ɠɛni siɠidaʋɛ folo ɠulazu ʋelei, ti ɠɛni tie nɔ. Ɗa ɠɛna lɛa, saʋagɔ zɔɔla ʋele, saʋagɔ zɔɔla ʋele. Kpɛdɛgiti ti ɠɛni tie nɔ, ná zeizu ɠilagilagi pɛ. <verse eid="EZK 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 40:11"/>Zunui siɠidaʋɛ ɠɔɠɔni, é ɠɛni ga zeezakpa puugɔ, sakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa puugɔ maazu saʋagɔ (13). <verse eid="EZK 40:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 40:12"/>Pɛlɛ goiti daaʋɛ, ti ɠɛni ga seki naanigi, zeezakpa lɔzita, nu ziɛzuʋɛti zɔɠɔzuʋɛti ti loni é lɛ é ɠwɛ zeezakpa ɠila ba. <verse eid="EZK 40:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 40:13"/>Naa ʋolu é siɠidaʋɛti kogiti kɔɠɔni, é zo zɔi ɓogi ma, é li zɔi ɓogi zu, é zo ti-laaʋɛti ma ti leteni ɓɔɠɔ ma, naa ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25). <verse eid="EZK 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 40:14"/>Zenɔ ɠana é kɛɛni la ga kpɛdɛgiti: zeezakpa ʋuulɔzita (60). GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoi wolai ɠakuni tɛɛ wosuʋɛ tɔna ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 40:15"/>É zo siɠidaʋɛ ma nu lɛɛzuʋɛ, é zeeli tɛɛ wosuʋɛ ma, koozuʋɛ é ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50). <verse eid="EZK 40:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 40:16"/>Giliyaze fenɛtɛlɛiti ti ɠɛni pɛlɛ goiti ta ma ɓɛdɛgiti ba, daa ɗa lao koozu ʋelei, kpogi maaɠoolii zu, zenɔ ɠana é ɠɛni la ga tɛɛ wosuʋɛ fenɛtɛlɛiti ti ɠakuni ma, daa ɗa lao ga koozu ʋelei. Dɔɔ wului maaniinigi ɠɛni kpɛdɛgi ɠilagilagi pɛ ma.<verse eid="EZK 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 40:17"/>Zunui liini ga ze GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoi wolai zu. Koizuʋɛ naa ziɛni, maaɠooli ga pɛlɛ ʋuusaʋagɔ (30). <verse eid="EZK 40:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 40:18"/>Zooi maaʋɛ pɛ ka naa ziɛni, é ɠaku siɠidaʋɛti gilagilagi pɛ ma, é zoloo naa zakpai ma. Naa ɠaayeini é leʋe koizuʋɛ ɠoozuʋɛ ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 40:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 40:19"/>Zunui koizuʋɛ liegɔi ɠɔɠɔni, é zo siɠida mɔungi ma, é zeeli koi zaamaʋɛ ma ziɠigi ma, é su ʋelei, é ɠɛ ga zeezakpa ungila (100). Folo ɠulazu ʋele gelei ɠana. Nii pilɛgai lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei ʋa: <verse eid="EZK 40:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 40:20"/>É kpogi zakpai ta kogi ɠɔɠɔni, nii gaaʋotegai lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei ma, koi wolai zu. <verse eid="EZK 40:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 40:21"/>Pɛlɛ goi ɠɛni ga dɔzita, saʋagɔ zɔɔla ʋelei, saʋagɔ zɔɔla ʋelei nu ziɛzuʋɛ. Kpɛdɛgiti ta tɛɛ wosuʋɛ ti ɠɛni ga lie, eɠɛʋelei nɔ folo ɠulazu ʋele ziɠidaʋɛ ɠɛni la. Tɛɛ wosuʋɛ zakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50), kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25). <verse eid="EZK 40:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 40:22"/>Ná-fenɛtɛlɛiti ta tɛɛ wosuʋɛ, ta ná-dɔɔ wulu maaniinigiti, ti pɛ ti zolooni ɓɔɠɔ ma, eɠɛʋelei nɔ zɔɔma ziɠidaʋɛ ɠɛni la, é folo ɠulazu ʋelei. Nu ɠɔɠɔ losuʋɛ ɠɛni lɔfela nu lɛɛzuʋɛ, naati kakalaʋɛti, tɛɛ wosuʋɛ ɠɛni ná. <verse eid="EZK 40:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 40:23"/>Siɠidaʋɛ ta leteni nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ ma ɓogi ma, é lo koi ɠoozuʋɛ ziɠigi ʋa, eɠɛʋelei nɔ é ɠɛni la ga folo ɠulazu ʋele gelei. Zunui siɠidaʋɛti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ɠɔɠɔni, é ɠɛ ga zeezakpa ungila (100).<verse eid="EZK 40:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 40:24"/>Naa ʋolu, é liini ga ze nu yeezazuʋɛ, gè siɠida ɠila kaani ná. É ma ɓɛdɛgiti kɔɠɔni, ta ma lɛɛ wosuʋɛ, ti pɛ ti zolooni ɓɔɠɔ ma ta zɔiti. <verse eid="EZK 40:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 40:25"/>Fenɛtɛlɛiti ti ɠakuni siɠidaʋɛ tɔna ma, ta tɛɛ wosuʋɛ, ti ɠulaai ga zɔiti nɔ, ti-liegɔi ɠɛni ɠana ɓalaa, tɛɛ wosuʋɛ naa zɔligi ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50), kogi zeezakpa ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25). <verse eid="EZK 40:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 40:26"/>Nu ɠɔɠɔ losuʋɛ ɠɛni lɔfela nu lɛɛzuʋɛ, naati kakalaʋɛti, tɛɛ wosuʋɛ ɠɛni ná. Pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ tɔna, dɔɔ wului maaniinigi ɠɛni ná seɠeai kpɛdɛgiti ma, nu ɠakama felegɔiti. <verse eid="EZK 40:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 40:27"/>Koi ɠoozuʋɛ ziɠidaʋɛ ɠɛni ba nu yeezazuʋɛ. Zunui kɔɠɔgi woni nu yeezazuʋɛ ziɠida felegɔiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ, é ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ungila (100).<verse eid="EZK 40:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Koi zaamaʋɛ ta ma ziɠidaʋɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 40:28"/>Naa ʋolu, é lɛɛni ga ze koi zaamaʋɛ ga nu yeezazu ʋele ziɠida ʋelei, é siɠidaʋɛ naa ɠɔɠɔni, ti ɠɛni tie nɔ ta zɔiti. <verse eid="EZK 40:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 40:29"/>Pɛlɛ goiti, ta ná-kpɛdɛgiti, ta ma lɛɛ wosuʋɛ ti ɠɛni tie nɔ ta zɔiti. Fenɛtɛlɛiti ti ɠɛni pɛlɛi ʋa, ti ɠaku ma. Tɛɛ wosuʋɛ zakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50), kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25). <verse eid="EZK 40:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 40:30"/>Tɛɛ wosuʋɛti ti ɠakuni ma, sakpai ga zeezakpa ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25), kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa lɔɔlugɔ. <verse eid="EZK 40:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 40:31"/>Tɛɛ wosuʋɛ ɠaaʋoteni koi wolai ma. Dɔɔ wului maaniinigi ɠɛni kpɛdɛgiti ma. Nu ɠɔɠɔ losuʋɛ ɠɛni lɔsaʋa, nu lɛɛzuʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 40:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 40:32"/>Zunui liini ga ze, gi lɔ folo ɠulazu ʋele ziɠidaʋɛ, gi li koi zaamaʋɛ. É siɠidaʋɛ ɠɔɠɔni, ti ɠɛni tie nɔ ta zɔiti. <verse eid="EZK 40:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 40:33"/>Pɛlɛ goiti, ta ná-kpɛdɛgiti, ta ma lɛɛ wosuʋɛ ti ɠɛni tie nɔ ta zɔiti. Fenɛtɛlɛiti ti ɠɛni pɛlɛi ʋa, ti ɠaku ma. Tɛɛ wosuʋɛ zakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50), kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25). <verse eid="EZK 40:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 40:34"/>Tɛɛ wosuʋɛ ɠaaʋoteni koi wolai ma. Naa ɠakama felegɔi pɛ dɔɔ wului maaniinigi ɠɛni kpɛdɛgiti ma. Nu ɠɔɠɔ losuʋɛ ɠɛni lɔsaʋa, nu lɛɛzuʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 40:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 40:35"/>É liini ga ze nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ ma ziɠida ʋelei. É kɔɠɔgi woni, ti ɠɛni tie nɔ ta zɔiti. <verse eid="EZK 40:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 40:36"/>Ná-pɛlɛ goiti ti ɠɛni ná, ta ná-kpɛdɛgiti, ta ná-tɛɛ wosuʋɛ. Fenɛtɛlɛi ɠɛni ba, é ɠaku ma. Sakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50), kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25). <verse eid="EZK 40:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 40:37"/>Tɛɛ wosuʋɛ ɠaaʋoteni koi wolai ma. Naa ɠakama felegɔi pɛ dɔɔ wului maaniinigi ɠɛni kpɛdɛgiti ma. Nu ɠɔɠɔ losuʋɛ ɠɛni lɔsaʋa, nu lɛɛzuʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 40:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 40:38"/>Pɛlɛi ta laa ɠɛni laosu siɠidaʋɛ ma ɓɛdɛgiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ. Miná ɠa nuiti ti ɠɛni gala zalaɠaiti gbazu ná. <verse eid="EZK 40:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 40:39"/>Tɛɛ wosuʋɛ naa laaʋɛ, taɓali felegɔ ɠɛni ná, taɓali felegɔ ɠɛ zɔɔla ʋelei, naama laɓaliiti ka ti ɠɛni zalaɠa zuaiti paazu ga, gala zalaɠaiti, ta koto gba zalaɠaiti, ta faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠaiti. <verse eid="EZK 40:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 40:40"/>Taɓali naanigɔ ɠɛni tɛɛ wosuʋɛ ʋoluʋelei. Siɛgi zu nu liizu la nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋele ziɠida ʋelei, nu ɠɛni taɓali velefelegiti kaazu, nu ɠakama felegɔiti. <verse eid="EZK 40:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 40:41"/>Taɓali lɔsaʋa ɠa ti ɠɛni zalaɠa zuaiti paazu ga, naanigɔ ɠɛni siɠidaʋɛ zɔɔla ʋelei, naanigɔ ɠɛ zɔɔla ʋelei. <verse eid="EZK 40:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 40:42"/>Taɓali naanigɔ ɠɛni ná ʋolu, ti ga zeki naani kpuɠagi, ti-zakpai ta ti-ɠogi ga zeezakpa ɠila ta tukpɛ, sɔligi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa ɠila. Ti ɓɛtɛni ga kɔtu zaɠaai, ti ɠɛni ná gala zalaɠaiti faa ma. Ti ɠɛni sɔɔlaiti puuzu ti ɠa, niiti ti ɓena gala zalaɠaiti ta zalaɠa ɠiligiti kɔdaaleʋe la. <verse eid="EZK 40:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 40:43"/>Ti zeelo gila pɛɛzu yeɠei ɓɛtɛni, taɓaliiti daaɓegaʋɛti koozu ʋelei ti kaku ma. Zalaɠa zuaiti ti ɠɛni ʋuuzu taɓaliiti ga.<verse eid="EZK 40:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 40:44"/>Zunui liini ga ze koi zaamaʋɛ, kpogi ʋoluʋelei, guye zoɠoiti ta-ʋɛlɛiti ti ɠɛni ná, gila ge ɠɛni nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋele ziɠidaʋɛ, gaaʋotegai nu yeezazu ʋelei, zɔi ɠɛni nu yeezazu ʋele ziɠidaʋɛ, gaaʋotegai nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei. <verse eid="EZK 40:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 40:45"/>Zunui ɠɛni mà: «Niima ʋɛlɛi gaaʋotegai nu yeezazu ʋelei, naa makɛni zalaɠa ɠula nuiti bɛ ti botii ɠɛɛzu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="EZK 40:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 40:46"/>Tama, pɛlɛi niima gaaʋotegai nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, naa makɛni zalaɠa ɠula nuiti bɛ ti ɠaaɓaazu zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma. Naati ka ti ga Sadɔke ná-doun zunuiti, Levi mavofodaiti saama, niiti ti maaɓuɠazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, ti ɗa boti ɠɛ bɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 40:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠazaʋigi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 40:47"/>Zunui koi zaamaʋɛ ɠɔɠɔni, é ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ungila (100), kogi ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ungila (100), é ɠɛ ga seki naanigi. Zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠɛni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 40:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 40:48"/>É liini ga ze tɛɛ wosuʋɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. É siɠidaʋɛ ma ɓɛdɛgiti kɔɠɔni, ti ɠaaɠilini ga zeezakpa lɔɔlugɔ. Ti ɠilagilagiti, nu lɛɛzuʋɛ ɠogi ɠɛni ga zeezakpa puugɔ maazu naanigɔ. Nu lɛɛzuʋɛ ma ziɠigiti gaaɠilini ga zeezakpa zaʋasaʋa. <verse eid="EZK 40:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 40:49"/>Tɛɛ wosuʋɛ zakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ʋuufelegɔ (20), kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). Nu ɠɔɠɔ losuʋɛ ɠɛni ga puugɔ, nu lɛɛzuʋɛ. Kpɛdɛ felegɔ ɠɛni loni nu lɛɛzuʋɛ, zɔi zɔɔla ʋele, zɔi zɔɔla ʋele.<verse eid="EZK 40:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="EZK 41"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 41:1"/>Zunui liini ga ze naazu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ʋɛlɛ wolai wu, é kpɛdɛgiti kɔɠɔni ná, gaaɠilini ga zeezakpa lɔzita, kakamaʋɛ ɠilagilagi pɛ. <verse eid="EZK 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 41:2"/>Nu lɛɛzuʋɛ ɠɛni ga zeezakpa puugɔ, nu lɛɛzuʋɛ ma ziɠigiti gaaɠilini ga zeezakpa lɔɔlugɔ. Pɛlɛwuʋɛ ɓɔɠɔi zakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ʋuunaanigɔ (40), kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa ʋuufelegɔ (20). <verse eid="EZK 41:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 41:3"/>É lɛɛni pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ, é pɛlɛlaʋɛ ma ɓɛdɛgiti kɔɠɔni, ti ɠɛni ga zeezakpa felegɔ, pɛlɛlaʋɛ ɠogi ɠɛni ga zeezakpa lɔzita, nu lɛɛzuʋɛ ɠogi ɠɛni ga zeezakpa lɔfela. <verse eid="EZK 41:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 41:4"/>É pɛlɛwuʋɛ ɓɔɠɔi ɠɔɠɔni, sakpai ɠɛ ga zeezakpa ʋuufelegɔ, kogi zeezakpa ʋuufelegɔ. É ɠɛni mà, ʋɛ ɠa ná ga: «Ada ɲadega wolai.»<verse eid="EZK 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 41:5"/>Zunui GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ziɠigi ɠaaʋɛ ɠɔɠɔni, gaaɠilini ga zeezakpa lɔzita. Ti pɛlɛ goiti toni gaaʋɛ, é ɠaku ma, ti ga zeezakpa naanigɔ ti ɠilagilagi. <verse eid="EZK 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 41:6"/>Sangaso saʋagɔ ɠɛni ná, ti ɠilagilagi su ga puuzaʋasaʋa (30), ti ʋoluzeiɗai siɠigi ʋa, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi maaɠoolii zu, nii a kɛ ti mina zei GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ziɠigi ɓɔɠɔi ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 41:7"/>Nu lɛɛ laa ɠilagila è zeɠe zɔɔma zangasoi zu, è lati è lɛ zɔi zu, pɛlɛ goiti ti gaawɔɔlɔni ga maazu ʋelei, é ɠaku GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma. Pelei zuwɔɔlɔni ga maazu ʋelei. Nu ɠɛni lɛɛzu sangasoi ɠa, è zeɠe buu ʋelei, è leʋe zaamazuʋɛ, è lɛ maazuʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 41:8"/>Gè pɛtɛni ɓalaa ga GALA sei ʋɛlɛi maaɠoolii zu, dooɠo bosuʋɛ wuzeɠeni ná pɛlɛ goiti buuʋɛ niiti ti-zakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa lɔzita lɔzita. <verse eid="EZK 41:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 41:9"/>Pɛlɛ goiti poluʋɛ siɠigi ɠa, miná ɠaaɠilini ga zeezakpa lɔɔlugɔ. Pelei é yɛni suɠalagai é lo GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ʋa, <verse eid="EZK 41:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 41:10"/>ti yɔɠɔzu ta zɔɔma ʋɛlɛiti é ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ʋuufelegɔ (20), é ɠaku GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma. <verse eid="EZK 41:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 41:11"/>Pɛlɛ goiti daaʋɛ ɠɛni ga felefele, ti zɔɠɔ nu ziɛzuʋɛ ma, gilagi ɠɛni nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, gilagi ɠɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ. Nu ziɛzuʋɛ ɠɛni ga zeezakpa lɔɔlugɔ, é ɠaku ma ná pɛ. <verse eid="EZK 41:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 41:12"/>Pɛlɛi ta ɠɛni loni folo liizu ʋelei, gaaʋotegai koizuʋɛ ma, sakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ʋuutaaʋuugɔ (90), kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa ʋuulɔfela (70). Pɛlɛi ɓɔɠɔi ɠaaɠilini ga zeezakpa lɔɔlugɔ.<verse eid="EZK 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 41:13"/>Zunui GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠɔɠɔni, é ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ungila (100). Koi, ta pɛlɛi, ta siɠigiti, ti zakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ungila (100). <verse eid="EZK 41:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 41:14"/>Pɛlɛi ɠaaʋotesu ʋelei, ta koizuʋɛ é lo folo ɠulazu ʋelei ʋa, miná ɠogi ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ungila (100). <verse eid="EZK 41:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 41:15"/>Zunui pɛlɛi zakpai ɠɔɠɔni, koizuʋɛ ɠobaʋɛ é ʋoluzuʋɛ, ta nu ziɛzuʋɛti ti naa yɔɠɔzuʋɛti, é ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ungila (100).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 41:15">Pɛlɛ wolai é koozuʋɛ, ta tɛɛ wosuʋɛti, <verse eid="EZK 41:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 41:16"/>ta pɛlɛlaʋɛti, ta fenɛtɛlɛiti ti ga giliyazegiti, ta dooɠo bosuʋɛti é ɠaku ma, sangaso saʋagɔi pɛ su, gului ʋɛɛni ti pɛ maaʋɛ, é zo zooi ma, é lɛ, é zei fenɛtɛlɛiti ba. Gulu zɛʋɛi ɠɛni laani fenɛtɛlɛiti maaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 41:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 41:17"/>GALA sei ʋɛlɛi maaʋɛ, ta koozuʋɛ, é zo kpogi ma nu lɛɛzuʋɛ, é zeeli pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ, <verse eid="EZK 41:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 41:18"/>ti ná pɛ maaʋɛlupɛluni ga dɔɔ wuluiti ta seeluɓɛinti maaniinigiti, ti zɔɠɔzu ɠɛ ti ʋa. Seeluɓɛn ɠilagilagi ɠaazuʋɛ ɠɛni ba fele, <verse eid="EZK 41:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 41:19"/>nuɓusɛ ɠaazuʋɛ, naa ɠaaʋoteni dɔɔ wului ma, zala ɠaazuʋɛ, naa ɠaaʋoteni zɔɔla ʋelei zɔɔma lɔɔ wului ma. Zenɔ ɠana é ɠɛɛni la, é ɠaku GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma. <verse eid="EZK 41:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 41:20"/>É zo zooi ma, é lɛ kpogi maazuʋɛ, seeluɓɛinti ta dɔɔ wuluiti maaniinigiti ka ti ɠɛni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi maaʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 41:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 41:21"/>GALA sei ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛti ma laamasagiti ti ɠɛni ga seki naanigiti. Ada ɲadegai ɠakalaʋɛ, nu ɠɛni anii ta ɠaazu ná, kulaai ga <verse eid="EZK 41:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 41:22"/>zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ é ga gului, gaaɠoozaai ga zeezakpa saʋagɔ, kogi ga zeezakpa felegɔ. Goizuʋɛti ta kɔɠɔi ta koozuʋɛti, ti ɠɛni ga gului. Zunui ɠɛni ma: «Taɓalii ɠa é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakalaʋɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 41:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 41:23"/>Pɛlɛ wolai ta ada ɲadega wolai, kpo felefelegi ɠa é ɠɛni naati da. <verse eid="EZK 41:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 41:24"/>Pɛlɛlaʋɛ naati pɛ, kpogi ɠɛni ti la ga felegɔ, ti ɗa ziɛ su. <verse eid="EZK 41:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 41:25"/>Ti seeluɓɛinti ta dɔɔ wuluiti maaniinigi zaɠani ga yeei GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɓogiti ma, eɠɛʋelei nɔ ti kɛɛni la pɛlɛi ɠoozuʋɛ. Poluʋelei, kavagi ɠɛni ná ga gului, gaaʋotegai tɛɛ wosuʋɛ ma. <verse eid="EZK 41:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 41:26"/>Giliyaze venɛtɛlɛiti kakamaʋɛti, ta tɛɛ wosuʋɛ, dɔɔ wului maaniinigi ɠɛni ti ma ná pɛ, ta pɛlɛ wolai ma, ta kavagiti maaʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 41:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="EZK 42"/>
  <para style="s">Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta-ʋɛlɛiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 42:1"/>Zunui liini ga ze koi wolai ʋɔ pelei, pɛlɛ goi naati pɔ bɛ niiti ti nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, ti ɠaaʋotegai koi wolai ma ta pɛlɛi ma é GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ʋoluʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 42:2"/>Naama ʋɛlɛ logai é nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, sakpai ɠa ga zeezakpa ungila, kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa ʋuulɔɔlugɔ. <verse eid="EZK 42:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 42:3"/>Gaaʋoteni nu ziɛzuʋɛ ma, ga zeezakpa ʋuufelegɔ, é ɠaku GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma, zɔɔla ʋelei, é zeini koi wolai ʋa naa ziaai. Pɛlɛ goiti ti ɠɛni ná, ti loni ɓɔɠɔ maazu ga sangaso saʋagɔ. <verse eid="EZK 42:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 42:4"/>Pɛlɛ goiti kakalaʋɛ, koi zaamaʋɛ ʋelei, nu ziɛzuʋɛ yɛni ná, kogi ga zeezakpa puugɔ, sakpai ga zeezakpa ungila (100). Nu ɠɛni lɛɛzu bu ga nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei. <verse eid="EZK 42:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 42:5"/>Sangasoi ma zeiga zaʋasiɛi ma ʋɛlɛiti buu la ɠɛni ɓaaɠoni ga buu ʋele gele felegɔiti kɛʋele. Tɔɔzei ti yɔɠɔzu ʋeleiti ti zuwɔɔlɔni, é leʋe buu ʋele gele felegɔiti tɔnɔiti ba. <verse eid="EZK 42:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 42:6"/>Sangasoi ɠɛni ga saʋa, kɛlɛ kpɛdɛ ge la ɠɛni ti wu, eɠɛʋelei koizuʋɛ ma ɓɛdɛgiti ti ɠɛni la. Naa maaʋele ma, é zo zooi ma, é lɛ, maazuʋɛ ʋɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛti ti lɔini, ti leʋe buuʋɛ gelei ʋa ta zaamazu gelei. <verse eid="EZK 42:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 42:7"/>Ʋoluzu ʋele ziɠigi gaaʋotegai koi wolai ma, pɛlɛiti poluzeiɗai ba, sakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ʋuulɔɔlugɔ. <verse eid="EZK 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 42:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ʋɛ pɛlɛiti ti loni ná, ti ɠaaʋotegai koi wolai ma, miná zɔligɔi pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ʋuulɔɔlugɔ, tama, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ʋɔ pelei, ʋɛ pɛlɛiti ti loni ná, miná zɔligɔi pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ungila. <verse eid="EZK 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 42:9"/>Pɛlɛi naati buuʋɛ, folo ɠulazu ʋelei, nu lɛɛzuʋɛ ɠɛni ná, nii ɗa zeɠezu ga koi wolai ʋɔ pelei. <verse eid="EZK 42:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 42:10"/>Nu lɛɛzuʋɛ ɠɛni koii ma ziɠigi ɠogi ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 42:10">Nu yeezazu ʋelei, pɛlɛiti ti ɠɛni miná, ti ɠaaʋotegai koizuʋɛ ma ta pɛlɛi ma, é GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ʋoluʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 42:11"/>Nu ziɛzuʋɛ ɠɛni ti ɠakalaʋɛ. Eɠɛʋelei nɔ zɔɔma ʋɛlɛiti ti la nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, ti pɛ ti-ɠazaʋi pelei ɓɔni, ti-zakpaiti ta ti-ɠogiti, ta ti lo pelei, ta nu lɛɛzuʋɛti ta nu ɠulazuʋɛti. <verse eid="EZK 42:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 42:12"/>Zenɔ ɠana nu yeezazuʋɛ ma ʋɛlɛiti ma ɓogiti ti ɠɛni la. Daaʋɛ ɠɛni nu lɛɛzuʋɛ, gaaʋote kpaamaazu ziɠigi ma. Nu ɠɛni lɛɛzu ná ga folo ɠulazu ʋelei.<verse eid="EZK 42:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 42:13"/>Zunui ɠɛni mà: «Pɛlɛ goiti ti nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ ta nu yeezazuʋɛ, ti ɠaaʋotegai koizuʋɛ ma, ta ga pɛlɛ ɲadegaiti. Mazɔlɔɔ miná ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta ɗa lɛ ná, ti ɗa ani ɲadegaiti mi ná. Ná ɠa maanɛai ti ani ɲadega wolaiti pu ná: vebɛ zalaɠaiti, ta koto gba zalaɠai, ta faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai, mazɔlɔɔ adaʋɛ tɛi ɲadegɛ. <verse eid="EZK 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 42:14"/>Siɛgi zu zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti lɛɛzu la ada ɲadegai, ti la zooga ti ʋa ɠula koi wolai zu, kɛni ti seɠei naati pu pɛlɛi wu, niiti ti botii ɠɛɛzu ga tiye Maliɠii ʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ seɠei naati ɲadegɛ. Ta taɠiligaa loo ɠɔba, aisa ti ʋa ɠula, ti ʋa li ʋɛ nuɓusɛiti ti ʋuuni ná.»<verse eid="EZK 42:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Siɠigi é koii ma naa ɠɔɠɔ fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 42:15"/>Zunui ɓegai ma ga GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ ma ʋɛlɛiti kɔɠɔ, é ɠulani ga ze folo ɠulazu ʋelei ma ziɠidaʋɛ, é poluʋɛ pɛ kɔɠɔni é ɠaku ma. <verse eid="EZK 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 42:16"/>É kɔɠɔgi woni ga kɔɠɔ bo seeli kpakui é ɠɛni zea, é kaani ga folo ɠulazu ʋelei zakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa undɔɔlugɔ (500). <verse eid="EZK 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 42:17"/>É nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei ɠɔɠɔni ga kɔɠɔ bo kpakui, é ɠɛ ga zeezakpa undɔɔlugɔ (500). <verse eid="EZK 42:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 42:18"/>É nu yeezazu ʋelei ɠɔɠɔni ga kɔɠɔ bo kpakui, é ɠɛ ga zeezakpa undɔɔlugɔ (500). <verse eid="EZK 42:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 42:19"/>É folo liizu ʋelei ɠɔɠɔni ga kɔɠɔ bo kpakui, é ɠɛ ga zeezakpa undɔɔlugɔ (500). <verse eid="EZK 42:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 42:20"/>É siɠigi ɠakama naanigɔiti pɛ kɔɠɔni, nii é ɠakuni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma, siɠigi ɠɛni ga seki naanigi, sakpai ɠɛ ga zeezakpa undɔɔlugɔ (500), kogi zeezakpa undɔɔlugɔ (500). Naa ɠa é ada ɲadegai ti zeeɠaaɠwɛɛni ta ʋɛ ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛni ʋuuzu ná.<verse eid="EZK 42:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="EZK 43"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠalema vai ʋolu <optbreak/> sei ʋɛlɛi wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 43:1"/>Zunui liini ga ze folo ɠulazu ʋele ziɠidaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 43:2"/>Wɛlɛ, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai ɠɛni volozu, é ɗa ʋa, é zeɠe folo ɠulazu ʋelei. Maalugi ɠɛni eɠɛ ziɛ wolaa ta ɠɛ zulusu, é eteai zu ɠɛni kala ga ná-lɛbiyai ma zezei. <verse eid="EZK 43:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 43:3"/>Kulakɛlɛmai nii ɠulani ga zɔiti niiti gè ti ɠaani ta siɛgiti su GALA ge ʋaani la Zeluzalɛme ɠoloɠolosu, nà la ɠɛna ziɛ wolai Keɓaal laaʋɛ. Gè looni, gè laaʋɛɛ zooi ma. <verse eid="EZK 43:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 43:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai ɠɛni volozu, é ɗa lɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu ga folo ɠulazu ʋele ziɠida ʋelei. <verse eid="EZK 43:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 43:5"/>GALA Zɛnvui bùzeɠeni zooi ma, é li ga ze koi zaamaʋɛ. Wɛlɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai é volozu, naa GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wuulaaveni.<verse eid="EZK 43:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 43:6"/>Gè nui ta woomɛnini, é ɗa ɓɔɛ pɔ̀, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu munu, tama zunui é loni tùɠɔ, naa ɠɛni nɔ kòbaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 43:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ʋɛ ɠa ná ga nà-masa kpɔkpɔgi ʋilɛsuʋɛ, ná ɠa nà ɠɔɠɔaʋɛ ʋɛɛ ná mɛɛ. Nà zei ná Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti saama eyɛsu ɠɔ. Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti, ɓaa ta-masagiti, ti la mɔ ɓaaɠulaa dàasei ɲadegai ma ga ta-ɠoloɠologi, ɓaa ta-masagiti ma ʋoomaiti ti laani ta-zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti. <verse eid="EZK 43:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 43:8"/>Ti ta-masa pɛlɛiti ta ma ʋɛlɛla laamasagiti toni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠobaʋɛ, kɛni siɠi koi nɔ ɠa é nà-pɛlɛi ta tɔnɔiti zɔɠɔzu. Ti ɓaaɠulani dàasei ɲadegai ma ga kɔzɔba vaiti ti ti ɠɛɛni. Naa ɠa é kɛɛni, nà-ziiɠaawanai zu, gè ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋeni. <verse eid="EZK 43:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 43:9"/>Niizu ta ta-ɠoloɠolo faiti maaɠooza bà niina, ta ta-masagiti ma ʋoomaiti, nà yɛ zeini ti zaama eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="EZK 43:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 43:10"/>«Ɗa ʋe, zunui, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠɛʋelei pɛ dɛɛ ga Izilayɛle nuiti. Ti unfe ga ta-ɠotoiti, ti pɛlɛi lo pelei ma ɠazaʋigi vɛɠɛlɛfɛɠɛlɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 43:11"/>Ni gaamazu ta unfena ga kɛɛwotii kpein ti kɛɛni, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo pelei ma ɠazaʋigi lɛ ga tiye, pɛlɛiti gaaɠwɛɛ ʋelei, nu lɛɛzuʋɛti, ta nu ɠulazuʋɛti, ma ɠazaʋigiti pɛ ʋɔɔma. Ti pɛ dɛɛ ga sɛʋɛi, è tɔgiti da ti ɠaazu, ta deveiti maanɛai ti ɗa ziɛ ga tiye, naa ɠa a kɛ ti ʋilɛ ti ʋolu, ti ziɛ ga tiye. <verse eid="EZK 43:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 43:12"/>GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma lɔ golai ɠana, ʋɛ kpein ná ɠakugai GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma gize unmaʋɛ, à mináti deve ga ada ɲadega wolai. Ungo, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma lɔgi ɠana.»<verse eid="EZK 43:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ta zalaɠaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 43:13"/>«Wɛlɛ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma ɠɔɠɔgi ɠa é ɠɛni ga nii, feai é zoloo zeezakpa wolai ma, naa ʋoluʋɛ ɠa ga zeezakpa ɠilagilagi ta logɛ da ga zeelo gilagila. Zeɠei é wɔɔni é ɠaku ma, suzɔligɔi ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ɠila, kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa ɠila. Daaɓegi é ɠakuni ma, naa ɠaazɔligɔi ɠɛni ga zeelo gila ta tukpɛ ko. Niima é ɠɛni ga zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠaazɔligɔi, <verse eid="EZK 43:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 43:14"/>é zo zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠɔɠɔi ma, nii dɔai zooi wu, é zeeli kɔɠɔ goi ma, naa ɠɛɛni ga zeezakpa felegɔ, naati zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ɠogi ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ɠila, é zo niina ma ɠɔɠɔ goi ma, é zeeli ma ɠɔɠɔ wolai ma, naa ɠaazɔligɔi ɠɛni ga zeezakpa naanigɔ. Naa ʋoluma daaɓegi ma niinɛ ɠili ge loni ba ga zeezakpa ɠila. <verse eid="EZK 43:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 43:15"/>Zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ maazuʋɛ ná ɠɛni ga abu laazuʋɛ, gaaɠoozani é ɠɛ ga zeezakpa naanigɔ, minɛ naanigɔiti ti ɠɛni loni ba maazuʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 43:16"/>Abu laazuʋɛ zakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12), kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12), é ɠɛni ga seki naanigi, naa pɛ ge ɠɛ tie. <verse eid="EZK 43:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 43:17"/>Ma ɠɔɠɔi zakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa puugɔ maazu naanigɔ (14), kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa puugɔ maazu naanigɔ (14). Daaɓegi ɠɛni ba, é ɠaku ma, maazuʋɛ ga zeezakpa lukpɛ, zeɠei é ɠakuni ma, é ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ɠila, nu ɠɔɠɔ ʋilɛsuʋɛti è ʋa lɛ ga, miná ɠaaʋoteni folo ɠulazu ʋelei ma.»<verse eid="EZK 43:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 43:18"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Faiti ti zɛʋɛai é lo zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ʋa, yeei é ʋaazu losu da, gala zalaɠaiti ti ʋa ɗa ɠula ná, ɲama ʋili fai ɗa ɠɛ ná, ta ga niiti: <verse eid="EZK 43:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 43:19"/>Ɗa nikɛ zinɛi ve zalaɠa ɠula nuiti zea, Levi nuiti ti ga Sadɔke mavofodai, ti maaɓuɠazu bà, ti ɗa botii ɠɛ bɛ̀, naa ɠa ti kulazu ga koto gba zalaɠai,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 43:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 43:20"/>« ‹Ɗa ma ɲamai zeɠezu è ta ziɛ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma minɛ naanigɔiti ma, ta ma labui velesiɛi zoko naanigɔiti ma, ta daaɓegi ma kakugai ma. Pele ɠana ɗa kotoi gba la zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ʋa, è kàlivaa. <verse eid="EZK 43:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 43:21"/>Ɗa nikɛ zinɛi naa zeɠezu, kulaai ga koto gba zalaɠai, ti gala eteaʋɛ, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, naa makɛgai naa laama. <verse eid="EZK 43:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 43:22"/>Poluma zobui, ɗa boli zinɛi zeɠe, nɛɛʋuzu la ba, è kula ga koto gba zalaɠai, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɲade da, eɠɛʋelei nɔ é ɠɛɛni la ga nikɛ zinɛi. <verse eid="EZK 43:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 43:23"/>Siɛgi zu ɗa ɓena da ga koto gba zalaɠai ɠula, ɗa nikɛ zinɛi zeɠe ta baala sinɛ wolai, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa, ti zogai togani goiti saama. <verse eid="EZK 43:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 43:24"/>Ɗa ʋa, è ti lɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta kpoloi vaza ti ma, ti ti ɠula ga gala zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 43:25"/>Eyɛsu folo lɔfela, folo-o-folo ɗa ɗa boli zinɛ ɠila kula ga koto gba zalaɠai, è ɗa kɛ ɠana nɔ ga nikɛ zinɛi ta baala sinɛ wolai, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa, ti zogai togani goiti saama. <verse eid="EZK 43:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 43:26"/>Folo lɔfela, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ná-koto gba vai ɗa ɠɛ, é ɲade, é ve GALA bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 43:27"/>Folo lɔfelai a ɓena, é lɔɔzei folo lɔsaʋasiɛi ma niina, zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta zoo niina ti wa-ɠala zalaɠaiti kula zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, ta wa-yiilɛi zalaɠaiti, nà yeezei wo wu naazu,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 43:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="EZK 44"/>
  <para style="s">Kundiɠii ná-siɠidaʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 44:1"/>Zunui liini ga ze GALA seizu ɲadegai ma ziɠidaʋɛ ʋoluʋelei, nii é folo ɠulazu ʋelei. Daaɠuluni. <verse eid="EZK 44:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 44:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni mà: «Siɠidaʋɛ tɛi daaɠulugai ɠa yɛsu de, nu la daalaoga pɛ. Nu la leʋega ná ʋele, mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI lɛɛni ná ʋelei. Daaɠulugai ɠa yɛsu de. <verse eid="EZK 44:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 44:3"/>Kɛlɛ kundiɠii, ná-kundiɠi vai ma, toɠa zei ná, é ná-daamii wo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. Toɠa zoo é lɛ, é ɠula ga tɛɛ wosuʋɛ tetegai siɠidaʋɛ ma.»<verse eid="EZK 44:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓɛ ɠa a lɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 44:4"/>Zunui liini ga ze naa ʋoluma siɠidaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠakalaʋɛ. Gè pɛtɛni ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai é volozu, naa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wuulaaveni. Gè looni zooi ma, gè laaʋɛɛ. <verse eid="EZK 44:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 44:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, ɠaazuzeɠe ma ga pagɔ, è woilo! Mɛni ga woiyeɠei, nii kpein é ga tɔgiti ta deveiti gè ti veezu é lo sèizu ɲadegai ʋa. Ɗa dama gola ga faiti ti ʋilɛsu nu lɛɛ vai ʋa, ta nu ɠula vai ʋa, sèizu ɲadegai ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 44:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 44:6"/>Ɗa ɓɔɛ kololala nuiti pɔ, Izilayɛle nuiti: ‹Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti, wa-ɠɔzɔba vaiti ti kula ɠɛa ga ze, niiti wo ti ɠɛɛni. <verse eid="EZK 44:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 44:7"/>Siɛgi nɔ zu wo ɠɛni nɔ̀nɔ ma laamianigi veezu la bɛ̀, ga zalaɠa zuai ma wulɔiti ta ma ɲamaiti, wo wɛɛinti dɔɔni sèizu ɲadegai, ti la latini pɛlɛʋolu, ti la ɠoloni bɛ̀. Wo sèi ʋɛlɛi ɠɔzɔni ga naa. Minazeɠegi nii é wo ɠilini nɔ̀un ba, wo naa ɠoloɠoloni ga wa-ɠɔzɔba ɠɛɛwotiiti kpein. <verse eid="EZK 44:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 44:8"/>Wo la ɠaaɓaani botii ma, é lo zèaɠɔli ɲadegaiti ba, kɛlɛ wɛɛinti ka wo ti loni ʋotogi zu, ga ti kɛ. <verse eid="EZK 44:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 44:9"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Wɛɛn nɔpɛ é la latini pɛlɛʋolu, ta é la ɠoloni bɛ̀, é la lɛa sèizu ɲadegai, anɛɛ ni toɠa zeini Izilayɛle nuiti saama.› »<verse eid="EZK 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Devei é lo Levi nuiti ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 44:10"/>« ‹Nii é ga Levi nuiti tɔnɔi, tɛiti ti ɠɛlɛni bà, ti ʋoluave bà, siɛgi zu Izilayɛle ɠakani da, ti zeɠe polu, ti ʋilɛ ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti polu, ta ta-vaaɠaazagi naa zu nimizai zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 44:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 44:11"/>Ta zoo ti botii ɠɛ bɛ̀ ga sèizu ɲadegai ma ziɠidaʋɛti makɛ vai, ti botii taɠiligaani kɛ sèizu ɲadegai wu. Ta zoo ti suaiti paa, niiti ti ɠulazu ga gala zalaɠaiti ta zɔɔma zalaɠaiti, ta ɠɛ nuɓusɛiti zeema. <verse eid="EZK 44:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 44:12"/>Kɛlɛ tɔɔzei tiya ɠa ti loni Izilayɛle nuiti untuɠɔ kɔɔɠɔ gani nɔɠɔiti kɔɔzuʋɛ, ti ti loo kotoi zu, wɛlɛ gè minazeɠea ti ʋɛ ga nà wuzeɠe ti laalɔɠɔma, ta ta-vaaɠaazagi zu nimizai zɔlɔɔ,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 44:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 44:13"/>« ‹Ti maa la nɛɛni ti ʋa maaɓuɠa bà, ti ʋa nà-zalaɠa ɠula wotii ɠɛ, ti maa la nɛɛni ti ʋa maaɓuɠa ani ɲadegaiti tanɔpɛ ba, nii feai bɛ̀, ɓaa nà-zalaɠa ɠulazu ɲadega wolai ʋa. Pele ɠana ta ta-unfetala vaiti ta ta-ɠɔzɔba vaiti su nimizai zɔlɔɔ da. <verse eid="EZK 44:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 44:14"/>Nà GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma wotii ɠɛ ga ti-unma ɠasɔi, miná ɠa ta botii kpein kɛ ná, nii maanɛai ga é ɠɛ.› »<verse eid="EZK 44:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ma lɔgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 44:15"/>« ‹Kɛlɛ zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, Levi nuiti ti ga Sadɔke mavofodaiti, niiti ti ɠaaɓaani sèizu ɲadegai ma, siɛgi zu Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠɛni ɠakasu la, ti maaɠooza bà, tiya ɠila nɔ ɠa ta yɛ maaɓuɠazu bà, ti ɗa botii ɠɛ bɛ̀, ti ɗa zalaɠa zuai ma wulɔiti kula bɛ̀ ta ma ɲamaiti,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 44:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 44:16"/>« ‹Tiya ɠila nɔ ɠa ta ɠɛ lɛɛzu sèizu ɲadegai, ti maaɓuɠa nà-taɓalii ʋa, nii a kɛ ti naa ɠɛ nii gè deveai é lo dɛ̀bi vai ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 44:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 44:17"/>Ta ɠɛna koi zaamaʋɛ ma ziɠidaʋɛti ma ɓogiti maazuɓudɛa, kɛni ti geze zeɠeiti too ɠɔba. Ti la baala deɠa zeɠe loa ɠɔba, siɛgi zu ti botii ɠɛɛzu la koi zaamaʋɛ, ta GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="EZK 44:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 44:18"/>Geze zeɠei ɠa a ɠɛ ti unba ga bɔɔlɔgi, ta geze zeɠei ɠɛ ti ma ga ʋɛlɛ kpuɠagi. Ti mina maaɠili zɔɔla zeɠe a fɔdɔi ɠula ti ma. <verse eid="EZK 44:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 44:19"/>Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu ti ɠulazu la koi wolai zu nuɓusɛiti pɔ bɛ, ta ta-wotiɠɛ zeɠeiti kula ɠɔba, ti ti ʋu zalaɠa ɠulazu ɲadegai ma ʋɛlɛiti bu, ti seɠe ɠiligaa loo ɠɔba, nii a kɛ ti mina nuɓusɛiti ɲade ga ta-zalaɠa ɠula zeɠeiti. <verse eid="EZK 44:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 44:20"/>Ti la tɔungi ɓuyega, kɛlɛ ta ɗa tɔungi wo, ti mina ɓe ba é ʋa ɠooza.<verse eid="EZK 44:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 44:21"/>« ‹Zalaɠa ɠula nu ɠila kpalaa mina dɔɔ ɓɔle, siɛgi zu é lɛɛzu la koi ɠoozu ziɠigi zu. <verse eid="EZK 44:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 44:22"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nu nɔpɛ ge la poanza zeiɗa, ɓaa anzanui nii ti pilɛgai, kɛlɛ maanɛɛʋɛ ga é Izilayɛle anzalopoi ta zei, ɓaa zalaɠa ɠula nui taɠili ná-poanzai. <verse eid="EZK 44:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 44:23"/>Ta nà-nuɓusɛiti kala ga ti zeeɠaaɠwɛɛzu ɠwɛɛ ani ɲadegai ta ɲadetala gelei ʋa, naa ʋɛɛ nii ʋa kɔzɔai ta nii é la ɠɔzɔni. <verse eid="EZK 44:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 44:24"/>Ni kpɔɛ a leʋena, tiya ɠa ta ma lukpɔi ɠaaleʋe, ta tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe ga sɔlega, é zoloo nà-tɔgiti ma. Ta nà-fɛti voloiti so, eɠɛʋelei gè deveiti feeni la ta tɔgiti, ti dooɠo foloiti maaɲɛ.<verse eid="EZK 44:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 44:25"/>« ‹Zalaɠa ɠula nui mina maaɓuɠa pooma ʋa, é ʋa vɔɔɠu ba, a ʋa ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ, kɛni ni kɛɛɠɛ ʋe, ɓaa dee, ɓaa ná-doun zunui ta, ɓaa ná-doun anzanui ta, ɓaa kɛɛɠɛloin ta, ɓaa ná-seelai ta zɔi é la dɛ zeini zini bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 44:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 44:26"/>Naama su, kɛni é ɓɔɠɔ ɲadega ʋoluma, é folo lɔfela maaɓɔun, é ʋa leɠa ná-botii lɔɔzei. <verse eid="EZK 44:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 44:27"/>Voloi a liina la koi zaamaʋɛ, ada ɲadegai, toɠa ná-koto gba zalaɠai ɠula,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 44:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 44:28"/>« ‹Ta poganii zɔlɔɔ, naama ʋoganii ɠa é ga ze nà ɓɔɠɔi. À mina pogani nɔpɛ fe ti ya Izilayɛle yooi zu, mazɔlɔɔ nà ɓɔɠɔi nà ɠɛ ga ta-ʋoganii. <verse eid="EZK 44:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 44:29"/>Ti-ɠɔnɔgi ɠa ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠaiti, ta koto gba zalaɠa zuaiti, ta faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠa zuaiti, ta nii nɔpɛ a makɛna nɔ̀un bɛ Izilayɛle nuiti zea, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga tɔnɔ. <verse eid="EZK 44:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 44:30"/>Zooi ʋaalɔnɔ mɔungiti kpein ma ʋagɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti tɔnɔ, tazeɠebaiti pɛ, taɠulaba la ba, naati pɛ ta ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti tɔnɔ. Nuiti ta ɓulu vukɔi ma ʋagɔiti fe ti ya, naa ɠa a kɛ gè tuya loo ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 44:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 44:31"/>Kɛlɛ zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti mina sua nɔpɛ mi, zɔi saai ɓɔɠɔ yeema, ɓaa baliʋaliai ga, é ɠɛni ga wɔnii ɓaa suai.› »<verse eid="EZK 44:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="EZK 45"/>
  <para style="s">Ʋɛti ti makɛgai zooi ma vaa ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 45:1"/>« ‹Siɛgi zu wo zooi ɠaaɠwɛɛzu la Izilayɛle wolodaiti zɔɠɔzu, wa ta zeɠe ba, é ɠɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔ, sakpai ɠa ɠɛ ga zeezakpa waaʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25.000), kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa waaʋuufelegɔ (20.000). Toɠa leve ga náʋɛ pɛ ɲadegɛ. <verse eid="EZK 45:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 45:2"/>Naama yooi zaamaʋɛ ɠa, GALA seizu ɲadegai ma yooi a leʋe ba ná, é ɠɛ ga seki naanigi, ma zeki naanigɔi ɠilagilagi zɔligɔi ɠɛni ga zeezakpa undɔɔlugɔ (500), ada ɲakai ɓalaa yɛ maaɠoolii zu ga zeezakpa ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50). <verse eid="EZK 45:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 45:3"/>Zooi ʋɔ bɛ ná veezu ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALA nɔnɔi, wa zooi ná ta ɠɔɠɔ ba ga zeezakpa waaʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25.000), kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa waapuugɔ (10.000), miná ɠa GALA seizu ɲadegai a ɠɛ ná, ta ada ɲadega wolai. <verse eid="EZK 45:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 45:4"/>Miná ɠa ná ɲadesu zooi ma vaa ʋa, ná makɛsu yɛ zalaɠa ɠula nuiti bɛ, niiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-botii ɠɛɛzu GALA seizu ɲadegai. Ta zooi zɔlɔɔ miná, ti ta-ʋɛlɛiti to, zɔɠɔzu ɠɛ ti ʋa ta seizu ɲadegai. <verse eid="EZK 45:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 45:5"/>Ná taɠili ka leʋe ba ga zeezakpa waaʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25.000), ta kogi ɠɛni ga zeezakpa waapuugɔ (10.000), é ve Levi nuiti zea, niiti ti GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu wotii ɠɛɛzu ga pagɔ. Ta taaiti to miná, ʋɛ ta zei ná.<verse eid="EZK 45:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 45:6"/>« ‹Ʋɛ ná makɛgai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, naama yooi zakpai ma, kobaʋɛ, wa zeezakpa waaʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25.000) leʋezu ba, kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa waadɔɔlugɔ (5.000), miná ɠa wo taai ʋuuzu ná, toɠa ɠɛ ga Izilayɛle ʋɛbɛi kpein nɔnɔ. <verse eid="EZK 45:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 45:7"/>Wa zou felegɔ makɛ kundiɠii ʋɛ, ta ɠa ɠɛ ʋepemaʋɛ ɠilagilagiti pɛ zooi ʋa nii makɛgai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALA ʋɛ, ta taai ʋɛ, gilagi ɠɛ folo liizu ʋelei, gilagi ɠɛ folo ɠulazu ʋelei, ti zakpai ɠa ɠɛɛzu ga bolodamaiti tɔnɔiti kɛʋele, é zo folo liizu ʋelei ma ɠwɛmaʋɛ, é li folo ɠulazu ʋelei ma ɠwɛmaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 45:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 45:8"/>Ná ɠa é ɠɛɛzu ga nɔnɔi ma yooi, Izilayɛle yooi zu. Naazu nà-kundiɠiiti ti la mɔ nà-nuɓusɛiti suziɠaa, ta zooi yɛ Izilayɛle nuiti zea, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la.› »<verse eid="EZK 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kundiɠii losuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 45:9"/>«Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Faa kula ɠɛa, Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti! À pele leʋe toomai ta toosu vaiti tuɠɔ. À sɔledai ziɛ, ta telebodai. À ɓe nà-nuɓusɛiti kpɛɛzu ta-yooiti maazu,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 45:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 45:10"/>« ‹Kɔɠɔ ganiiti ti ɠɛ wo ya, niiti ti zoloogai su, kiloiti ti laazeeliai, ta kɔɠɔ ganii mɔtai kpein ti laazeeli. <verse eid="EZK 45:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 45:11"/>Ani ɠae ɠɔɠɔ ganii daa ga efa, ta ziɛ aniiti kɔɠɔ ganii daa ga bate, ti felegɔ ta ɠɛ ɠɛɠala. Ti ɠilagilagi ɠa ga kɔɠɔ gani wolai daa ga womɛlegi, naa ma ɠaaɠwɛsui ʋuusiɛi. <verse eid="EZK 45:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 45:12"/>Sikilegi ma wali ɠae ɠilagi ɠa ɠɛ ga gelagi puufelegɔ (20), tama kɛni naama wali ɠaeiti ti ɠɛ ga puulɔzita (60), é ʋa ɠɛ ga mine gilagi.<verse eid="EZK 45:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 45:13"/>« ‹Ʋele ɠa wa ɠɛ wa-vebɛaniiti kulazu ba la, efagi zeizu lɔzitasiɛi ɠa wa kula womɛle gilagi ʋa moloi zu, ta efagi lɔzitasiɛi ɠa wa kula womɛle gilagi ʋa wɔɔlezegi zu. <verse eid="EZK 45:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 45:14"/>Nii pilɛgai gulɔi ʋa: wo-zɔlɔɔ gani ma ɠaaɠwɛsui ungilasiɛi. Gulɔi ɠa ɠɔɠɔ bategi zu, nii suʋɛ ga womɛlegi ɓaa kɔɔlegi ma ɠaaɠwɛsui ʋuusiɛi. <verse eid="EZK 45:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 45:15"/>Baalagi ɓaa boli ɓulugi a ɠɛna ga unfelegɔ (200) Izilayɛle lufa lɛnugiti su, wa gila seɠe ti zaama. Naa ɠa é ɠɛɛzu ga vebɛ zalaɠai, ɓaa gala zalaɠai, ɓaa ziilɛi zalaɠai, nii a kɛ é ɠɛ ga wa-ɠotoiti gba zalaɠai,› » Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="EZK 45:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 45:16"/>« ‹Naama yeemaaɓɔgi maa ɠa loli nuiti pɛ ma ti zooi zu, ti ʋaa la Izilayɛle ɠundiɠii ʋɔ. <verse eid="EZK 45:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 45:17"/>Tɔɔzei kundiɠii ɠa tosuʋɛ ɠɛɛzu ga é gala zalaɠaiti ma zɔɔlaiti fe, ta vebɛ zalaɠaiti, naa ʋɛɛ puya zalaɠaiti ba, ti ɠulazu fɛti voloiti, ta alu toga niinɛi ma vɛtiiti ma, naa ʋɛɛ dooɠo foloiti, ta zɔɔma voloiti kpein ba, Izilayɛle nuiti maanɛai ti ɠaalɛ ba ma. Kundiɠii ɠa maanɛai é koto gba zalaɠai ma zɔɔlaiti fe, ta vebɛ zalaɠai, ta gala zalaɠai, ta ziilɛi zalaɠai, nii a kɛ kotoi ma zuvaayɛgi zɔlɔɔ Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠei ʋɛ.›<verse eid="EZK 45:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 45:18"/>«Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Alu mɔungi ma volo mɔungi, wa nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila seɠe, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, wo kula ga zalaɠai, wo GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɲade da. <verse eid="EZK 45:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 45:19"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa koto gba zuai ma ɲamai zeɠe, kulaai ga zalaɠai, é siɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma laamasagiti ma, ta zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ woizuʋɛti ma ɠɔɠɔ naanigɔiti ma, ta koi ɠoozuʋɛ ziɠidaʋɛti ma laamasagiti ma. <verse eid="EZK 45:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 45:20"/>Alugi ma voloi lɔfelasiɛi ma, wa kɛ ɠana nɔ naama nui ʋɛ, zɔi a kotoi ɠɛ, é la gaaɠilini ma, ɓaa é la suɠwɛɛni. Wa GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɲade ga naa ɠɛai.<verse eid="EZK 45:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 45:21"/>« ‹Alu mɔungi ma volo puugɔ maazu naanisiɛi (14) ɠa ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga Pake fɛtii. Toɠa ga folo lɔfela vɛtii. Ɓului lɛʋɛ la su, naa ɠa wa ɠɛ miizu. <verse eid="EZK 45:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 45:22"/>Naama volo ná, kundiɠii ɠa nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpagi ɠula ga zalaɠai, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-kotoi gba vai ma, ta nuɓusɛiti pɛ ta-ɠotoiti gba vai ma. <verse eid="EZK 45:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 45:23"/>Fɛtii ma volo lɔfelaiti su, toɠa gala zalaɠai ma zɔɔlaiti fe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ ga, nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa dɔfela, ta baala sinɛ lɔfela, niiti nɛɛʋuzu la ti ʋa. Folo lɔfelai laawu, toɠa boli zinɛ ɠila fe ga zalaɠai folo-o-folo, koto gba vai zu. <verse eid="EZK 45:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 45:24"/>Naa ʋolu toɠa vebɛ zalaɠai ve ga moloi kilo ʋuusaʋagɔ (30), ta gulɔi litɛlɛ lɔzita ti ɓɔ nikɛ zinɛi ɠilagilagi ta baala sinɛi ɠilagilagiti ba.<verse eid="EZK 45:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 45:25"/>« ‹Fɛtii tɔɔzeizu alugi lɔfelasiɛi ma volo puugɔ maazu lɔɔlusiɛi (15) ma, kundiɠii ɠa kɛ nɔ mɔnɔ, eɠɛ pelegi é kɛɛni la Pake fɛtii zu, folo lɔfelai naa ɠilagilagi pɛ su, toɠa ma zalaɠai ma ziiti nɔ ve koto gba vai ma, ta gala zalaɠaiti, ta vebɛ zalaɠaiti, é ɓɔ gulɔi ʋa.› »<verse eid="EZK 45:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="EZK 46"/>
  <para style="s">Dooɠo foloi ta alu niinɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 46:1"/>«Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Koi zaamaʋɛ ma ziɠidaʋɛ, gaaʋotegai folo ɠulazu ʋelei ma, daaɠulugai ɠa ɗa yɛ de, folo lɔzitai pɛ daawu botii ɠɛɛzu ma, kɛlɛ daa ɠa ɗa lao dooɠo foloi, ta alu toga niinɛi ma vɛti yeei. <verse eid="EZK 46:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 46:2"/>Kundiɠii ɠa ʋa, é zeɠe ga koi wolai zu ʋele, é leʋe tɛɛ wosuʋɛ ná siɠidaʋɛ ɠobaʋɛ, é lo daamasagi ɠoba. Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti ná-zalaɠaiti kula bɛ, gala zalaɠai ta ziilɛi zalaɠai. Toɠa nɔkɔ kpofalagi wuʋɛ, naa ʋolu é ɠale ma. Siɠidaʋɛ laa mina ɠulu eyɛsu kpɔkɔi zeeli. <verse eid="EZK 46:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 46:3"/>Dooɠo foloi ta alu toga niinɛi ma vɛti yeei, nuɓusɛiti ta ʋa, ti nɔkɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wu nu lɛɛzuʋɛ, naama ziɠidaʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 46:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 46:4"/>« ‹Gala zalaɠai kundiɠii a fe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, dooɠo foloi, toɠa ɠɛ ga baala ziʋo lɔzita, niiti nɛɛʋuzu la ti ʋa, ta baala sinɛ wola ɠila, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba. <verse eid="EZK 46:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 46:5"/>Ná-vebɛ zalaɠai a kpɔ baala sinɛ wolai ʋa, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga moloi nii daa ga ɓeleegi, kilo ʋuusaʋagɔ (30). Vebɛ zalaɠai liegɔi a nɛɛ bɛ, naa ɠa a kpɔ baala ziʋoiti ba, é ɓɔ gulɔi litɛlɛ lɔzita ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 46:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 46:6"/>Alu toga niinɛi ma vɛti voloi, toɠa nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpagi ɠula ga zalaɠai, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, ta baala ziʋo lɔzita, naa ʋɛɛ baala sinɛ wola ɠila ba, niiti nɛɛʋuzu la ti ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 46:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 46:7"/>Kundiɠii ɠa moloi kilo ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ɓɔ nikɛ zinɛi ta baala sinɛi ɠilagilagi ʋa ga vebɛ zalaɠai. Nii liegɔi a nɛɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ʋɛ moloi zu, é naa ʋɛɛ baala ziʋoiti ba. Toɠa gulɔ litɛlɛ lɔzita ɓɔ moloi ma ɠilo ʋuuzaʋasaʋagiti (30) ba.› »<verse eid="EZK 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔgiti é ʋilɛ kundiɠii lɛɛ ʋelei <optbreak/> ta kula ʋelei ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 46:8"/>« ‹Siɛgi zu kundiɠii lɛɛzu la, toɠa lɛ tɛɛ wosuʋɛ naa siɠidaʋɛ ɠobaʋɛ, é ɠale ma ga ma ʋele ɠilagi nɔ. <verse eid="EZK 46:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 46:9"/>Kɛlɛ tama, siɛgi zu nuɓusɛiti ti ʋaazu la fɛti voloiti, ga ti nɔkɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wu, zɔi a lɛɛna ga nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei ma ziɠidaʋɛ ga é nɔkɔ, naa ɠa ɠula ga nu yeezazu ʋelei ma ziɠida ʋelei. Zɔi a lɛɛna ga nu yeezazu ʋelei ma ziɠida ʋelei, naa ɠa ɠula ga nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei ma ziɠida ʋelei. Nu nɔpɛ ge mina ɠula ga siɠida ʋelei nii tɛai la, kɛlɛ kɛni ɛsɛ ge ɠula ga zɔɔma ziɠida ʋelei ti laa letegai ɓɔɠɔ ma. <verse eid="EZK 46:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 46:10"/>Kundiɠii ta nuɓusɛiti ta lɛ ʋɔɔma, ti ɠula ʋɔɔma, ti li.› »<verse eid="EZK 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zalaɠai zɔiti kula ʋelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 46:11"/>« ‹Fɛti voloiti ta gaalɛba ɲadegaiti, vebɛ zalaɠai ɠa ɠɛ ga moloi kilo ʋuusaʋagɔ (30), naa ɠa é ɓɔsu nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpagi ʋa, moloi kilo ʋuusaʋagɔ (30), naa ɠa é ɓɔsu baala sinɛ wolai ʋa é ɠulazu ga zalaɠai. Baala ziʋoiti tetemazu, ɛsɛ ka vebɛ zalaɠai ɓɔ ba nii nɛai bɛ, gulɔi litɛlɛ lɔzita, naa ɠa é ɓɔsu moloi kilo ʋuuzaʋasaʋagiti (30) ba.<verse eid="EZK 46:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 46:12"/>« ‹Ni kundiɠii a daana ɠisu ga é zalaɠa ɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é ɠɛni ga gala zalaɠai, ɓaa ziilɛi zalaɠai, maanɛɛʋɛ ti siɠidaʋɛ laalao tuɠɔ, nii é folo ɠulazu ʋelei. Toɠa ná-zalaɠaiti kula, eɠɛʋelei dooɠo foloi ma geleiti ta ɗa ɠɛ la. A zeɠena ná, é li feya, ti siɠidaʋɛ laaɠulu.<verse eid="EZK 46:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 46:13"/>« ‹Folo-o-folo, ɗa gala zalaɠai ɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ ga kona gila baala ziʋoi, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, ɗa ɗa vebɛanii naa ɠula sobu-o-sobu. <verse eid="EZK 46:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 46:14"/>Sobu-o-sobu, ɗa vebɛ zalaɠai ɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ga ɓulu vukɔi kilo lɔɔlugɔ, é zupu ga gulɔi litɛlɛ felegɔ. Tɔgi ɠana é ʋilɛ vebɛanii ʋa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ɗa yɛ kɛɛzu folo-o-folo eyɛsu ɠɔ. <verse eid="EZK 46:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 46:15"/>Baala ziʋoi ta ɓulu vukɔi, ta gulɔi, ti maanɛɛʋɛ ti yɛ ɠulazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ ga gala zalaɠai folo-o-folo.› »<verse eid="EZK 46:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kundiɠii ná-poganii lɔɔ ʋeleiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 46:16"/>«Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Ni kundiɠii a ná-zooi ná ta veena ná-doun zunui ta ʋɛ, naa tɔna é feai bɛ, naa ɠa lɔ doun zunui naa ná-poganii zu, é ɠɛ ga poganii naa ná-dointi ta-ʋoganii zu. <verse eid="EZK 46:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 46:17"/>Kɛlɛ ni kundiɠii a ná-zooi ta veena ná-botiɠɛ nui ta ʋɛ, vebɛanii naa ɠa ɠɛ ga botiɠɛ nui nɔnɔ eyɛsu ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi zeeli, naa ʋolu toɠa gaaɠale ma ʋolu, é fe kundiɠii ya. Ná-poganii ɠa ga ná-dointi gila nɔ tɔnɔ. <verse eid="EZK 46:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 46:18"/>Kɛlɛ tama, kundiɠii mina nuɓusɛiti ta-ʋogani nɔpɛ seɠe zea, é mina loo nu ma, é ʋa ná-pogani yooi zeɠe. Tɔ ɓɔɠɔ ná-zooi ɠa a ná-dointi ta-ʋoganii ɓɛtɛ su, nii a ɠɛ ga ɛsɛ nɔnɔ, naa ɠa a kɛ nà-nuɓusɛiti saama, nu nɔpɛ maa mina ɠooza ná-pogani yooi ʋa.› »<verse eid="EZK 46:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma laaɠoli wosuʋɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 46:19"/>Zunui loni tùɠɔ, gi lɛ nu lɛɛzuʋɛ, ná siɠidaʋɛ ɠobaʋɛ, gi li pɛlɛ ɲadegaiti pɔ bɛ, ti ná zalaɠa ɠula nuiti faa ma, ti ɠaaʋotegai nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei ma. É adaʋɛ ta lɛɛni ga ze, ná buu ʋele nuu, folo liizu ʋelei. <verse eid="EZK 46:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 46:20"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Adaʋɛ ɠa, ʋɛ zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta ɠɛ faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠa zuaiti gilizu ná, ta koto gba zalaɠaiti, ta ɠɛ vebɛ zalaɠaiti geesu ná ɓalaagi. Naazu ti la ɠula ga tiye eteaʋɛ, ʋɛ ta-vɔɔɠubai a zoo nuɓusɛiti ɲadesu ná.»<verse eid="EZK 46:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 46:21"/>Naa ʋolu é liini ga ze koi wolai zu, é leʋe ga ze koizuʋɛ ma zoko naanigɔiti pɔ bɛti, gè pɛtɛni ga koi wola ma zoko naanigɔiti pɛ su, <verse eid="EZK 46:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 46:22"/>koi ɠoozuʋɛ ɠɛni náti pɛ siɠigi ti ma ti laaɠulugai, ti pɛ ti ɠɛni tie, ti-zakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa ʋuunaanigɔ (40), ti-ɠogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa ʋuusaʋagɔ (30). <verse eid="EZK 46:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 46:23"/>Kɔtu zasai ɠakuni ti naanigɔ ma. Daaɠoli wosuʋɛ ɠɛni ti ʋa, ti ʋoluzei sasai ʋa é ɠaku ma. <verse eid="EZK 46:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 46:24"/>Zunui ɠɛni mà: «Daaɠoli wosuʋɛti be, mináti ka GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu wotiɠɛ nuiti ta ɠɛ nuɓusɛiti ta-zalaɠa zuaiti gilizu ná.»<verse eid="EZK 46:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="EZK 47"/>
  <para style="s">Ziɛ wolai é ɠɛni ɠulazu <optbreak/> GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 47:1"/>Zunui liini ga ze nu lɛɛzuʋɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. Gè ziɛi ɠaani, é ɗa ɠula GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wuʋɛ nu lɛɛzuʋɛ folo ɠulazu ʋelei, mazɔlɔɔ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠaaʋoteni folo ɠulazu ʋelei ma. Ziɛi ɠɛni ɠulazu ga GALA sei ʋɛlɛi yeezazu ʋelei, é ɗa leʋe ga lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋelei zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma vaa ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 47:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 47:2"/>É ɠulani ga ze ga nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋele ziɠidaʋɛ ʋɔ pelei, gi latini koizuʋɛ ma, gi li folo ɠulazu ʋelei ma ziɠidaʋɛ. Miná ɓalaa ziɛi ɠɛni ɠulazu ga lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋelei.<verse eid="EZK 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 47:3"/>É lago liini folo ɠulazu ʋelei, galui ɠɛni zea, é zeezakpa waagila (1.000) kɔɠɔni miná ʋele. É ɠɛni gi ziɛ ziɛi wu, gi ɓudɛ, ziɛi sòni tɛ̀ɛ ɠain ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 47:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 47:4"/>É zeezakpa waagila (1.000) kɔɠɔni ʋolu é zɛba é li ga ze ziɛi wu, ziɛi sòni ɲìibizuʋɛ. É zeezakpa waagila (1.000) kɔɠɔni mɔnɔ, é li ga ze ziɛ wu, ziɛi sòni sàamaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 47:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 47:5"/>É zeezakpa waagila (1.000) kɔɠɔni mɔnɔ, kɛlɛ gè la zooni gè ʋa ɓudɛ, mazɔlɔɔ ziɛi wuuzeini gola, kɛni nu a la lase ga. É ɠɛni niina ga kɔtuɗɛ wolai, nu la ɓena maazuɓudɛ. <verse eid="EZK 47:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 47:6"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ʋe, zunui, è kaani?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 47:6">É loni tùɠɔ, é li ga ze kɔtuɗɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 47:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 47:7"/>Gè kaani miná ga gulu wolai mɔinni ziɛlaʋɛ ná felegɔ pɛ. <verse eid="EZK 47:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 47:8"/>É nii ɠaalɛɛni ga ze, é ɠɛ ma: «Kɔtuɗɛi nii ɠa liizu folo ɠulazu ʋelei zooi letema ʋelei, é yei Zuludɛn ma ʋɛtu nɛmɛi zu, é ʋilɛ Kpoloɗɛ Wanai ʋa. Siɛgi zu é ʋuuzu la Kpoloɗɛ Wanai ma, toɠa ma ɗɛi valibo, é niinɛ ʋolu. <verse eid="EZK 47:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 47:9"/>Ziɛ wu anii kpein ka zɛnvui wo adaʋɛ pɛ, ʋɛ ziɛi nii zeelizu ná, kaleiti ta ɓuɠu gola, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa kpoloɗɛi niinɛ, ʋɛti é zeelizu náti. Ziɛi nii ɠa zɛnvui ve miná pɛ, ʋɛ é zeelizu ná. <verse eid="EZK 47:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 47:10"/>Naazu kale ɓɛɛ nuiti ta ɠɛ losu ziɛlaʋɛti. É zo En-Gedi é zeeli En-Egelayime, ta ɠɛ ta-lumɔiti suviesu ná pɛ ga ti vɔ. Naama ɠaleiti ta ɠɛ ga kpoloɗɛ wolai wu ɠalei ma ziiti, ti mɔin gola. <verse eid="EZK 47:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 47:11"/>Ba ɓoigiti ta ma ɓekegiti ti la niinaa, ti ʋa ɲade, kpoloi ɠa yɛ naati ba ɠana nɔ. <verse eid="EZK 47:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 47:12"/>Gwaa wului ma zii pɛ ka ʋɔnɔ kɔtuɗɛi laaʋɛ felegɔi pɛ. Ti-ɠaalaagiti ti la vɔa eyɛsu pɛ, ti-ɠaawaaiti ti la ɓega eyɛsu pɛ. Alu-o-alu nii seeliai, naa ɠa ɗa ɠula ga, ma niinɛi ɗa ʋu ga, mazɔlɔɔ GALA seizu ɲadegai ɠa ziɛi zeɠezu ná, é ɗa ti ɠɔ. Ti-ɠaawaai ɠa ɠɛ ga daamianigi, ti-ɠaalaagiti ta ɠɛ ga nu ɠɛdɛ salei.»<verse eid="EZK 47:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zooi ɠwɛmaʋɛ ta gaaɠwɛɛ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 47:13"/>Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: «Nà zooi ɠwɛgiti dɛɛzu ga woye nii Izilayɛle woloda puugɔ maazu felegɔi (12) ʋaazu ɠaaɠwɛɛzu ʋa. Zozɛfe ná-bolodai ɠa felegɔ zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 47:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 47:14"/>Wa zooi ɠaaɠwɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋa ga lietie. Eɠɛʋelei gè ɠonani la wo-mɛmɛwolani bɛ ga nà feezu ti ya, zooi nii gaaɠwɛɛzu wo ʋa ga poganii.<verse eid="EZK 47:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 47:15"/>«Zooi ma ɠwɛmaʋɛ ɠa ga nii: Nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, é zo Kpoloɗɛ Wolai ma, é ziɛ ga pelei é leʋesu Etilon, é li Sedade, <verse eid="EZK 47:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 47:16"/>Ɠamate, Ɓelota, Sibalayime, Damase ɠwɛpelemaʋɛ ta Ɠamate, ta Ɠasɛl-Tikɔn gelei, maaɓuɠaai Awulan ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 47:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 47:17"/>Kwɛpelemaʋɛ ɠa zosu Kpoloɗɛ Wolai ʋa, é li Ɠasaal-Enon, folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é ɠwɛ Damase ɠwɛpelemaʋɛ ʋa ta Ɠamate. Naa ɠa a ɠɛ ga nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei ma ɠwɛgi.<verse eid="EZK 47:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 47:18"/>«Folo ɠulazu ʋelei ma ɠwɛgi ɠa ɠɛ Awulan ta Damase ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ, é leʋe ga Zuludɛn ma ʋɛtugi zu ʋele, Galaade ɠoʋii ta Izilayɛle yooi ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ, eyɛsu é zei Kpoloɗɛ Wanai ʋa. Naa ɠa a ɠɛ ga folo ɠulazu ʋelei ma ɠwɛgi.<verse eid="EZK 47:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 47:19"/>«Lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋelei, kwɛmaʋɛ ɠa zo Tamaal, é zeeli Meliɓa ɗɛiti ma, Kadɛse, naa ʋolu é lɛ ga Ezipete ɠɔtuɗɛi, é lo Kpoloɗɛ Wolai ʋa. Naa ɠa a ɠɛ ga nu yeezazu ʋelei ma ɠwɛgi.<verse eid="EZK 47:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 47:20"/>«Folo liizu ʋele ɠwɛgi ɠa ɠɛ ga Kpoloɗɛ Wolai, é zo nu yeezazuʋɛ ma ɠwɛpelemaʋɛ, eyɛsu é zei Leɓo-Ɠamate ʋa nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ. Naa ɠa a ɠɛ ga folo liizu ʋelei ma ɠwɛgi.<verse eid="EZK 47:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 47:21"/>«Wa niima yooi ɠaaɠwɛ Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ba ga bolodama ʋelei. <verse eid="EZK 47:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 47:22"/>Wa gaaɠwɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋa ga kpakutoomai. À mina yeema seikɔɠɔma nuiti ma ti zeini wo zaama, ti ʋaazu dointi sɔlɔɔsu wa-yooi zu. Wa naati so ga ɠɛʋele ta Izilayɛle nuiti, eɠɛ zou lointi, ti tɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ zooi zu Izilayɛle wolodamaiti su. <verse eid="EZK 47:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 47:23"/>Bolodamai nii ma nu zeini su, miná ɠa a nɔnɔi zɔlɔɔ ná,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 47:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="EZK 48"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 48:1"/>«Bolodamaiti daaseigiti pɛtɛ ta tɔnɔi ti sɔlɔɔsu: Dan nɔnɔi ɠa ɠɛɛzu gaaɓelasuʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, pelei laaʋɛ è leʋesu Etilon, Leɓo-Ɠamate ta Ɠasaal-Enon, Damase ta Amate masadaiti koba ʋelei, suvie folo ɠulazu ʋelei ɠwɛmaʋɛ, eyɛsu é zei Kpoloɗɛ Wolai ʋa, folo liizu ʋelei. <verse eid="EZK 48:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 48:2"/>Dan nɔnɔi ɠwɛgi zakpai ma é zo folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é li folo liizu ʋelei, miná ɠa Asɛɛl nɔnɔi a ɠɛ ná. <verse eid="EZK 48:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 48:3"/>Asɛɛl nɔnɔi ɠwɛgi zakpai ma é zo folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é li folo liizu ʋelei, miná ɠa Nɛfɛtali nɔnɔi a ɠɛ ná. <verse eid="EZK 48:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 48:4"/>Nɛfɛtali nɔnɔi ɠwɛgi zakpai ma é zo folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é li folo liizu ʋelei, miná ɠa Manasé nɔnɔi a ɠɛ ná. <verse eid="EZK 48:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 48:5"/>Manasé nɔnɔi ɠwɛgi zakpai ma é zo folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é li folo liizu ʋelei, miná ɠa Efelayime nɔnɔi a ɠɛ ná. <verse eid="EZK 48:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 48:6"/>Efelayime nɔnɔi ɠwɛgi zakpai ma é zo folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é li folo liizu ʋelei, miná ɠa Luɓɛn nɔnɔi a ɠɛ ná. <verse eid="EZK 48:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 48:7"/>Luɓɛn nɔnɔi ɠwɛgi zakpai ma é zo folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é li folo liizu ʋelei, miná ɠa Zuda nɔnɔi a ɠɛ ná.<verse eid="EZK 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA nɔnɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 48:8"/>«Zuda nɔnɔi ɠwɛgi zakpai ma, é zo folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é zei Kpoloɗɛ Wolai ʋa folo liizu ʋelei, wa zooi ta leʋe ba, kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa waaʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25.000), sakpai ɠɛ ga bolodamaiti tɔnɔi zɔligɔi. Zaamazuʋɛ ɠa GALA seizu ɲadegai a ɓɛtɛ ná. <verse eid="EZK 48:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 48:9"/>Ʋɛ wo ná leʋezu ba ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔi, sakpai ɠa ɠɛ ga zeezakpa waaʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25.000), kogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa waaʋuufelegɔ (20.000). <verse eid="EZK 48:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 48:10"/>Naama you ɲadegai ɠa ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti tɔnɔ, zeezakpa waaʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25.000), é zo folo ɠulazu, é li folo liizu, é ɠɛ ga zeezakpa waapuugɔ (10.000), é zo nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei é li nu yeezazu ʋelei. Zaamazuʋɛ ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zeizu ɲadegai a lo ná. <verse eid="EZK 48:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 48:11"/>Naama yooi ɠa ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti tɔnɔ, niiti ti veai GALA botiɠɛ vai ma, Sadɔke mavofodaiti. Ti ɠaaɓaani nà-botiɠɛ vai ma, ti la ɠɛni ɠakani, siɛgi zu Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠakani da, eɠɛʋelei Levi nuiti ti ɠakani da. <verse eid="EZK 48:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 48:12"/>Naa ɠa ɠɛ ga tɔnɔ ga adaʋɛ ná wola ɲadegai, seɠeai zooi ʋɔ bɛ ʋa, ʋɛ ná makɛgai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-faa ma, Levi nuiti tɔnɔi ma ɠwɛpelemaʋɛ ɠobaʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 48:13"/>«Levi nuiti tɔnɔi ɠa ɠɛ nɔ zalaɠa ɠula nuiti tɔnɔi ɠoba. Ti felegɔ pɛ ti-zakpaiti ta ɠɛ ga zeezakpa waaʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25.000), ti-ɠogi ɠɛ ga zeezakpa waapuugɔ (10.000). <verse eid="EZK 48:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 48:14"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta Levi nuiti ti la zooga ti ʋa ta ʋɔdi, ɓaa ti ʋa maavalibo, ɓaa ti ʋa dɔ ga ziingao, mazɔlɔɔ zooi naa ɠa fizɔgai zɔiti pɛ ba, feeʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="EZK 48:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taai ta kundiɠiiti tɔnɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 48:15"/>«Naama yooi zu makɛgai, toɠa yɛsu na ga zeezakpa waadɔɔlugɔ (5.000) kogi zu, zeezakpa waaʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25.000) sakpai zu. Naa ɠa ɠɛ ga kiti yooi, é ga taai nɔnɔ, ta taaʋeaiti, ta ti-ʋaalobaiti, taai ɠa ɠɛ zaamazuʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 48:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 48:16"/>Toɠa ɠɛ ga seki naanigi, zeezakpa waanaanigɔ undɔɔlugɔ (4.500) nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ ta nu yeezazuʋɛ, naa ʋɛɛ folo ɠulazu ʋelei ʋa ta folo liizu ʋelei. <verse eid="EZK 48:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 48:17"/>Ada ɲakai ɠa yɛ ná, taai ɠakama naanigɔi pɛ, é ɠaku ma, suwɔɔlɔ ga zeezakpa unfelegɔ puulɔɔlugɔ (250). <verse eid="EZK 48:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 48:18"/>Zooi makɛgai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI vaa ma, ta ɠa yɛsu ʋoluzu sakpai ma folo ɠulazu ʋelei ta folo liizu ʋelei ga zeezakpa waa ʋuupuu (10.000). Miná ɠa daamianigi maanɛai é ɠaiziɛ ná taaʋeaiti faa ma. <verse eid="EZK 48:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 48:19"/>Botiɠɛ nuiti kpein ti ʋaazu ti ɠula Izilayɛle wolodamaiti pɛ su, ta ɠɛ tii ɠɛɛzu ná. <verse eid="EZK 48:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 48:20"/>Zooi pɛ makɛgai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI vaa ma, toɠa ɠɛ ga seki naanigi zeezakpa waaʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25.000), sakpai ta kogi. Wa ta ɠula zou ɲadegai naa ʋa ga seki naani kpuɠagi, ná ɠɛ ga taai nɔnɔ ma yooi.<verse eid="EZK 48:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 48:21"/>«Zɔi é yɛsu, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga kundiɠii nɔnɔi. Ná-zooi ɠa ɠɛ zooi ɠakamaʋɛti felegɔ, nii makɛgai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-faa ma, ta taai ʋuuzu vai. Toɠa la zɔiti sakpaiti daaʋɛ, ga zeezakpa waaʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25.000), folo ɠulazu ʋele ɠwɛgi ma, eyɛsu folo liizu ʋelei, é ʋilɛ Kpoloɗɛ Wolai ʋa. Naa ɠa a kɛ zooi nii feai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ta GALA seizu ɲadegai, naati ti yɛ zooi zaamaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 48:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 48:22"/>Kundiɠii ná-zooi ɠa ɠɛ Levi nuiti ta taai ʋuuzuʋɛ ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ, é ɠɛ Zuda ná-zou ɠwɛgi ma nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, ta Ɓɛnzamɛn nɔnɔi ma nu yeezazu ʋelei.<verse eid="EZK 48:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bolodamaiti tɔnɔi nu yeezazu ʋelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 48:23"/>«Wɛlɛ bolodamai zɔiti tɔnɔiti ba. Ɓɛnzamɛn nɔnɔi lɔɔ ɠa zeizu kwɛpelegi ma folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é kpoloɗɛ wolai ʋa folo liizu ʋelei. <verse eid="EZK 48:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 48:24"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn nɔnɔi ɠwɛgi zakpai ma é zo folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é li folo liizu ʋelei, miná ɠa Simiyɔn nɔnɔi a ɠɛ ná. <verse eid="EZK 48:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 48:25"/>Simiyɔn nɔnɔi ɠwɛgi zakpai ma é zo folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é li folo liizu ʋelei, miná ɠa Isakaal nɔnɔi a ɠɛ ná. <verse eid="EZK 48:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 48:26"/>Isakaal nɔnɔi ɠwɛgi zakpai ma é zo folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é li folo liizu ʋelei, miná ɠa Zaɓulɔn nɔnɔi a ɠɛ ná. <verse eid="EZK 48:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 48:27"/>Zaɓulɔn nɔnɔi ɠwɛgi zakpai ma é zo folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é li folo liizu ʋelei, miná ɠa Gade nɔnɔi a ɠɛ ná. <verse eid="EZK 48:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 48:28"/>Gade ɠwɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ, miná ɠa zou ɠwɛgi a ɠɛ ná. Toɠa zo Tamaal folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é li Meliɓa ɗɛiti ma, Kadɛse, é lɛ ga Ezipete ɠɔtuɗɛi, é ʋilɛ Kpoloɗɛ Wolai ʋa. <verse eid="EZK 48:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 48:29"/>Zooi ɠana, wa gaaɠwɛ ga kpakutoomai Izilayɛle wolodaiti ba, ti ɠilagilagi tɔnɔiti kana ta sɔlɔɔ zooi zu,» Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="EZK 48:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taa ɲadegai ma ziɠidaʋɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 48:30"/>«Wɛlɛ ʋɛti ti ɠɛɛzu ga nu lɛɛzuʋɛti taazuʋɛ. Nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ siɠigi ʋa, sakpai ga zeezakpa waanaanigɔ undɔɔlugɔ (4.500), <verse eid="EZK 48:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 48:31"/>(Izilayɛle wolodamaiti daaseigiti ta ɠɛ taai ma ziɠidaʋɛti ma), siɠida saʋagɔ ɠɛni nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ ga Luɓɛn ná-siɠidaʋɛ, Zuda ná-siɠidaʋɛ, Levi ná-siɠidaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 48:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 48:32"/>Folo ɠulazu ʋelei, siɠigi zakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa waanaanigɔ undɔɔlugɔ (4.500), siɠidaʋɛ ɠɛni ba ga saʋagɔ, Zozɛfe ná-siɠidaʋɛ, Ɓɛnzamɛn ná-siɠidaʋɛ, Dan ná-siɠidaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 48:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 48:33"/>Nu yeezazu ʋele ziɠigi, zakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa waanaanigɔ undɔɔlugɔ (4.500) siɠidaʋɛ ɠɛni ba ga saʋagɔ, Simiyɔn ná-siɠidaʋɛ, Isakaal ná-siɠidaʋɛ, Zaɓulɔn ná-siɠidaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 48:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 48:34"/>Nu yeezazu ʋele ziɠigi, zakpai ɠɛni ga zeezakpa waanaanigɔ undɔɔlugɔ (4.500) siɠidaʋɛ ɠɛni ba ga saʋagɔ, Gade ná-siɠidaʋɛ, Asɛɛl ná-siɠidaʋɛ, Nɛfɛtali ná-siɠidaʋɛ. <verse eid="EZK 48:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 48:35"/>Siɠigi zakpai é ɠooli taai ma é ɠɛni ga zeezakpa waapuugɔ maazu lɔsaʋa (18.000). É zo naama voloi ma, taai laasei ka ʋɛɛ ga ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ʋɛ.› »<verse eid="EZK 48:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 48"/>
</usx>
